WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:44.250
RAMA KRISHNAN

2
00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:45.542
THEY SAY YOU ARE GONE.

3
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:47.958
WE DON'T BELIEVE IT.
YOU DON'T BELIEVE IT EITHER.

4
00:01:30.583 --> 00:01:31.958
LOVE IS GOD

5
00:01:32.042 --> 00:01:33.417
LOVE IS FULFILLMENT

6
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:34.875
LOVE IS HIDDEN

7
00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:38.500
LOVE IS THE ULTIMATE TRUTH

8
00:02:22.417 --> 00:02:23.417
What's going on. brother?

9
00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.476
You still haven't gone home.
and now you're sleeping here!

10
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.583
Do you want to come
and sleep with me in the shed?

11
00:02:27.708 --> 00:02:29.184
I'll even give you
the coconut leafstalk to eat.

12
00:02:29.208 --> 00:02:30.208
You can ask him yourself.

13
00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:33.095
When he first came here.
he was just a baby!

14
00:02:33.375 --> 00:02:34.895
He used to barely reach your shoulder.

15
00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.917
Now when you stand.
you're only as tall as his shoulder.

16
00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:41.458
I've fed him everything
to make him this tall and healthy.

17
00:02:42.042 --> 00:02:43.042
What do you say. baby?

18
00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:44.208
My fat baby!

19
00:02:44.417 --> 00:02:45.417
Fat baby!

20
00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.875
Grandpa. take him and go. It's late.

21
00:02:56.542 --> 00:02:57.375
He must be hungry.

22
00:02:57.458 --> 00:02:59.292
Go. my dear.

23
00:02:59.875 --> 00:03:00.875
Come on. let's go!

24
00:03:02.292 --> 00:03:03.292
Come on…

25
00:03:03.958 --> 00:03:04.958
- Grandpa.
- Come.

26
00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:08.625
We are leaving town permanently.

27
00:03:13.083 --> 00:03:14.292
We lost the house!

28
00:03:23.792 --> 00:03:25.792
Hey! Mozhi! Mozhi!

29
00:03:26.042 --> 00:03:27.042
Hey!

30
00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:30.625
Why is he walking away
without answering?

31
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.875
Hey. have this. Have this.

32
00:03:55.833 --> 00:03:59.250
<i>I'm leaving! I'm leaving!</i>

33
00:03:59.333 --> 00:04:02.417
<i>As a mere skeleton. I'm leaving!</i>

34
00:04:03.542 --> 00:04:10.542
<i>Toward the agonizing path. I leave!</i>

35
00:04:11.375 --> 00:04:14.458
<i>Where my childhood's free spirit
Danced in eternal joy!</i>

36
00:04:14.542 --> 00:04:18.708
<i>From my hometown. I stand separated!</i>

37
00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:22.542
<i>From the home
My ancestors built and protected</i>

38
00:04:22.625 --> 00:04:25.917
<i>I stand separated!</i>

39
00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:31.208
<i>I'm leaving! I'm leaving!</i>

40
00:04:31.292 --> 00:04:34.583
<i>As a mere skeleton. I'm leaving!</i>

41
00:04:35.625 --> 00:04:39.833
<i>Toward the agonizing path</i>

42
00:04:39.917 --> 00:04:43.208
<i>I leave!</i>

43
00:04:49.875 --> 00:04:51.035
Where the hell have you been?

44
00:04:51.708 --> 00:04:53.292
Have you blabbed anything to anyone?

45
00:04:55.333 --> 00:04:57.250
Sir. why are you
leaving at this hour

46
00:04:57.667 --> 00:04:59.125
without even informing me?

47
00:04:59.583 --> 00:05:03.042
- Uncle. when did you get here?
- I came a while ago.

48
00:05:03.458 --> 00:05:04.499
Where are you coming from?

49
00:05:07.292 --> 00:05:09.772
The wealth has been divided
and the house has been written off.

50
00:05:10.125 --> 00:05:12.083
When it's no longer ours… no point…

51
00:05:13.333 --> 00:05:14.833
Why should you leave our native then?

52
00:05:14.958 --> 00:05:16.833
- You can rent…
- You think. I…

53
00:05:17.417 --> 00:05:19.617
Our three generations have lived
in this house and town.

54
00:05:20.792 --> 00:05:23.042
Forget it. certain things cannot
be understood by words.

55
00:05:23.458 --> 00:05:24.778
Not that I don't understand. sir.

56
00:05:25.083 --> 00:05:28.792
But leaving this house is a
bigger blow for him than you.

57
00:05:29.625 --> 00:05:30.708
Just take care of him. sir.

58
00:05:44.833 --> 00:05:45.833
Mozhi.

59
00:05:47.708 --> 00:05:50.333
I am going to take Bhuvana
to Needamangalam.

60
00:05:50.833 --> 00:05:51.833
Why?

61
00:05:52.208 --> 00:05:53.458
Can't stay here. right?

62
00:05:53.708 --> 00:05:56.958
I've finalized a school there.
based on your dad's recommendation.

63
00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:10.958
<i>O' time are you being fair?</i>

64
00:06:11.792 --> 00:06:15.750
<i>Are my eyes witnessing a mirage?</i>

65
00:06:15.833 --> 00:06:20.250
<i>What could be the sin that I committed?</i>

66
00:06:20.792 --> 00:06:23.750
<i>A life of deceit surrounds me!</i>

67
00:06:23.833 --> 00:06:26.833
<i>A nurturing mother's lap</i>

68
00:06:27.792 --> 00:06:31.792
<i>Torn apart by the greed of kith and kin</i>

69
00:06:31.875 --> 00:06:34.625
<i>All the tomorrows</i>

70
00:06:34.833 --> 00:06:39.375
<i>Stand shattered!</i>

71
00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:43.792
<i>A kite that danced
Along with the thread!</i>

72
00:06:43.875 --> 00:06:47.542
<i>Now I am lost with a broken thread!</i>

73
00:06:47.917 --> 00:06:51.833
<i>Like an uprooted blooming tree</i>

74
00:06:51.917 --> 00:06:55.125
<i>I've become a tragic sight!</i>

75
00:06:55.833 --> 00:06:59.833
<i>Like a river that
Runs deep in the forest</i>

76
00:06:59.917 --> 00:07:03.417
<i>I am lost!</i>

77
00:07:03.833 --> 00:07:07.042
<i>Like a bird that ceases
To live in its own nest</i>

78
00:07:07.125 --> 00:07:10.458
<i>A refugee. I become!</i>

79
00:07:11.083 --> 00:07:14.500
<i>I'm leaving! I'm leaving!</i>

80
00:07:14.583 --> 00:07:17.708
<i>As a mere skeleton. I'm leaving!</i>

81
00:07:18.583 --> 00:07:23.000
<i>Towards the agonizing path</i>

82
00:07:23.083 --> 00:07:26.458
<i>I leave!</i>

83
00:07:59.708 --> 00:08:01.792
<i>What will I say?</i>

84
00:08:01.875 --> 00:08:03.833
<i>How will I comfort myself?</i>

85
00:08:03.917 --> 00:08:05.833
<i>This fatal curse!</i>

86
00:08:05.917 --> 00:08:07.708
<i>How will I change it?</i>

87
00:08:07.792 --> 00:08:09.708
<i>The conspiracy's path</i>

88
00:08:09.792 --> 00:08:11.750
<i>That's filled with darkness</i>

89
00:08:11.833 --> 00:08:14.667
<i>How will I shine the light?</i>

90
00:08:15.792 --> 00:08:17.750
<i>I leave today!</i>

91
00:08:17.833 --> 00:08:19.750
<i>But when will I be back?</i>

92
00:08:19.833 --> 00:08:23.625
<i>When will I return
To my own doorway?</i>

93
00:08:23.708 --> 00:08:27.750
<i>To rescue me back home</i>

94
00:08:27.833 --> 00:08:31.792
<i>When will I find an honest soul?</i>

95
00:08:31.875 --> 00:08:35.750
<i>Without the people of my land</i>

96
00:08:35.833 --> 00:08:39.083
<i>Will I lead a life?</i>

97
00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:43.792
<i>I am like a lonely bubble</i>

98
00:08:43.875 --> 00:08:46.083
<i>That never flows with the water!</i>

99
00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:53.500
You lock it.

100
00:09:17.625 --> 00:09:18.708
Give it to them. brother.

101
00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.292
Dirty rogues!

102
00:09:27.708 --> 00:09:29.018
I curse them from the bottom of my heart!

103
00:09:29.042 --> 00:09:30.583
- They won't live well!
- Sokkalingam!

104
00:09:31.708 --> 00:09:33.417
We have only lost our wealth.

105
00:09:34.292 --> 00:09:35.492
All of you are standing by us.

106
00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:38.042
Forget it. We'll find a way.

107
00:09:38.417 --> 00:09:40.458
What you say might come true!

108
00:09:41.375 --> 00:09:43.417
No matter what.
they are my siblings.

109
00:09:43.792 --> 00:09:46.976
That's the curse of the girl child. they
are mere puppets dancing to others' tunes!

110
00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.208
How can we curse them?

111
00:09:49.875 --> 00:09:51.250
Brother. you are an educated man.

112
00:09:51.917 --> 00:09:54.708
I can't be as mature as you.

113
00:09:56.667 --> 00:09:58.625
Forget about me!
Forget about you!

114
00:09:59.167 --> 00:10:00.167
What about him?

115
00:10:01.708 --> 00:10:04.542
This house was his world…
This town was his everything!

116
00:10:05.417 --> 00:10:06.708
Now all of a sudden.

117
00:10:07.375 --> 00:10:10.000
what will happen to my child?

118
00:10:19.625 --> 00:10:20.625
Hey…

119
00:10:25.708 --> 00:10:26.917
Why. brother?

120
00:10:27.083 --> 00:10:28.542
- Keep it.
- I have money.

121
00:10:28.917 --> 00:10:30.833
For the bus fare
and also get her something.

122
00:10:33.208 --> 00:10:35.333
Are you upset with me
because we lost the house?

123
00:10:35.625 --> 00:10:36.625
No. brother.

124
00:10:36.833 --> 00:10:40.458
If you're here. I'll make excuses
and come to see you once a week.

125
00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:42.958
I wonder if I can do that now.

126
00:10:43.042 --> 00:10:45.162
That's the only thing
I am feeling bad about. brother.

127
00:10:58.750 --> 00:10:59.750
Bhuvana.

128
00:11:01.292 --> 00:11:02.292
My dear…

129
00:11:02.833 --> 00:11:03.875
Shall I leave now?

130
00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.917
No. even I will come with you.

131
00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:09.542
Your brother is going to Madras. darling.

132
00:11:09.625 --> 00:11:10.792
I will also come.

133
00:11:13.167 --> 00:11:16.292
Tomorrow you have to go to school.
so go with Dad.

134
00:11:16.625 --> 00:11:17.833
When I come back.

135
00:11:17.917 --> 00:11:21.042
I will get you lots of chocolates
and clothes and come to visit you. okay?

136
00:11:21.208 --> 00:11:22.958
I don't want chocolates.

137
00:11:23.208 --> 00:11:25.000
I will also come with you.

138
00:11:25.083 --> 00:11:26.917
There will be a school in Madras.

139
00:11:27.125 --> 00:11:29.083
you and I can go
on the cycle together.

140
00:11:31.208 --> 00:11:32.208
Come. my darling.

141
00:11:32.875 --> 00:11:34.417
- Come.
- Go to Daddy.

142
00:11:35.333 --> 00:11:37.167
- Bhuvana…
- I want to go to my brother…

143
00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:39.167
- Come to me.
- I want to go to my brother.

144
00:11:43.125 --> 00:11:46.208
- Stop crying. baby…
- I want to go to my brother.

145
00:11:46.292 --> 00:11:47.292
Okay. dear.

146
00:11:55.458 --> 00:11:57.750
Arul. you come in the van
with all the things.

147
00:11:58.208 --> 00:11:59.929
Your mother. brother
and I will come by bus.

148
00:12:01.625 --> 00:12:03.250
- Have you loaded everything?
- Yes. sir.

149
00:12:03.333 --> 00:12:05.494
- Just take another look around the house.
- Okay. sir.

150
00:12:05.542 --> 00:12:06.458
We can't come back here again.

151
00:12:06.542 --> 00:12:07.851
- Okay. sir.
- Stop the vehicle if you need anything.

152
00:12:07.875 --> 00:12:09.756
- Do you want water or anything else?
- Brother.

153
00:12:09.875 --> 00:12:11.958
Sir. we forgot to load your son's cycle.

154
00:12:12.042 --> 00:12:13.125
Cycle?

155
00:12:13.792 --> 00:12:15.417
Arul. do you need it?

156
00:12:16.208 --> 00:12:17.208
Will you ride it?

157
00:12:24.708 --> 00:12:25.792
- No. Dad.
- Wait.

158
00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:27.530
Give it to someone who needs it.

159
00:12:28.375 --> 00:12:29.415
No. not needed. let it be.

160
00:12:29.583 --> 00:12:30.583
Brother.

161
00:12:31.125 --> 00:12:33.375
you take this or give it away to someone.

162
00:12:35.542 --> 00:12:36.417
Shall we leave?

163
00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:37.900
- Yes. you guys get started.
- Okay.

164
00:12:43.042 --> 00:12:50.042
K. SELVI

165
00:12:50.375 --> 00:12:53.792
<i>Go well!
Don't lose heart!</i>

166
00:12:53.875 --> 00:12:57.500
<i>Don't lose heart. son!</i>

167
00:12:57.875 --> 00:13:01.833
<i>For you. we'll wait!</i>

168
00:13:01.917 --> 00:13:05.917
<i>Go well and surely return!</i>

169
00:13:06.375 --> 00:13:13.375
<i>Go well!
Don't refrain from coming back. son!</i>

170
00:13:13.833 --> 00:13:17.792
<i>For you. we'll wait!</i>

171
00:13:17.875 --> 00:13:23.583
<i>Go well and surely return!</i>

172
00:13:40.833 --> 00:13:42.167
THANJAVUR BORDER ENDS

173
00:14:51.875 --> 00:14:53.196
I am going out of town for a day.

174
00:14:56.833 --> 00:14:58.593
I'll go today
and come back tomorrow morning.

175
00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.333
She will feed you guys
in the evening. okay?

176
00:15:03.583 --> 00:15:05.083
Not that I want to go.

177
00:15:06.542 --> 00:15:07.583
but I have to go!

178
00:15:10.542 --> 00:15:12.622
It's just for a day.
I will be back tomorrow morning.

179
00:15:13.083 --> 00:15:14.083
Okay?

180
00:15:28.583 --> 00:15:29.583
Hey!

181
00:15:29.708 --> 00:15:31.229
It's getting late. aren't you leaving?

182
00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.520
I was wondering if I should go or not.

183
00:15:37.042 --> 00:15:38.708
It's okay if my husband doesn't go.

184
00:15:39.375 --> 00:15:40.684
I'll be happy that he's taken a day off.

185
00:15:40.708 --> 00:15:43.349
I will cook his favorites for all
three meals and sit admiring him!

186
00:15:44.417 --> 00:15:45.875
But you're Bhuvana's brother.

187
00:15:46.167 --> 00:15:47.167
you have to go.

188
00:15:50.167 --> 00:15:52.448
For twenty years. you haven't
let anyone connect with you.

189
00:15:53.333 --> 00:15:55.734
now these are the only set of people.
who we can call family.

190
00:15:55.958 --> 00:15:58.792
How can you think twice
about going to their function?

191
00:16:01.208 --> 00:16:02.488
It's not an issue for you. Arul.

192
00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:04.583
Even after all this.
you'll stay the same…

193
00:16:05.125 --> 00:16:06.125
Alone

194
00:16:06.208 --> 00:16:07.208
and angry.

195
00:16:07.958 --> 00:16:09.279
There is nothing wrong with that.

196
00:16:09.708 --> 00:16:11.667
but you have a daughter.
hope you remember that.

197
00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:16.333
She won't have any aunts.
uncles. and cousins in the future.

198
00:16:16.667 --> 00:16:18.792
It will be just us.
does that work for you?

199
00:16:19.292 --> 00:16:22.917
There are dogs. cats. parrots.
and a lot of other things. right?

200
00:16:26.333 --> 00:16:28.413
Are you scared to go back
to your native place. Arul?

201
00:16:36.375 --> 00:16:39.875
I know how much you love
that town and that house.

202
00:16:41.792 --> 00:16:45.125
Are you scared you will become
emotional and break down if you go there?

203
00:16:50.125 --> 00:16:52.125
Shall I hand-hold you carefully
and take you there?

204
00:16:57.792 --> 00:16:58.792
I will go.

205
00:17:03.292 --> 00:17:04.292
Hey. Valli! Bye!

206
00:17:04.375 --> 00:17:05.792
Hey! Come here.

207
00:17:07.375 --> 00:17:08.250
What?

208
00:17:08.333 --> 00:17:10.917
Don't look so grumpy
before going to our hometown.

209
00:17:11.708 --> 00:17:14.083
Don't get into any arguments
with anyone there.

210
00:17:14.833 --> 00:17:16.674
Just go and come back
without creating a scene.

211
00:17:17.167 --> 00:17:19.833
Oxygen molecule… double covalent bond.

212
00:17:20.708 --> 00:17:23.667
Make a note of everything and we will be…

213
00:17:26.125 --> 00:17:27.125
Arul.

214
00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:32.000
Arul.

215
00:17:34.958 --> 00:17:37.518
You can catch the train in the afternoon.
Why are you leaving now?

216
00:17:37.542 --> 00:17:38.833
The reception's in the evening.

217
00:17:38.917 --> 00:17:40.601
What will you even do
there after going now?

218
00:17:40.625 --> 00:17:42.625
I just thought I would
take a look around our town.

219
00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.833
I am in two minds whether to go or not.

220
00:17:48.625 --> 00:17:50.583
No. no. you go and come.

221
00:17:52.833 --> 00:17:54.913
What will you say. if they
ask you why I didn't come?

222
00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.480
- Shall I say you have a fever?
- Hey!

223
00:17:56.958 --> 00:17:59.279
- Shall I say grandmother died?
- Hey! Stop fooling around.

224
00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:01.559
No one will ask
why you didn't come…

225
00:18:01.583 --> 00:18:02.833
If they do. I will manage. Dad!

226
00:18:05.333 --> 00:18:06.476
Why are you not wearing your watch?

227
00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:07.500
I have my mobile.

228
00:18:08.833 --> 00:18:10.873
You're going to a wedding.
shouldn't you look smart?

229
00:18:12.333 --> 00:18:13.625
Is this your idea of "smart"?

230
00:18:14.167 --> 00:18:15.167
Wear it.

231
00:18:18.167 --> 00:18:19.667
- Wear it properly.
- I'll do it.

232
00:18:20.375 --> 00:18:21.375
Careful.

233
00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:23.042
- Go safely.
- Okay. bye.

234
00:18:23.292 --> 00:18:24.292
Call me after you reach.

235
00:20:29.083 --> 00:20:31.917
THANJAVUR CORPORATION
BUS DEPOT

236
00:20:46.083 --> 00:20:48.292
OUR LADY OF LOURDES

237
00:20:54.042 --> 00:20:55.333
Stop right here.

238
00:20:56.875 --> 00:20:57.875
Thanks.

239
00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:29.417
Brother. there is someone at the gate.
check who it is.

240
00:21:40.542 --> 00:21:41.542
It's 203.

241
00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:42.750
Oh. sorry.

242
00:21:42.833 --> 00:21:43.833
Thanks.

243
00:22:08.750 --> 00:22:09.750
<i>I haven't started yet.</i>

244
00:22:10.333 --> 00:22:11.167
I am still in Thanjavur.

245
00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:12.268
GODDESS ANBIRPIRIYAL TEMPLE

246
00:22:12.292 --> 00:22:13.292
Still?

247
00:22:13.792 --> 00:22:15.750
It's getting late. leave soon.

248
00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:17.000
Why?

249
00:22:17.542 --> 00:22:19.582
To go there early and bump
into some unwanted faces?

250
00:22:20.208 --> 00:22:22.143
These are the people I never
wanted to see again in my life.

251
00:22:22.167 --> 00:22:23.417
I only came for Bhuvana's sake.

252
00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:25.434
I will only meet her and leave.

253
00:22:25.458 --> 00:22:26.458
<i>Hey!</i>

254
00:22:26.583 --> 00:22:27.958
Why are you talking like this?

255
00:22:28.042 --> 00:22:29.042
Then what?

256
00:22:29.667 --> 00:22:30.867
She's to be blamed for it all.

257
00:22:31.208 --> 00:22:32.643
To top it off. she texted me
while I was on my way…

258
00:22:32.667 --> 00:22:34.467
"I am not sure if you're
really coming or not."

259
00:22:34.583 --> 00:22:36.143
I'll wait at the reception.
if you don't turn up.

260
00:22:36.167 --> 00:22:38.527
I won't get married to him."
She's literally threatening me.

261
00:22:39.458 --> 00:22:42.042
She's quite capable of doing it.
After all. she's your sister.

262
00:22:43.542 --> 00:22:46.292
<i>Fine! What all have you done
since you reached?</i>

263
00:22:46.375 --> 00:22:47.208
Nothing much.

264
00:22:47.375 --> 00:22:49.295
I booked a room at
the Philomina Lodge and slept.

265
00:22:50.417 --> 00:22:53.177
I am probably the first person to
stay at a lodge in his own hometown.

266
00:22:53.833 --> 00:22:54.833
Okay.

267
00:22:57.792 --> 00:22:58.792
<i>Where are you right now?</i>

268
00:22:59.375 --> 00:23:00.375
I've come to the temple.

269
00:23:01.458 --> 00:23:02.779
This alone has remained the same.

270
00:23:21.042 --> 00:23:22.562
<i>When he first came here.
he was a baby!</i>

271
00:23:23.458 --> 00:23:24.898
<i>He used to just reach your shoulder.</i>

272
00:23:25.708 --> 00:23:28.333
<i>Now when you stand.
you're only as tall as his shoulder.</i>

273
00:23:32.292 --> 00:23:33.772
Arul. are you there?
Where did you go?

274
00:23:35.917 --> 00:23:36.917
Nothing.

275
00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:39.831
<i>Honestly. even though I came
because I had no choice.</i>

276
00:23:40.583 --> 00:23:43.667
it feels so good to see my hometown
after so many years.

277
00:23:44.042 --> 00:23:46.167
Then why don't you stay
for two days and come?

278
00:23:46.833 --> 00:23:51.042
But. our house owner was saying
he's planning to sell this house.

279
00:23:52.042 --> 00:23:54.002
so by then we will have to look
for another house.

280
00:23:54.167 --> 00:23:55.458
We should like the new house.

281
00:23:56.333 --> 00:23:57.894
They need to permit us
to keep the pets.

282
00:23:58.250 --> 00:23:59.450
The rent should be affordable.

283
00:23:59.708 --> 00:24:02.469
It should be within a three-kilometer
radius of our daughter's school.

284
00:24:02.708 --> 00:24:04.476
We'll have to change all
the address proof documents.

285
00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:05.375
Just thinking about all this is…

286
00:24:05.458 --> 00:24:06.500
Oh. God!

287
00:24:06.833 --> 00:24:08.309
We will cross the bridge
when we get to it.

288
00:24:08.333 --> 00:24:09.833
Don't start whining now…

289
00:24:10.583 --> 00:24:12.083
and add to the existing stress.

290
00:24:14.167 --> 00:24:16.542
He said that he was just thinking
about selling the house.

291
00:24:16.917 --> 00:24:18.437
We will deal with it when he sells it.

292
00:24:18.708 --> 00:24:19.708
I really don't know.

293
00:24:20.083 --> 00:24:22.167
Our destiny with houses
has always been a disaster.

294
00:24:23.833 --> 00:24:26.794
What if he suddenly comes in the middle
of the night and asks us to vacate?

295
00:24:28.458 --> 00:24:31.099
That's why I've been thinking
whether to look for another house or…

296
00:24:33.917 --> 00:24:35.042
I haven't even told you yet.

297
00:24:36.333 --> 00:24:37.333
What is it?

298
00:24:43.208 --> 00:24:45.292
Whether we should
just buy this house…

299
00:24:46.167 --> 00:24:47.167
Hey!

300
00:24:47.917 --> 00:24:49.375
Are you really saying this?

301
00:24:49.750 --> 00:24:52.333
What is there to be real
or not about this? I am just thinking.

302
00:24:53.667 --> 00:24:55.083
Hey! That's superb!

303
00:24:55.958 --> 00:24:56.958
Arul!

304
00:24:57.167 --> 00:24:58.750
You're going to buy me a house. Arul?

305
00:24:59.042 --> 00:25:02.333
Hey! Hang on!
That's why I don't tell you anything.

306
00:25:02.833 --> 00:25:04.625
Well. you have told me now. Relax!

307
00:25:05.417 --> 00:25:07.042
It makes me so happy to hear this.

308
00:25:08.542 --> 00:25:10.708
Oh. God!
I wanted to tell you this in person.

309
00:25:10.792 --> 00:25:12.432
but I've blabbered it all over the phone.

310
00:25:12.708 --> 00:25:14.417
The minute we buy the house.

311
00:25:14.542 --> 00:25:16.708
I am going to bore nails
into all the walls.

312
00:25:18.250 --> 00:25:19.333
Hema!

313
00:25:19.417 --> 00:25:21.476
He didn't even allow us to hang
two extra wedding photographs!

314
00:25:21.500 --> 00:25:22.583
That stingy owner!

315
00:25:22.875 --> 00:25:24.795
Always worried about
the walls developing cracks.

316
00:25:24.833 --> 00:25:26.083
water leakage. and whatnot.

317
00:25:26.583 --> 00:25:29.167
Just wait!
Hereafter. I will make the rules!

318
00:25:29.917 --> 00:25:31.000
Oh. my! Hema!

319
00:25:32.333 --> 00:25:34.184
Why don't you fully listen
to what I have to say?

320
00:25:34.208 --> 00:25:35.083
I won't listen.

321
00:25:35.167 --> 00:25:36.833
Why are you getting
excited beforehand?

322
00:25:37.208 --> 00:25:38.976
That's how I will get excited.
What will you do?

323
00:25:39.000 --> 00:25:39.833
Look.

324
00:25:39.917 --> 00:25:41.317
now don't imagine
something and then

325
00:25:41.417 --> 00:25:42.958
<i>blame it on me.</i>

326
00:25:43.833 --> 00:25:48.625
I just wanted to tell you that I am
only thinking about us buying this house.

327
00:25:48.875 --> 00:25:49.708
That's all.

328
00:25:49.792 --> 00:25:50.625
<i>Okay?</i>

329
00:25:50.708 --> 00:25:53.458
Mr. Arulmozhivarman.
son of Arivudai Nambi.

330
00:25:53.792 --> 00:25:57.542
<i>I know you too well. Even your
parents won't know you that well.</i>

331
00:25:58.042 --> 00:26:01.542
If you say that you're thinking about it.
that means you have decided on it.

332
00:26:01.917 --> 00:26:04.717
If you're asking for an opinion.
it simply means you're cross-checking.

333
00:26:04.833 --> 00:26:06.542
Okay. believe that.

334
00:26:07.292 --> 00:26:08.292
Actually. you…

335
00:26:09.708 --> 00:26:13.000
Amidst your blabbering.
I forgot what I wanted to tell you.

336
00:26:13.083 --> 00:26:14.583
THANJAVUR

337
00:26:14.667 --> 00:26:16.250
SALIYAMANGALAM

338
00:26:21.167 --> 00:26:22.833
NEEDAMANGALAM

339
00:26:34.375 --> 00:26:35.643
If anyone going to
Kombankudusai. Gnanam Nagar.

340
00:26:35.667 --> 00:26:37.507
and Mariamman Kovil is seated.
please get down.

341
00:26:38.000 --> 00:26:39.500
The next stop is at Saliyamangalam.

342
00:26:47.000 --> 00:26:50.667
GOVERNMENT TRANSPORT CORPORATION
KUMBAKONAM

343
00:26:59.000 --> 00:27:01.250
Sir. one ticket to Needamanglam.

344
00:27:01.625 --> 00:27:03.105
Why don't you have a 2000 rupee note?

345
00:27:05.917 --> 00:27:08.792
The bus has just started. how
can you give me a 500 rupee note?

346
00:27:08.917 --> 00:27:11.625
Sorry. I had no clue. I have change.

347
00:27:15.125 --> 00:27:16.125
Are you an outsider?

348
00:27:16.958 --> 00:27:18.500
No. I am from Thanjavur.

349
00:27:18.667 --> 00:27:20.427
It's been many years
since I left for Madras.

350
00:27:20.458 --> 00:27:22.667
No wonder you don't
seem new to the town.

351
00:27:22.833 --> 00:27:24.000
you just seem new to the bus.

352
00:27:24.917 --> 00:27:27.059
I said it because you're happily seated
in the conductor's seat.

353
00:27:27.083 --> 00:27:28.458
Oh! Sorry!

354
00:27:28.542 --> 00:27:30.500
- I forgot. I thought till you come…
- Sit…

355
00:27:30.583 --> 00:27:31.768
I still have more tickets to sell.

356
00:27:31.792 --> 00:27:34.112
If someone gets down at the next stop.
you can shift there.

357
00:27:34.208 --> 00:27:35.289
One ticket for Ayyampettai.

358
00:27:39.500 --> 00:27:40.500
Sir. a minute.

359
00:27:41.208 --> 00:27:43.375
I haven't been to Needamangalam.
so I have no clue.

360
00:27:44.125 --> 00:27:45.406
Let me know when the stop comes.

361
00:27:47.208 --> 00:27:48.208
Ticket… ticket…

362
00:27:49.542 --> 00:27:50.542
Ticket… ticket…

363
00:27:52.208 --> 00:27:54.542
- I'll tell you when it comes.
- Okay.

364
00:28:03.917 --> 00:28:05.625
THANJAVUR

365
00:28:13.833 --> 00:28:15.625
How many more stops to Needamangalam?

366
00:28:15.708 --> 00:28:16.875
A few more to go.

367
00:28:29.500 --> 00:28:30.500
Sit.

368
00:28:32.708 --> 00:28:33.708
Where in Thanjavur?

369
00:28:34.375 --> 00:28:35.667
Medical College Road.

370
00:28:36.042 --> 00:28:37.042
Road?

371
00:28:37.375 --> 00:28:39.851
No. I was just saying that because
you might not know the place.

372
00:28:39.875 --> 00:28:41.750
- Balaji Nagar.
- Where in Balaji Nagar?

373
00:28:41.833 --> 00:28:42.833
Second street.

374
00:28:43.042 --> 00:28:44.042
Whose house?

375
00:28:44.292 --> 00:28:45.458
What is your father's name?

376
00:28:45.667 --> 00:28:46.667
Arivudai Nambi.

377
00:28:47.417 --> 00:28:48.667
Oh. my God!

378
00:28:48.750 --> 00:28:50.208
You're Nambi sir's son?

379
00:28:51.375 --> 00:28:52.958
They told me you were abroad.

380
00:28:53.458 --> 00:28:56.417
No. my elder brother is.
I am in Madras.

381
00:28:57.000 --> 00:28:59.375
- I was also your father's student.
- Is it?

382
00:28:59.458 --> 00:29:01.000
Yes. The batch of '95.

383
00:29:01.333 --> 00:29:03.334
He was my science teacher
till the eighth standard.

384
00:29:03.417 --> 00:29:04.809
After that. he became the headmaster.

385
00:29:04.833 --> 00:29:05.833
They made him one.

386
00:29:05.958 --> 00:29:07.039
How many years has it been?

387
00:29:07.542 --> 00:29:08.542
Twenty-two.

388
00:29:09.125 --> 00:29:10.292
We left in '96.

389
00:29:11.000 --> 00:29:13.125
You left after
the property dispute. right?

390
00:29:14.500 --> 00:29:15.500
Even you seem to know.

391
00:29:16.583 --> 00:29:17.624
Now you have nothing here?

392
00:29:20.792 --> 00:29:21.792
Our people…

393
00:29:22.333 --> 00:29:24.250
We see good people as fools
and cheat them.

394
00:29:24.500 --> 00:29:26.833
but label the crooked as intelligent.
and celebrate them!

395
00:29:26.917 --> 00:29:27.917
Senseless people!

396
00:29:29.333 --> 00:29:31.184
Next time if he comes to Thanjavur.
let me know.

397
00:29:31.208 --> 00:29:32.208
I will come and see him.

398
00:29:33.042 --> 00:29:34.042
If he sees me.

399
00:29:34.083 --> 00:29:36.059
no. if you tell him my name
he will surely remember.

400
00:29:36.083 --> 00:29:37.083
Jagadeesan?

401
00:29:37.667 --> 00:29:38.833
- Jaggu.
- Jaggu.

402
00:29:39.917 --> 00:29:41.542
Will he come? Has he been visiting?

403
00:29:43.917 --> 00:29:45.667
After we left. he never returned.

404
00:29:46.125 --> 00:29:47.965
In order to avoid seeing
these relatives again…

405
00:29:48.000 --> 00:29:49.042
Did he say that?

406
00:29:49.708 --> 00:29:51.292
He didn't say that. I did.

407
00:29:51.708 --> 00:29:53.583
Exactly! He's not someone
who will say that.

408
00:29:53.708 --> 00:29:54.948
Why are you thinking like this?

409
00:29:55.292 --> 00:29:56.958
Are you saying I am wrong?

410
00:29:57.583 --> 00:29:58.792
Okay. forget it.

411
00:29:59.333 --> 00:30:00.934
After complaining about your
hometown and your relatives.

412
00:30:00.958 --> 00:30:01.958
how come you're here now?

413
00:30:02.542 --> 00:30:04.792
It's my sister's wedding.
My aunt's daughter.

414
00:30:05.667 --> 00:30:07.187
We grew up together
till a certain age.

415
00:30:07.750 --> 00:30:08.875
That's why I had to come.

416
00:30:08.958 --> 00:30:09.833
That's all it is.

417
00:30:09.917 --> 00:30:11.143
That's what I am saying as well.

418
00:30:11.167 --> 00:30:13.417
You don't have to be too friendly.
Even that's not good.

419
00:30:13.833 --> 00:30:15.851
But don't think all the relatives
are like those four.

420
00:30:15.875 --> 00:30:17.635
just forget about them
and focus on the rest.

421
00:30:17.708 --> 00:30:19.542
There may be many others
like your sister.

422
00:30:19.708 --> 00:30:20.750
Visit often.

423
00:30:21.708 --> 00:30:22.708
You're right.

424
00:30:23.708 --> 00:30:25.229
but I am not sure
I'll be okay with it.

425
00:30:25.958 --> 00:30:27.434
Even now I came because
my sister compelled me to.

426
00:30:27.458 --> 00:30:28.739
otherwise. I was not interested.

427
00:30:31.083 --> 00:30:32.250
Sir. can you help me?

428
00:30:33.000 --> 00:30:34.393
I haven't yet booked
my return ticket.

429
00:30:34.417 --> 00:30:36.542
I don't know when the reception
will begin and end.

430
00:30:37.083 --> 00:30:39.804
I will be meeting many people after
years. I am bound to get delayed.

431
00:30:40.167 --> 00:30:41.625
I have to leave tonight.

432
00:30:42.167 --> 00:30:48.125
So. if you tell me when the last bus
to Chennai is. I will leave accordingly.

433
00:30:48.375 --> 00:30:49.708
Then. what about the wedding?

434
00:30:50.208 --> 00:30:51.208
The wedding?

435
00:30:51.625 --> 00:30:52.625
No way!

436
00:30:52.750 --> 00:30:54.458
I am already waiting to get back.

437
00:30:54.667 --> 00:30:56.268
If it were up to me.
I'd run away right now!

438
00:30:56.292 --> 00:30:58.059
Since I am here now. I want
to make my presence felt.

439
00:30:58.083 --> 00:31:00.417
give the gift. and leave.
My job will be done then.

440
00:31:00.875 --> 00:31:01.792
How mean!

441
00:31:01.875 --> 00:31:03.356
Like an idiot. I offered you my seat.

442
00:31:08.000 --> 00:31:10.333
Coming back to Thanjavur
won't be feasible.

443
00:31:10.417 --> 00:31:12.377
There are private buses
from Needamangalam itself.

444
00:31:12.708 --> 00:31:14.833
The last bus is around 09:00
or 10:00 p.m.

445
00:31:15.250 --> 00:31:16.810
Just inquire about it
when you get down.

446
00:31:21.042 --> 00:31:22.042
Kovilvenni.

447
00:31:29.500 --> 00:31:30.500
Wait.

448
00:31:33.042 --> 00:31:35.583
Are they looking for a groom for you?
If not. let me know.

449
00:31:36.792 --> 00:31:37.792
Look at you blush!

450
00:31:38.083 --> 00:31:39.083
Let's go.

451
00:31:50.958 --> 00:31:53.083
Where did you say
the reception was happening?

452
00:31:55.292 --> 00:31:57.932
I don't remember the name. it
will be there on the invitation card.

453
00:32:06.000 --> 00:32:07.333
"Cholan Wedding Hall."

454
00:32:07.417 --> 00:32:08.875
Cholan Wedding Hall?

455
00:32:09.500 --> 00:32:10.500
Get down here itself.

456
00:32:10.708 --> 00:32:12.429
The gates won't open now.
It will take time.

457
00:32:12.583 --> 00:32:14.434
Everywhere else. the gates are only shut
if there's a train passing by.

458
00:32:14.458 --> 00:32:16.559
But it will be a problem if the train
halts at the Needamangalam station.

459
00:32:16.583 --> 00:32:19.417
Every day. they shut the gates
for almost ten hours and torture us.

460
00:32:21.750 --> 00:32:23.958
Go to that side. cross the gate.

461
00:32:24.125 --> 00:32:25.375
and take a right.

462
00:32:25.458 --> 00:32:26.458
You mean. left?

463
00:32:29.292 --> 00:32:31.101
When you go there. ask them.
They will guide you.

464
00:32:31.125 --> 00:32:32.285
It's pretty close from there.

465
00:32:37.792 --> 00:32:38.792
Alright then.

466
00:32:38.917 --> 00:32:39.917
Thanks.

467
00:32:40.417 --> 00:32:41.792
- Convey my regards to Dad.
- Okay.

468
00:32:42.250 --> 00:32:43.542
- Jaggu!
- Yes.

469
00:33:02.167 --> 00:33:06.292
S. GIRIDHARAN B.E..
P. BHUVANESHWARI M.SC. PH. D.

470
00:33:18.625 --> 00:33:23.292
CHOLAN WEDDING HALL

471
00:34:10.583 --> 00:34:13.250
Sister. hold this…
keep it in the bride's room.

472
00:34:13.333 --> 00:34:14.708
- Keep it safely.
- Yes.

473
00:34:20.750 --> 00:34:22.917
- Aishwarya. leave it on the stage.
- Okay.

474
00:34:35.667 --> 00:34:36.667
Hey. Latha!

475
00:34:37.042 --> 00:34:38.042
Brother!

476
00:34:38.208 --> 00:34:40.583
- How are you?
- I am fine. How are you?

477
00:34:41.333 --> 00:34:42.625
You're unrecognizable.

478
00:34:42.875 --> 00:34:43.917
All grown up.

479
00:34:44.875 --> 00:34:46.309
It's been so many
years since you saw me.

480
00:34:46.333 --> 00:34:47.809
how can I still look like a teenager?

481
00:34:47.833 --> 00:34:50.500
Why are you being so formal?
You're inviting trouble.

482
00:34:50.958 --> 00:34:51.958
That's because

483
00:34:52.333 --> 00:34:53.768
it's been so many years since we met.

484
00:34:53.792 --> 00:34:55.552
It will ease out in a few minutes
as we talk.

485
00:34:55.750 --> 00:34:58.208
Where are your wife and daughter?
They haven't come?

486
00:34:58.375 --> 00:34:59.792
- You've come alone or what?
- Yes.

487
00:34:59.875 --> 00:35:01.917
Jhanvi's exams are going on.

488
00:35:02.000 --> 00:35:03.375
That's why even
she couldn't come.

489
00:35:04.042 --> 00:35:06.875
I had to come.
Otherwise. you know what will happen.

490
00:35:07.333 --> 00:35:08.333
I know… I know…

491
00:35:08.792 --> 00:35:11.458
Poor thing. she's been waiting
for you since evening.

492
00:35:20.625 --> 00:35:22.083
Okay. tell me. how are you?

493
00:35:25.875 --> 00:35:26.875
I am just existing.

494
00:35:27.250 --> 00:35:28.292
As you can see.

495
00:35:30.833 --> 00:35:31.833
How is your husband?

496
00:35:33.667 --> 00:35:34.667
He is there…

497
00:35:36.000 --> 00:35:39.042
He doesn't go to work
nor does he come home.

498
00:35:40.125 --> 00:35:41.125
Liquor!

499
00:35:42.167 --> 00:35:43.847
Now he has started
drinking in the morning.

500
00:35:44.958 --> 00:35:46.919
If we question him.
he will give some lame excuse.

501
00:35:47.375 --> 00:35:48.375
which will make me laugh.

502
00:35:49.208 --> 00:35:50.848
He will say he's starting a new business.

503
00:35:51.208 --> 00:35:53.208
Then suddenly he will jump into politics.

504
00:35:53.833 --> 00:35:55.673
Unfortunately.
nothing productive has happened.

505
00:35:59.875 --> 00:36:02.833
I should have just married you.

506
00:36:04.167 --> 00:36:05.167
Everyone wanted me to.

507
00:36:06.125 --> 00:36:07.125
My father was worried

508
00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:12.417
about how I would manage in Chennai
and refused the proposal.

509
00:36:13.500 --> 00:36:14.500
But just look at me now.

510
00:36:15.333 --> 00:36:16.417
I am very much here.

511
00:36:17.375 --> 00:36:18.667
right in front of everyone.

512
00:36:19.542 --> 00:36:20.875
but no one notices me.

513
00:36:28.500 --> 00:36:30.583
Oh. God! I am such an idiot!

514
00:36:31.000 --> 00:36:33.667
You are here for the wedding
and I am pouring out my sorrow to you.

515
00:36:33.750 --> 00:36:34.750
Sorry. brother!

516
00:36:35.083 --> 00:36:36.083
Don't get me wrong.

517
00:36:36.625 --> 00:36:37.500
I am going to scold you now!

518
00:36:37.583 --> 00:36:39.024
What do you mean by "your" problems?

519
00:36:40.042 --> 00:36:41.842
Alright then. you're going
to stay put. right?

520
00:36:41.875 --> 00:36:44.417
I left all the work I was doing
and came as soon as I saw you.

521
00:36:44.958 --> 00:36:46.500
- Do you want tea or coffee?
- No…

522
00:36:46.792 --> 00:36:48.333
- Cold drinks?
- No…

523
00:36:48.417 --> 00:36:51.000
You will be here. right?
If you need anything call me. okay?

524
00:36:51.333 --> 00:36:52.333
See you.

525
00:37:17.125 --> 00:37:18.125
Who is this?

526
00:37:18.500 --> 00:37:19.917
Guess who it is?

527
00:37:20.542 --> 00:37:22.833
Oh. no! I spoke.
Now you'll know!

528
00:37:23.667 --> 00:37:25.167
I really don't know.

529
00:37:25.917 --> 00:37:26.917
Shall I give you a clue?

530
00:37:28.417 --> 00:37:30.875
My hometown is Needamangalam.

531
00:37:33.375 --> 00:37:34.375
Can't guess?

532
00:37:35.292 --> 00:37:36.625
Okay! Second clue.

533
00:37:37.583 --> 00:37:40.417
I am related to you
through your mother.

534
00:37:41.583 --> 00:37:42.583
Still. you can't guess?

535
00:37:43.167 --> 00:37:44.167
Okay.

536
00:37:45.375 --> 00:37:46.500
This is the last clue.

537
00:37:47.833 --> 00:37:49.958
In the summer holidays of '94.

538
00:37:50.042 --> 00:37:53.417
I spent the entire month
at your home in Thanjavur.

539
00:37:53.583 --> 00:37:55.000
Now you will definitely remember.

540
00:37:59.458 --> 00:38:00.750
Voilà!

541
00:38:01.083 --> 00:38:03.042
What? You still couldn't guess. brother?

542
00:38:09.125 --> 00:38:10.686
At least now do you
recognize me or not?

543
00:38:11.000 --> 00:38:14.167
Yes. I do. How are you?

544
00:38:14.417 --> 00:38:15.417
Thank God.

545
00:38:15.500 --> 00:38:17.143
I was scared you would
say you don't know me.

546
00:38:17.167 --> 00:38:18.768
In that case. I would have
just walked away.

547
00:38:18.792 --> 00:38:20.542
Why are you being
so formal all of a sudden?

548
00:38:21.333 --> 00:38:22.333
When did you come?

549
00:38:23.708 --> 00:38:25.833
Just now. about 15 minutes ago.

550
00:38:26.083 --> 00:38:27.083
Is that so?

551
00:38:27.250 --> 00:38:30.083
There was a black flag protest
at the collectorate's office.

552
00:38:30.333 --> 00:38:33.167
I finished that and was waiting for you
at the entrance.

553
00:38:33.542 --> 00:38:36.792
I was waiting to give you a surprise.

554
00:38:36.875 --> 00:38:38.833
- but you escaped.
- Sorry. I didn't notice.

555
00:38:40.042 --> 00:38:42.250
When did you get here?

556
00:38:42.500 --> 00:38:44.250
What do you mean by when?
I stay here.

557
00:38:44.542 --> 00:38:46.434
For the past three days.
the wedding preparations have piled up.

558
00:38:46.458 --> 00:38:48.208
Our uncle was managing it all alone.

559
00:38:48.458 --> 00:38:50.167
I couldn't just ignore that. right?

560
00:38:50.417 --> 00:38:51.934
That's why I left the shop
in my wife's care

561
00:38:51.958 --> 00:38:52.958
and stayed here.

562
00:38:53.125 --> 00:38:55.542
They've given me a separate room.
An AC room.

563
00:38:57.042 --> 00:38:58.333
Look. the moron is here.

564
00:38:59.083 --> 00:39:00.083
Hello. brother!

565
00:39:00.583 --> 00:39:01.583
Do you have anything hot?

566
00:39:03.375 --> 00:39:04.375
Hot?

567
00:39:08.833 --> 00:39:10.754
There's hot tomato juice.
Shall I give it to you?

568
00:39:10.958 --> 00:39:11.958
Stop teasing.

569
00:39:12.125 --> 00:39:12.958
<i>Athaan!</i>

570
00:39:13.042 --> 00:39:14.393
The bride's brother.
His father is her dad's elder brother.

571
00:39:14.417 --> 00:39:16.458
He is Ekambaram. the cook.
Catering service.

572
00:39:16.625 --> 00:39:18.518
He will get angry if I don't
introduce him in English.

573
00:39:18.542 --> 00:39:19.792
Did he call me a moron?

574
00:39:19.875 --> 00:39:21.395
He was the cook at my wedding as well!

575
00:39:22.250 --> 00:39:23.417
Well. is there anything hot?

576
00:39:23.667 --> 00:39:24.667
Not for me. for <i>Athaan!</i>

577
00:39:25.292 --> 00:39:26.332
You can eat sweets. right?

578
00:39:26.750 --> 00:39:28.542
Yes. I can.
but I don't want anything.

579
00:39:28.625 --> 00:39:29.625
Oh! Just wait. <i>Athaan!</i>

580
00:39:29.917 --> 00:39:30.917
What sweet do you have?

581
00:39:31.125 --> 00:39:33.018
I won't tell you.
Will you have it only if I tell you?

582
00:39:33.042 --> 00:39:34.042
What a bully!

583
00:39:34.625 --> 00:39:36.625
Shall I tell him
what you did at your wedding?

584
00:39:36.792 --> 00:39:38.875
Let's not get started.
Just bring what you have. go.

585
00:39:38.958 --> 00:39:40.917
Brother. I will get you
both sweets and savories.

586
00:39:41.000 --> 00:39:42.417
eat and let me know how it is.

587
00:39:42.792 --> 00:39:44.934
Later. I will come and tell you
what this guy did at his wedding.

588
00:39:44.958 --> 00:39:45.958
- Go. now!
- Just wait.

589
00:39:46.375 --> 00:39:47.375
Be right back!

590
00:39:59.958 --> 00:40:00.958
Where is the restroom?

591
00:40:01.208 --> 00:40:02.208
To piss or poop?

592
00:40:05.542 --> 00:40:07.667
Because they have
Indian toilets downstairs.

593
00:40:08.208 --> 00:40:10.559
If it's to poop. it will be difficult
to remove your pants and sit.

594
00:40:10.583 --> 00:40:11.976
If it's to piss.
downstairs is fine.

595
00:40:12.000 --> 00:40:14.542
But to poop you can go upstairs.
it's superb and will be clean.

596
00:40:14.625 --> 00:40:15.785
So don't feel shy to tell me.

597
00:40:16.458 --> 00:40:17.458
No. really.

598
00:40:17.625 --> 00:40:19.167
- I just want to piss.
- Promise?

599
00:40:24.750 --> 00:40:25.583
Is it this way?

600
00:40:25.667 --> 00:40:28.042
Once you reach the washbasin.
it's just next to it.

601
00:40:28.958 --> 00:40:30.359
Why do you need this?
Give it to me.

602
00:40:40.458 --> 00:40:41.458
No.

603
00:40:41.542 --> 00:40:42.982
I'll ask someone and go. no problem.

604
00:40:43.583 --> 00:40:45.024
What if you say piss and go to poop?

605
00:40:45.125 --> 00:40:46.375
Who are you trying to fool?

606
00:40:48.000 --> 00:40:49.333
Just kidding. <i>Athaan!</i>

607
00:40:49.500 --> 00:40:51.625
I didn't pee since I was waiting for you.

608
00:40:51.708 --> 00:40:52.583
Even I have held it in for long.

609
00:40:52.667 --> 00:40:53.667
Come. let's go together.

610
00:40:53.792 --> 00:40:54.792
It's been so long.

611
00:41:05.958 --> 00:41:06.958
<i>Athaan!</i>

612
00:41:07.083 --> 00:41:08.583
I think you've forgotten.

613
00:41:12.750 --> 00:41:13.750
<i>Athaan?</i>

614
00:41:13.875 --> 00:41:14.875
<i>Athaan!</i>

615
00:41:16.792 --> 00:41:19.375
Oh! Yes! I remember now.

616
00:41:19.583 --> 00:41:21.264
You won't speak
while you're in the toilet.

617
00:41:21.417 --> 00:41:23.458
Germs will get inside our mouth
and we will get a

618
00:41:23.750 --> 00:41:24.851
throat infection.
You told this to us back then.

619
00:41:24.875 --> 00:41:26.075
at the Kumaran Cinema Theater.

620
00:41:26.208 --> 00:41:28.089
Okay. you don't need to talk.
just listen to me.

621
00:41:28.500 --> 00:41:31.583
Those days we used to have a
pissing competition. do you remember?

622
00:41:31.875 --> 00:41:33.333
You always won!

623
00:41:33.417 --> 00:41:35.042
We were just small kids back then.

624
00:41:35.333 --> 00:41:36.875
You used to piss
with such force.

625
00:41:36.958 --> 00:41:39.125
and form A. B. C
on the compound wall and show off!

626
00:41:44.750 --> 00:41:46.250
- Hello!
<i>- Hello!</i>

627
00:41:46.333 --> 00:41:47.417
<i>Good evening. brother!</i>

628
00:41:47.583 --> 00:41:49.250
Have you arrived?
Where are you?

629
00:41:51.333 --> 00:41:54.542
Look to your left
and come straight.

630
00:41:54.708 --> 00:41:56.226
you will find the kitchen.
Just drop it off there.

631
00:41:56.250 --> 00:41:57.393
<i>- I can't hear you properly.</i>
- What?

632
00:41:57.417 --> 00:41:59.333
<i>- It's echoing.</i>
- Echoing. is it?

633
00:41:59.667 --> 00:42:00.667
Hold on.

634
00:42:01.875 --> 00:42:02.708
Can you hear me now?

635
00:42:02.792 --> 00:42:05.458
<i>I can hear you very clearly now.
Were you in the toilet?</i>

636
00:42:05.542 --> 00:42:07.042
Yes. I was in the restroom.

637
00:42:07.125 --> 00:42:08.000
<i>Be careful with your phone.</i>

638
00:42:08.083 --> 00:42:09.559
- You're right.
<i>- It will fall inside the toilet.</i>

639
00:42:09.583 --> 00:42:10.958
That's exactly how I lost a phone…

640
00:42:11.708 --> 00:42:14.000
right in front of my eyes.
Before I could grab it.

641
00:42:14.083 --> 00:42:15.542
- the phone fell inside.
<i>- Is that so?</i>

642
00:42:15.625 --> 00:42:17.306
I was not concerned
about losing the phone.

643
00:42:17.458 --> 00:42:19.851
just the thought of getting another
SIM card from Seena Maana…

644
00:42:19.875 --> 00:42:21.875
- I was cursing myself for pissing!
<i>- That's right!</i>

645
00:42:24.833 --> 00:42:26.500
He should've come by now.

646
00:42:26.708 --> 00:42:29.208
I had asked Santhanam's son
to wait at the bus stand.

647
00:42:29.292 --> 00:42:31.333
I am trying to call him.
but it's not going through.

648
00:42:32.208 --> 00:42:33.208
What happened…

649
00:42:33.250 --> 00:42:34.250
Uncle!

650
00:42:35.042 --> 00:42:36.042
Hey!

651
00:42:36.667 --> 00:42:38.042
You've arrived!

652
00:42:38.208 --> 00:42:40.351
I've been looking for you everywhere.
You're coming from this side?

653
00:42:40.375 --> 00:42:42.456
I had gone to the restroom.
All fine with you. uncle?

654
00:42:42.500 --> 00:42:43.417
Of course. I am fine.

655
00:42:43.500 --> 00:42:45.458
I have my hometown.
I have water. I have land.

656
00:42:45.542 --> 00:42:46.542
And the tractor!

657
00:42:49.583 --> 00:42:51.083
I have no issues.
I am doing great!

658
00:42:51.375 --> 00:42:52.375
Mom. Dad?

659
00:42:52.417 --> 00:42:55.125
They are all fine.
They send their regards to you.

660
00:42:55.208 --> 00:42:56.368
You should have brought them.

661
00:42:56.750 --> 00:42:58.125
You know about my father…

662
00:42:58.292 --> 00:42:59.375
How will he come?

663
00:42:59.792 --> 00:43:00.792
Okay. listen…

664
00:43:00.833 --> 00:43:03.792
Those four people who you detest
are seated here

665
00:43:04.583 --> 00:43:07.083
and are behaving
as if they worked hard. earned.

666
00:43:07.208 --> 00:43:10.042
and achieved all this wealth.

667
00:43:10.292 --> 00:43:13.417
Wearing expensive silk clothes
and showing off!

668
00:43:13.708 --> 00:43:15.958
- Sold their souls for wealth!
- Forget it. uncle!

669
00:43:16.667 --> 00:43:17.667
Okay… okay… okay…

670
00:43:19.000 --> 00:43:20.000
Then…

671
00:43:23.333 --> 00:43:24.375
Behaving like a child.

672
00:43:24.833 --> 00:43:27.125
- Brother! That's my slipper.
- Yours. is it?

673
00:43:29.208 --> 00:43:30.569
Wait till you remove your slipper.

674
00:43:32.583 --> 00:43:34.893
Wait. I can't find my slipper.
I will call back after I find it.

675
00:43:34.917 --> 00:43:36.250
My sister Valliamma's son.

676
00:43:36.708 --> 00:43:37.708
Hello!

677
00:43:38.417 --> 00:43:39.417
- You may continue…
- Yes.

678
00:43:39.583 --> 00:43:41.333
- Brother. come sit.
- Sit. uncle.

679
00:43:44.250 --> 00:43:45.250
<i>Asoka halva!</i>

680
00:43:46.042 --> 00:43:47.042
Eat. it will be amazing.

681
00:43:47.458 --> 00:43:49.417
It will be superb. eat it!

682
00:43:49.833 --> 00:43:51.000
Eat! Eat!

683
00:43:53.833 --> 00:43:54.833
He…

684
00:43:57.250 --> 00:43:58.410
That… that… guy who was here…

685
00:43:58.583 --> 00:44:00.743
- That guy…
- Try this Brinjal fritter. it's fantastic.

686
00:44:01.000 --> 00:44:02.708
- Have it.
- Eat it and tell me how it is.

687
00:44:03.000 --> 00:44:04.000
It's nice.

688
00:44:06.125 --> 00:44:07.833
Uncle. you just kicked
his slippers. right?

689
00:44:07.917 --> 00:44:10.292
Yes. yes… If he comes now.

690
00:44:10.375 --> 00:44:12.856
there won't be anything left for us.
he will finish everything.

691
00:44:13.000 --> 00:44:14.600
We should finish it off before he comes.

692
00:44:15.167 --> 00:44:16.167
Not about that. uncle…

693
00:44:16.458 --> 00:44:18.333
- Who is that…
- Any leftovers for me?

694
00:44:18.583 --> 00:44:20.018
- Have you finished everything?
- Come… come…

695
00:44:20.042 --> 00:44:22.167
There's lots of it. We saved it for you.

696
00:44:22.292 --> 00:44:23.458
Look at all the leftovers.

697
00:44:27.333 --> 00:44:28.917
Brother. have you come alone?

698
00:44:29.375 --> 00:44:30.559
Haven't you brought
anyone else from home?

699
00:44:30.583 --> 00:44:31.583
Good question. ask him!

700
00:44:31.875 --> 00:44:33.250
He could have brought everyone.

701
00:44:33.625 --> 00:44:36.545
He's come as though he's on a solitary
pilgrimage to Kashi and Rameswaram.

702
00:44:36.792 --> 00:44:38.351
If they had come
and blessed the bride and groom.

703
00:44:38.375 --> 00:44:39.375
it would've been lovely.

704
00:44:39.708 --> 00:44:40.708
It would've been nice.

705
00:44:41.083 --> 00:44:43.792
I never said no!
Will my father ever listen to me?

706
00:44:44.000 --> 00:44:45.083
What's the big deal now?

707
00:44:45.250 --> 00:44:46.458
Earlier. he was a teacher.

708
00:44:46.792 --> 00:44:48.559
so he used to always get dressed.
top to toe in white.

709
00:44:48.583 --> 00:44:50.125
and ride off on his cycle.

710
00:44:50.375 --> 00:44:51.292
saying he was going to school.

711
00:44:51.375 --> 00:44:53.875
and correcting the answer papers.
even on Sundays.

712
00:44:53.958 --> 00:44:56.625
What now? Has he retired
and is staring at the roof

713
00:44:56.875 --> 00:44:57.875
or is he going on walks?

714
00:44:58.333 --> 00:45:00.958
- He can come and do that here.
- You're right.

715
00:45:01.375 --> 00:45:03.708
I thought the same. just hang on.

716
00:45:06.417 --> 00:45:08.208
Hello. Dad!

717
00:45:08.875 --> 00:45:09.875
Yes. I reached.

718
00:45:10.667 --> 00:45:11.667
Here…

719
00:45:12.208 --> 00:45:14.375
Sokku uncle wanted
to say something to you.

720
00:45:14.708 --> 00:45:15.542
just hold.

721
00:45:15.708 --> 00:45:17.375
No. no. he's right next to me. just wait.

722
00:45:17.667 --> 00:45:18.542
Ask him.

723
00:45:18.625 --> 00:45:20.625
You asked me this three
times in two minutes. Here.

724
00:45:21.167 --> 00:45:22.167
Ask him. uncle.

725
00:45:22.375 --> 00:45:24.292
Ask him… Talk to him. uncle.

726
00:45:25.042 --> 00:45:26.042
Be bold.

727
00:45:29.917 --> 00:45:30.792
<i>Brother-in-law.</i>

728
00:45:30.875 --> 00:45:32.675
- Hello. brother-in-law!
<i>- Hello. Sokkalingam.</i>

729
00:45:33.667 --> 00:45:34.667
Are you doing fine?

730
00:45:35.083 --> 00:45:36.083
I am fine.

731
00:45:36.792 --> 00:45:37.792
How are you?

732
00:45:37.833 --> 00:45:39.292
I am fine. brother-in-law.

733
00:45:43.083 --> 00:45:44.750
Everyone's fine at home. <i>Athaan?</i>

734
00:45:45.167 --> 00:45:47.208
How's sister Valliamma?

735
00:45:47.500 --> 00:45:48.542
She's fine.

736
00:45:48.792 --> 00:45:51.292
Brother-in-law. you not being here
is the only disappointment.

737
00:45:52.625 --> 00:45:54.375
I couldn't make it.
I have some work here.

738
00:45:54.458 --> 00:45:55.559
What is this. brother-in-law? Earlier.

739
00:45:55.583 --> 00:45:59.750
because of the school. academics.
and the children you were not available.

740
00:46:00.583 --> 00:46:02.667
Now you could have come.

741
00:46:02.750 --> 00:46:05.500
The doctors are saying if I travel.
my blood pressure will go up.

742
00:46:05.875 --> 00:46:07.167
What do you expect me to do?

743
00:46:07.292 --> 00:46:10.750
Whenever you get time. come
and visit our hometown often.

744
00:46:11.042 --> 00:46:13.958
Spend some time with all
of us. enjoy yourself.

745
00:46:14.167 --> 00:46:17.292
and just drink the water from
our river. you will heal. brother-in-law.

746
00:46:17.583 --> 00:46:19.343
Then neither salt nor
sugar will be a bother.

747
00:46:19.583 --> 00:46:21.417
you will feel rejuvenated.
brother-in-law.

748
00:46:21.500 --> 00:46:23.625
<i>You're the most important
person to all of us.</i>

749
00:46:24.167 --> 00:46:26.375
If you had been at
the forefront conducting everything…

750
00:46:27.083 --> 00:46:28.083
I am so sorry.

751
00:46:28.917 --> 00:46:30.250
I will definitely come next time.

752
00:46:31.000 --> 00:46:32.059
I will come to see you at least.

753
00:46:32.083 --> 00:46:34.375
Brother-in-law. I just want
to say one thing.

754
00:46:35.208 --> 00:46:38.667
are we ever
going to be born together again?

755
00:46:41.000 --> 00:46:42.081
<i>That's why. brother-in-law.</i>

756
00:46:45.542 --> 00:46:47.375
Everything you said
and asked is correct.

757
00:46:48.667 --> 00:46:49.667
It's wrong.

758
00:46:50.208 --> 00:46:51.208
I should've come.

759
00:46:51.708 --> 00:46:55.750
No. no. no. brother-in-law.
I will come and see you.

760
00:46:55.833 --> 00:46:57.500
I will come to Madras and see you.

761
00:46:58.042 --> 00:46:59.125
Why take the trouble?

762
00:46:59.833 --> 00:47:00.750
I will come.

763
00:47:00.833 --> 00:47:03.042
Brother-in-law. it's no trouble. Nowadays.

764
00:47:03.125 --> 00:47:05.750
<i>the buses are so comfortable.
we can even sleep and come.</i>

765
00:47:05.833 --> 00:47:07.393
They are now coming
till our hometown. brother-in-law.

766
00:47:07.417 --> 00:47:09.897
If I board that. I am going
to come comfortably and land there.

767
00:47:10.208 --> 00:47:12.542
Okay. you come.

768
00:47:13.292 --> 00:47:14.732
Now go take care
of the wedding work.

769
00:47:14.792 --> 00:47:15.875
I'll talk later.

770
00:47:15.958 --> 00:47:19.000
Okay. brother-in-law. Sure. sure.
Take care.

771
00:47:24.375 --> 00:47:25.375
Hello.

772
00:47:27.042 --> 00:47:28.208
You talk.

773
00:47:28.958 --> 00:47:30.479
Just check if Dad's still on the line.

774
00:47:30.708 --> 00:47:31.708
Dad.

775
00:47:32.583 --> 00:47:34.292
- I'll call later.
- Okay.

776
00:47:53.333 --> 00:47:55.667
<i>Athaan… Athaan…</i>
How many times…

777
00:47:56.333 --> 00:47:57.373
This is different. <i>Athaan.</i>

778
00:48:05.667 --> 00:48:07.667
What's happening.
you guys are using sign language?

779
00:48:08.042 --> 00:48:09.722
You kicked my slipper.
so I won't tell you.

780
00:48:11.042 --> 00:48:14.292
It's not fair for a warrior
to pull a fight. while one's eating.

781
00:48:15.333 --> 00:48:17.083
Listen. I am no longer
a young boy and.

782
00:48:17.167 --> 00:48:18.417
you've grown old. watch out.

783
00:48:18.500 --> 00:48:20.542
Old. my foot!

784
00:48:21.167 --> 00:48:23.101
I will break your hand
and put a cast on it. old man!

785
00:48:23.125 --> 00:48:25.125
You're going to break my hand
and put it in a cast?

786
00:48:25.250 --> 00:48:27.292
Do you even know how
to hold it and piss properly?

787
00:48:27.375 --> 00:48:28.768
Yuck. so disgusting!
How can you talk.

788
00:48:28.792 --> 00:48:29.893
so indecently in front of my <i>Athaan?</i>

789
00:48:29.917 --> 00:48:31.542
Hey! This seems indecent to you?

790
00:48:31.625 --> 00:48:33.143
Shall I tell him
what you did at your wedding?

791
00:48:33.167 --> 00:48:35.559
Not necessary! Go check. it seems
a lizard has fallen into the <i>payasam!</i>

792
00:48:35.583 --> 00:48:37.268
- It will take some time. is it okay?
- Cooker! Cooker!

793
00:48:37.292 --> 00:48:38.809
Cooker. just keep quiet.
listen to me. don't! Cooker!

794
00:48:38.833 --> 00:48:40.625
Oh. Lord! Oh. Lord!

795
00:48:40.708 --> 00:48:42.309
- The Lord will destroy your eyes!
- Hey.

796
00:48:42.333 --> 00:48:43.250
why are you shouting like this?

797
00:48:43.333 --> 00:48:45.393
I am whispering into his ears.
how will he be able to hear?

798
00:48:45.417 --> 00:48:46.476
I am screaming cause
he shouldn't hear…

799
00:48:46.500 --> 00:48:48.625
- Oh. Lord!
- Okay. you scream all you want.

800
00:48:48.750 --> 00:48:49.768
Let's see who wins. you or me.

801
00:48:49.792 --> 00:48:51.143
Brother… brother…
Please listen to me. brother.

802
00:48:51.167 --> 00:48:53.708
I will get you four wedding
orders where 2000 people will eat.

803
00:48:54.375 --> 00:48:55.375
Please spare me.

804
00:48:56.417 --> 00:48:57.768
I will tell you later
when he's not there.

805
00:48:57.792 --> 00:48:58.625
Okay.

806
00:48:58.708 --> 00:49:00.601
Your Honor! The judgment has
been given. let go of my hands.

807
00:49:00.625 --> 00:49:03.746
Okay. both of you were talking in sign
language. tell me what that was. and go.

808
00:49:04.042 --> 00:49:07.042
Nothing much. uncle.
he has to board the bus tonight.

809
00:49:08.625 --> 00:49:09.625
How do you know?

810
00:49:11.042 --> 00:49:13.167
Chinna uncle has given
me the responsibility.

811
00:49:13.917 --> 00:49:15.292
If you permit me.

812
00:49:15.583 --> 00:49:18.424
we'll see the bride and groom and
I'll get him to board the bus on time.

813
00:49:18.917 --> 00:49:20.000
What is this?

814
00:49:20.708 --> 00:49:23.208
Uncle. now don't start again.

815
00:49:23.458 --> 00:49:25.167
You have come
after so many years.

816
00:49:25.625 --> 00:49:27.792
stay with us just for tonight.

817
00:49:28.167 --> 00:49:30.184
The wedding is taking place
in the morning around four to six.

818
00:49:30.208 --> 00:49:33.125
Once the rituals are over
you can leave by the next bus.

819
00:49:33.208 --> 00:49:35.369
Shall I book the ticket
for the 10:00 a.m. bus. <i>Athaan?</i>

820
00:49:36.583 --> 00:49:39.833
Let's talk about this later. First.
let me go give the gift and come.

821
00:49:39.917 --> 00:49:40.750
- You'll say this.
- Okay?

822
00:49:40.833 --> 00:49:41.851
But you'll board the bus and leave.

823
00:49:41.875 --> 00:49:42.875
Just like your father.

824
00:49:46.917 --> 00:49:48.375
Fine. At least you came.

825
00:49:52.208 --> 00:49:53.917
- I'll come back and speak to you.
- Okay.

826
00:49:57.000 --> 00:49:58.320
Do we have time to catch the bus?

827
00:49:58.792 --> 00:50:00.625
We have enough time. relax.

828
00:50:02.542 --> 00:50:04.833
Thank you! Thanks!

829
00:50:04.917 --> 00:50:06.517
- Auntie. please eat and go.
- Thank you.

830
00:50:06.708 --> 00:50:07.708
Hello. sir.

831
00:50:08.375 --> 00:50:09.375
Thank you.

832
00:50:10.625 --> 00:50:12.306
Congratulations! I'll take your leave now.

833
00:50:12.792 --> 00:50:14.542
- Brother…
- Bhuvana. how are you?

834
00:50:14.917 --> 00:50:17.042
I can't believe it! You came!

835
00:50:17.125 --> 00:50:18.167
I finally made it. right?

836
00:50:18.833 --> 00:50:21.833
Look at how stunned your sister is!

837
00:50:22.250 --> 00:50:23.643
You never came when so
many people called you.

838
00:50:23.667 --> 00:50:24.583
but here you are for me.

839
00:50:24.667 --> 00:50:25.833
Are they and you the same?

840
00:50:26.875 --> 00:50:29.250
Thanks. brother…
Thanks. brother! I just knew!

841
00:50:30.542 --> 00:50:32.875
This is the shirt you sent.
Is it looking nice?

842
00:50:33.125 --> 00:50:35.208
- It's looking superb! Did you like it?
- A lot!

843
00:50:35.292 --> 00:50:36.652
It's exactly like the ones I wear.

844
00:50:37.875 --> 00:50:39.750
- My brother.
- Sir.

845
00:50:40.167 --> 00:50:41.625
- How are you. sir?
- I am fine.

846
00:50:41.708 --> 00:50:42.875
Sir. I hadn't seen you. but.

847
00:50:43.042 --> 00:50:44.625
I know everything about you.

848
00:50:44.750 --> 00:50:46.309
She would have spoken
about it 108 times at least.

849
00:50:46.333 --> 00:50:47.493
I literally know it by heart.

850
00:50:47.583 --> 00:50:49.333
She only talks about you
over the phone.

851
00:50:49.542 --> 00:50:52.708
Sir. even our romantic
conversations are about you.

852
00:50:53.042 --> 00:50:54.042
At one point.

853
00:50:54.542 --> 00:50:56.458
I even thought of marrying you.
Sorry. sir!

854
00:50:57.208 --> 00:51:00.000
Idiot! Did you not have
any other topic to talk about?

855
00:51:00.083 --> 00:51:02.625
Sir. all the topics she
talks about are boring.

856
00:51:02.875 --> 00:51:04.956
By those standards.
stories about you are far better.

857
00:51:05.875 --> 00:51:08.375
That's because Bhuvana
and I grew up together.

858
00:51:08.458 --> 00:51:09.875
Sir… sir… I know it all.

859
00:51:10.000 --> 00:51:11.800
How you grew up together.
how you babysat her.

860
00:51:11.833 --> 00:51:13.351
how you cried when
she got chicken pox.

861
00:51:13.375 --> 00:51:14.643
How you plucked
gooseberries for her.

862
00:51:14.667 --> 00:51:16.934
How you went to school on
the cycle together. Am I correct. sir?

863
00:51:16.958 --> 00:51:17.958
I know everything. sir.

864
00:51:18.000 --> 00:51:19.143
Please don't narrate it again. sir.

865
00:51:19.167 --> 00:51:20.375
I'll marry your sister!

866
00:51:21.583 --> 00:51:22.917
Thanks a lot for sparing me.

867
00:51:24.208 --> 00:51:25.434
- Thank you. sir.
- Congratulations.

868
00:51:25.458 --> 00:51:26.976
- Thank you so much. sir.
- Wish you a very happy married life.

869
00:51:27.000 --> 00:51:28.400
- Thank you so much. sir.
- Oh. wow!

870
00:51:28.500 --> 00:51:29.875
You know
how to do all this. is it?

871
00:51:30.375 --> 00:51:31.375
Not bad!

872
00:51:31.833 --> 00:51:34.208
Well. what have you got for me?

873
00:51:35.292 --> 00:51:38.333
What you like. what I like. all of it.

874
00:51:40.292 --> 00:51:41.792
Hey. what are you doing?

875
00:51:42.542 --> 00:51:44.708
Hey. the queue is really long.

876
00:51:45.542 --> 00:51:47.292
- See it later.
- No!

877
00:51:47.458 --> 00:51:50.125
My brother has got this.
especially for me. Should I not see it?

878
00:51:50.208 --> 00:51:51.309
What's more important than that?

879
00:51:51.333 --> 00:51:54.125
There's nothing that special
in there. listen to me. Bhuvana.

880
00:51:54.208 --> 00:51:55.208
Then how special is it?

881
00:51:55.500 --> 00:51:58.583
Let it be anything.
You got it for me. right?

882
00:52:01.250 --> 00:52:03.958
Hey. Everyone's waiting in the queue.

883
00:52:05.083 --> 00:52:06.083
It's okay. wait.

884
00:52:06.250 --> 00:52:08.650
You never came at anyone's behest
but you came for me. right?

885
00:52:09.125 --> 00:52:10.125
Then wait.

886
00:52:10.875 --> 00:52:11.875
Hold this.

887
00:52:15.625 --> 00:52:16.625
Give it… give it…

888
00:52:19.125 --> 00:52:20.125
Careful!

889
00:52:23.083 --> 00:52:24.643
What is this? There are so many things!

890
00:52:24.792 --> 00:52:26.432
- Everything is for you.
- Keep it safely.

891
00:52:26.708 --> 00:52:27.708
Hold this.

892
00:52:34.208 --> 00:52:36.875
Bhuvana. open it quickly.
Just tear it open.

893
00:52:37.167 --> 00:52:38.958
I need the wrapper.
I will keep it safely.

894
00:52:42.208 --> 00:52:43.208
Careful!

895
00:52:45.375 --> 00:52:47.208
Girl. are you going
to unwrap everything?

896
00:52:47.500 --> 00:52:49.621
Yes. I am going to unwrap
every single one and see it.

897
00:52:49.667 --> 00:52:51.042
What are you. a tailgate?

898
00:52:51.208 --> 00:52:52.208
His bodyguard?

899
00:52:52.500 --> 00:52:53.500
Oh. God!

900
00:52:53.583 --> 00:52:55.851
He didn't know the way
to the stage. so I accompanied him.

901
00:52:55.875 --> 00:52:57.716
Look. at least I am
helpful in holding the box.

902
00:52:58.167 --> 00:53:00.125
Hey. do you know
who this "sir" is?

903
00:53:00.417 --> 00:53:03.083
Yes. yes. I know!
He's the one who received me first.

904
00:53:03.667 --> 00:53:05.307
That I know. I am not talking about that.

905
00:53:06.625 --> 00:53:08.506
This "sir" by relation.
is eligible to marry me.

906
00:53:08.542 --> 00:53:10.393
What are you talking
about when he's right there?

907
00:53:10.417 --> 00:53:11.417
Won't you keep quiet?

908
00:53:11.542 --> 00:53:12.684
Hey! How dare you threaten me?

909
00:53:12.708 --> 00:53:14.143
If I give you one punch. you
will go flying and land at home!

910
00:53:14.167 --> 00:53:15.167
Beware!

911
00:53:38.125 --> 00:53:39.500
Shall I wear all
of this right now?

912
00:53:40.333 --> 00:53:41.333
I would love to do so.

913
00:53:41.708 --> 00:53:43.833
My brother bought
all this for me.

914
00:53:44.167 --> 00:53:45.750
so I'll pose with it. okay?

915
00:53:47.875 --> 00:53:49.275
Wear it. darling. it's all for you.

916
00:53:50.667 --> 00:53:51.667
You put it on me.

917
00:53:58.333 --> 00:54:00.351
I will string the gold coin.
to the wedding chain. tomorrow.

918
00:54:00.375 --> 00:54:01.958
First. the bangles.

919
00:54:08.958 --> 00:54:12.125
Wow! What a fantastic start!
Baby shower?

920
00:54:12.208 --> 00:54:13.375
Yes! Exactly!

921
00:54:14.083 --> 00:54:15.292
- Is it hurting?
- No.

922
00:54:19.625 --> 00:54:20.708
No. not that.

923
00:54:21.458 --> 00:54:22.458
Take that one.

924
00:54:36.292 --> 00:54:37.417
Give that. I'll put it on.

925
00:54:44.583 --> 00:54:45.583
It's nice.

926
00:54:46.458 --> 00:54:47.458
Now take that.

927
00:56:49.750 --> 00:56:51.125
- Careful.
- You saw that!

928
00:56:51.958 --> 00:56:53.458
Did I not say that
I would marry him?

929
00:56:54.208 --> 00:56:56.088
- You've started again. I am leaving now.
- Sir.

930
00:56:56.542 --> 00:56:58.822
- Where are you going?
- Doesn't your brother have to eat?

931
00:56:58.875 --> 00:57:01.476
If we go late. they'll say all the
sweets and the special dishes are over.

932
00:57:01.500 --> 00:57:03.601
Only if we go now we'll get a place.
there's a huge crowd.

933
00:57:03.625 --> 00:57:04.958
Oh. that's good.

934
00:57:05.625 --> 00:57:07.833
Okay. go. We'll be right behind you.
don't start eating.

935
00:57:07.958 --> 00:57:09.250
wait for us.

936
00:57:10.375 --> 00:57:11.375
Wipe your eyes.

937
00:57:21.833 --> 00:57:22.833
You come here.

938
00:57:23.042 --> 00:57:24.042
Where are you going?

939
00:57:24.292 --> 00:57:26.417
Tell him not to eat. I'll be right there.

940
00:57:26.500 --> 00:57:28.100
It's been so many
years since we saw him.

941
00:57:28.333 --> 00:57:29.708
Uncle! Auntie!

942
00:57:29.875 --> 00:57:31.393
- Hello. Arul. how are you?
- I am fine.

943
00:57:31.417 --> 00:57:32.292
How are you. Arul?

944
00:57:32.417 --> 00:57:33.917
So happy you came.

945
00:57:34.000 --> 00:57:35.833
I thought you would
disappoint us like always.

946
00:57:35.917 --> 00:57:36.917
Come on. uncle!

947
00:57:38.083 --> 00:57:38.958
- Uncle.
- Tell me.

948
00:57:39.042 --> 00:57:41.682
There was this person standing
next to me. do you know who that is?

949
00:57:41.750 --> 00:57:43.042
Who? I didn't notice.

950
00:57:43.875 --> 00:57:45.875
Hey. son! He's asking me
if I know who someone is.

951
00:57:45.958 --> 00:57:47.875
Just find out who that is and tell him.

952
00:57:48.542 --> 00:57:50.042
Arul. I am going up.

953
00:57:50.125 --> 00:57:51.643
- You must eat and then leave. okay?
- Yes.

954
00:57:51.667 --> 00:57:53.292
- Come. let's go.
- Eat and go.

955
00:57:53.917 --> 00:57:55.417
Who are you asking about. <i>Athaan?</i>

956
00:57:56.625 --> 00:57:57.625
You saw them here?

957
00:57:58.708 --> 00:57:59.708
What did they look like?

958
00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:01.000
Short or tall?

959
00:58:01.333 --> 00:58:02.542
Fat or thin or hefty?

960
00:58:02.958 --> 00:58:04.625
Dark or fair or wheatish like me?

961
00:58:06.333 --> 00:58:07.375
Man or woman?

962
00:58:08.667 --> 00:58:10.427
If you give the specifics.
we can catch them.

963
00:58:11.625 --> 00:58:13.000
It's alright. forget it.

964
00:58:13.375 --> 00:58:14.415
How can we just forget it?

965
00:58:14.625 --> 00:58:17.505
There is no one I don't know in this
hall and no one who doesn't know me.

966
00:58:18.333 --> 00:58:19.893
Shall I ask them
to close the main door?

967
00:58:21.125 --> 00:58:22.792
I am hungry. shall we eat?

968
00:58:23.083 --> 00:58:24.083
Even you?

969
00:58:24.500 --> 00:58:25.500
Oh. God! Come.

970
00:58:28.417 --> 00:58:30.375
Can I charge my phone somewhere?

971
00:58:30.542 --> 00:58:32.102
There is just ten percent battery left.

972
00:58:33.667 --> 00:58:34.542
Kanagarasu.

973
00:58:34.625 --> 00:58:35.825
- Kanagarasu. come here!
- Yes?

974
00:58:36.917 --> 00:58:38.517
Put it on charge
somewhere safe. Give it…

975
00:58:39.375 --> 00:58:40.375
Switch it off.

976
00:58:44.042 --> 00:58:45.268
Where will you charge it? Careful.

977
00:58:45.292 --> 00:58:47.458
There is a police station nearby.
shall I put it there?

978
00:58:47.792 --> 00:58:50.250
See. I am working
for him as his boss.

979
00:58:50.333 --> 00:58:52.813
If I ask him again. I will lose
the little respect I have left.

980
00:58:57.375 --> 00:58:58.583
Oh. no!

981
00:58:59.375 --> 00:59:00.875
Uncle! Uncle!

982
00:59:03.167 --> 00:59:04.708
Just shut up and eat.

983
00:59:06.333 --> 00:59:08.167
- What happened. uncle?
- Nothing. son.

984
00:59:08.250 --> 00:59:09.250
Let's eat.

985
00:59:31.458 --> 00:59:32.458
I'll leave. uncle.

986
00:59:32.750 --> 00:59:34.500
What nonsense!
Why should you leave?

987
00:59:34.833 --> 00:59:36.914
It's uncle's order.
you can only leave after you eat.

988
00:59:39.250 --> 00:59:41.250
Don't you have any idea
when to talk about what?

989
00:59:42.750 --> 00:59:44.250
<i>Athaan.</i> look here.

990
00:59:44.417 --> 00:59:47.542
There is <i>poli. suzhiyam.</i>
<i>paal kozhukattai. ada prathaman payasam.</i>

991
00:59:47.625 --> 00:59:48.500
look here.

992
00:59:48.625 --> 00:59:52.625
<i>seppankizhangu</i> roast. <i>pudalangai usili.</i>
<i>aama vada</i> with <i>poondu podi.</i>

993
00:59:52.708 --> 00:59:53.726
And this.
I don't even know what it is.

994
00:59:53.750 --> 00:59:55.601
Hey! Tell me what else is there.
only then can I eat.

995
00:59:55.625 --> 00:59:57.042
Okay… okay… enough.

996
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:02.292
He is trying to change the
subject it seems. stupid fool!

997
01:00:02.750 --> 01:00:04.351
I'll do what I want.
You just keep quiet.

998
01:00:05.000 --> 01:00:06.333
<i>Athaan.</i> what's your phone number?

999
01:00:07.625 --> 01:00:08.625
Why. now?

1000
01:00:09.000 --> 01:00:11.184
When uncle told me.
I dialed it. but I forgot to save it.

1001
01:00:11.208 --> 01:00:12.208
Tell me.

1002
01:00:12.292 --> 01:00:15.292
- It's 9841618800.
- He's done for!

1003
01:00:15.833 --> 01:00:16.833
Angry?

1004
01:00:17.083 --> 01:00:18.083
Say it slowly.

1005
01:00:18.333 --> 01:00:20.014
It sounded like you
didn't want to give it.

1006
01:00:20.958 --> 01:00:21.958
Nine. eight.

1007
01:00:22.167 --> 01:00:23.167
Four. one.

1008
01:00:23.250 --> 01:00:24.250
Six. one.

1009
01:00:24.458 --> 01:00:25.458
Eight. eight.

1010
01:00:26.958 --> 01:00:27.958
Zero. one.

1011
01:00:29.167 --> 01:00:30.167
I'll leave. uncle.

1012
01:00:34.708 --> 01:00:36.184
You're wondering why I took it. right?

1013
01:00:36.208 --> 01:00:37.976
I note down
all important numbers here as well.

1014
01:00:38.000 --> 01:00:39.000
I don't trust the phone.

1015
01:00:39.125 --> 01:00:41.165
If anything goes wrong.
all the numbers get deleted.

1016
01:00:41.292 --> 01:00:43.667
CHENNAI
ATHAAN - 9841618801

1017
01:00:46.625 --> 01:00:47.792
You never took my number.

1018
01:00:49.542 --> 01:00:50.375
My phone isn't here.

1019
01:00:50.458 --> 01:00:51.601
So what if your phone isn't here?

1020
01:00:51.625 --> 01:00:53.226
You would have a piece of paper or
a visiting card in your wallet. right?

1021
01:00:53.250 --> 01:00:54.930
I don't have my wallet.
it's inside my bag.

1022
01:01:03.292 --> 01:01:06.208
Oh. my! <i>Athaan</i> has a lot of money!

1023
01:01:06.292 --> 01:01:08.333
I can ask him when in an emergency!

1024
01:01:13.500 --> 01:01:16.541
I am writing it on the blue card. don't
lose it and then search for it later.

1025
01:01:27.667 --> 01:01:28.917
<i>Athaan. </i>lift your bum.

1026
01:01:30.500 --> 01:01:33.061
With so much cash in it. how can you
keep your wallet in the bag?

1027
01:01:33.708 --> 01:01:34.708
Lift it just a little.

1028
01:01:41.500 --> 01:01:42.708
Someone's thinking about you.

1029
01:01:43.292 --> 01:01:45.601
Who else. it must be sister.
she ought to be wondering whether you ate.

1030
01:01:45.625 --> 01:01:48.500
No sister is thinking about him.
he's thinking about himself!

1031
01:01:49.333 --> 01:01:51.167
For all the trouble you're causing.

1032
01:01:51.250 --> 01:01:53.059
he's wondering whether
to ever come here again.

1033
01:01:53.083 --> 01:01:54.083
What did I do?

1034
01:01:54.542 --> 01:01:56.022
Is that what you're thinking. <i>Athaan?</i>

1035
01:02:00.167 --> 01:02:01.417
Then I won't talk anymore.

1036
01:02:01.583 --> 01:02:02.583
I will never talk.

1037
01:02:02.833 --> 01:02:03.833
Really?

1038
01:02:04.125 --> 01:02:05.583
I won't talk even
if you beg me to.

1039
01:02:05.917 --> 01:02:06.917
Now you're talking.

1040
01:02:07.125 --> 01:02:08.833
This is not talking.
This is telling.

1041
01:02:09.000 --> 01:02:10.351
Talking and telling
are two different things.

1042
01:02:10.375 --> 01:02:11.417
So you won't talk?

1043
01:02:14.375 --> 01:02:15.856
You're swearing on the onion <i>pachadi!</i>

1044
01:02:19.083 --> 01:02:21.333
So you swear
on the food you eat. is it?

1045
01:02:22.333 --> 01:02:23.333
Okay!

1046
01:02:23.542 --> 01:02:25.333
So. lifelong…

1047
01:02:29.375 --> 01:02:31.375
Oh. until you finish eating
you won't talk?

1048
01:02:31.625 --> 01:02:33.305
I imagined something else
and was so happy.

1049
01:02:34.500 --> 01:02:35.917
Even I shouldn't talk?

1050
01:02:36.167 --> 01:02:37.458
Okay. Deal.

1051
01:02:39.625 --> 01:02:40.785
P. BHUVANESHWARI
S. GIRIDHARAN

1052
01:03:14.250 --> 01:03:17.042
<i>Dearest women folk!</i>

1053
01:03:17.125 --> 01:03:18.417
<i>Welcome!</i>

1054
01:03:18.625 --> 01:03:22.667
<i>It's the wedding day!</i>

1055
01:03:22.958 --> 01:03:23.792
<i>The brotherhood…</i>

1056
01:03:23.875 --> 01:03:25.667
- Enough! enough!
<i>- In unison!</i>

1057
01:03:25.750 --> 01:03:26.958
<i>Come</i>

1058
01:03:27.042 --> 01:03:28.059
- Eat. brother.
<i>- And bless…</i>

1059
01:03:28.083 --> 01:03:30.042
- Did you eat?
<i>- Them!</i>

1060
01:03:30.125 --> 01:03:31.333
I will eat. you go and eat.

1061
01:03:31.667 --> 01:03:33.833
<i>To host the feast</i>

1062
01:03:33.917 --> 01:03:35.958
<i>The sacred day has arrived!</i>

1063
01:03:36.042 --> 01:03:40.083
<i>All our kith and kin
Have started coming!</i>

1064
01:03:40.417 --> 01:03:42.500
<i>Together. wholeheartedly</i>

1065
01:03:42.583 --> 01:03:44.333
<i>The folks have gathered to bless</i>

1066
01:03:44.417 --> 01:03:45.583
<i>They have gathered!</i>

1067
01:03:45.667 --> 01:03:47.708
<i>They are good people!</i>

1068
01:03:47.792 --> 01:03:50.417
<i>On the special banana leaf</i>

1069
01:03:50.500 --> 01:03:52.542
<i>Like the heart that serves</i>

1070
01:03:52.625 --> 01:03:54.667
<i>Hunger shall be satiated to the brim!</i>

1071
01:03:54.750 --> 01:03:56.333
<i>On this delightful day!</i>

1072
01:03:56.417 --> 01:03:59.083
<i>The legacy of hospitality</i>

1073
01:03:59.167 --> 01:04:01.292
<i>That is Tamil Nadu's Pride</i>

1074
01:04:01.375 --> 01:04:03.542
<i>A predominant attribute</i>

1075
01:04:03.625 --> 01:04:06.083
<i>Will shower blessings to live!</i>

1076
01:04:06.167 --> 01:04:08.333
<i>The </i>coconut poli<i> be served!</i>

1077
01:04:08.417 --> 01:04:10.375
<i>The </i>therattipal<i> be served!</i>

1078
01:04:10.458 --> 01:04:14.333
<i>The </i>suzhiyam soyaan<i> be served!</i>

1079
01:04:14.875 --> 01:04:17.042
<i>The </i>thavala adai dosai

1080
01:04:17.125 --> 01:04:19.292
<i>With the aromatic pepper curry</i>

1081
01:04:19.375 --> 01:04:23.167
<i>Feast on the ideal combination</i>

1082
01:04:26.125 --> 01:04:27.417
Son. he is asking for <i>rasam.</i>

1083
01:04:52.917 --> 01:04:53.958
You achieved it. my son!

1084
01:04:56.333 --> 01:04:57.814
<i>Athaan's</i> fingers are drying up. come.

1085
01:05:00.667 --> 01:05:01.583
How much has it charged?

1086
01:05:01.667 --> 01:05:03.827
You don't need to charge it
till you buy another phone.

1087
01:05:04.375 --> 01:05:05.615
It's my fault that I asked you!

1088
01:05:06.458 --> 01:05:07.292
<i>Athaan.</i>

1089
01:05:07.375 --> 01:05:08.893
if you have to say bye
to anyone. make it fast.

1090
01:05:08.917 --> 01:05:11.517
- I'll wait here. It's getting late.
- Not necessary. let's leave.

1091
01:05:12.250 --> 01:05:14.091
Are you going to leave
without telling Bhuvana?

1092
01:05:14.292 --> 01:05:15.458
She will be expecting you.

1093
01:05:15.583 --> 01:05:17.104
Didn't she say she would eat with you?

1094
01:05:17.500 --> 01:05:18.768
If she comes to know you're not
there at the wedding tomorrow.

1095
01:05:18.792 --> 01:05:19.832
she will make a big scene.

1096
01:05:20.292 --> 01:05:22.172
That's why I am saying
no to it. Come. let's go.

1097
01:05:24.667 --> 01:05:26.542
I'll keep it. You go on.

1098
01:05:28.833 --> 01:05:29.833
<i>Athaan.</i>

1099
01:05:29.875 --> 01:05:30.875
I'll just get my scooter.

1100
01:05:37.292 --> 01:05:38.125
Hello.

1101
01:05:38.208 --> 01:05:40.833
Sorry. had put my phone on charge.
that's why I missed your call.

1102
01:05:41.208 --> 01:05:43.167
Okay. okay.
Did everything go well?

1103
01:05:43.542 --> 01:05:44.542
Yes. all done.

1104
01:05:46.208 --> 01:05:48.125
We just finished
eating and came out.

1105
01:05:48.458 --> 01:05:49.458
We?

1106
01:05:49.542 --> 01:05:50.542
Who is this "we"?

1107
01:05:50.792 --> 01:05:53.917
Me. Sokku uncle. and another guy.

1108
01:05:54.375 --> 01:05:55.792
Who is this ' "another guy"?

1109
01:05:57.458 --> 01:05:59.167
That other guy is the one

1110
01:05:59.500 --> 01:06:01.333
who took me to the stage
and for dinner.

1111
01:06:01.833 --> 01:06:02.833
What. Arul?

1112
01:06:02.958 --> 01:06:04.278
You have been gone for just a day

1113
01:06:04.542 --> 01:06:07.250
- and you have changed into a native.
- Why?

1114
01:06:07.333 --> 01:06:09.094
<i>Your dialect. the way
you said he "took you"!</i>

1115
01:06:10.750 --> 01:06:12.042
Did I really sound like that?

1116
01:06:12.750 --> 01:06:14.083
He only accompanied me.

1117
01:06:14.708 --> 01:06:16.958
<i>- If I ask you to do something. will you?</i>
- What?

1118
01:06:17.292 --> 01:06:19.042
Why are you desperate
to get back home?

1119
01:06:19.375 --> 01:06:21.095
You can stay another day
and come. isn't it?

1120
01:06:21.333 --> 01:06:22.333
Why?

1121
01:06:22.542 --> 01:06:24.182
I don't know if you're able to notice it.

1122
01:06:24.458 --> 01:06:25.738
but your tone
itself has changed.

1123
01:06:26.708 --> 01:06:28.417
you sound happy.
That's why.

1124
01:06:30.542 --> 01:06:32.542
I don't want to…
Don't confuse me.

1125
01:06:32.750 --> 01:06:33.792
I have to leave now.

1126
01:06:34.417 --> 01:06:35.250
We are just about to leave.

1127
01:06:35.333 --> 01:06:37.134
That's exactly what I am saying.
Give it here.

1128
01:06:37.208 --> 01:06:39.917
Listen. if you don't start tonight
and reach here.

1129
01:06:40.000 --> 01:06:42.101
you won't be allowed to conduct
the rituals anywhere in this area.

1130
01:06:42.125 --> 01:06:43.601
<i>Priest. we have
booked an AC room for you.</i>

1131
01:06:43.625 --> 01:06:45.042
- Okay.
<i>- If you don't come on time…</i>

1132
01:06:45.125 --> 01:06:47.417
Who is continuously talking
in the background?

1133
01:06:47.792 --> 01:06:49.708
More than your voice.
I can hear that noise.

1134
01:06:49.833 --> 01:06:53.417
I told you. right. that guy who took me
around everywhere. It's him.

1135
01:06:54.042 --> 01:06:55.417
I met him at the wedding.

1136
01:06:56.667 --> 01:06:58.458
To be honest.
I am literally stuck with him.

1137
01:06:59.042 --> 01:07:00.042
Who is he?

1138
01:07:00.583 --> 01:07:02.264
That's what I told you. Hema.
I don't know.

1139
01:07:02.417 --> 01:07:04.458
But he seems to know me well.
He knows everything.

1140
01:07:04.875 --> 01:07:06.035
He's unbearably affectionate.

1141
01:07:06.083 --> 01:07:07.917
Okay. can't you ask someone?

1142
01:07:08.000 --> 01:07:09.083
How can I?

1143
01:07:09.375 --> 01:07:10.708
He's stuck to me like a magnet.

1144
01:07:11.125 --> 01:07:12.708
With him around. how can I ask?

1145
01:07:13.042 --> 01:07:15.375
Tell him directly that
you don't know him.

1146
01:07:15.625 --> 01:07:18.351
If he comes to know that I don't
know him. he won't be able to digest it.

1147
01:07:18.375 --> 01:07:20.518
If he comes to know that I pretended
to know him. that'll be it!

1148
01:07:20.542 --> 01:07:22.502
And you want me to go
and tell him now… forget it.

1149
01:07:22.875 --> 01:07:24.250
I've managed so far.

1150
01:07:24.333 --> 01:07:25.333
I will leave now.

1151
01:07:25.500 --> 01:07:26.500
It's only till then.

1152
01:07:26.917 --> 01:07:28.208
I'll maintain the same act.

1153
01:07:28.458 --> 01:07:30.417
Hey. that's wrong.

1154
01:07:30.917 --> 01:07:32.208
You shouldn't cheat like this.

1155
01:07:32.792 --> 01:07:35.292
If he finds out later he will
feel really bad. You understand?

1156
01:07:36.958 --> 01:07:39.167
Sorry. I overheard the last part.

1157
01:07:39.667 --> 01:07:41.518
You said you're going
to maintain something. What is that?

1158
01:07:41.542 --> 01:07:43.262
- No. nothing…
- Who is on the line? Sister?

1159
01:07:43.583 --> 01:07:44.500
Let me talk to her.

1160
01:07:44.583 --> 01:07:45.625
No. she doesn't know you.

1161
01:07:46.000 --> 01:07:47.018
<i>Why? Haven't you told her?</i>

1162
01:07:47.042 --> 01:07:48.162
It's alright. I'll tell her.

1163
01:07:48.250 --> 01:07:49.434
She may get angry.
that I am with you but I didn't talk.

1164
01:07:49.458 --> 01:07:51.099
- It's getting late.
- Keep quiet. <i>Athaan.</i>

1165
01:07:51.458 --> 01:07:53.208
<i>You address her as "baby"?</i>

1166
01:07:54.667 --> 01:07:56.809
You used to call your Sivan temple's
elephant also "baby." right?

1167
01:07:56.833 --> 01:07:58.194
Sister. how are you? Are you fine?

1168
01:07:59.500 --> 01:08:02.042
<i>You don't know me.
You've never met me.</i>

1169
01:08:02.250 --> 01:08:04.625
It's me who took good care
of your husband at the wedding.

1170
01:08:05.250 --> 01:08:07.292
Get all the details about
me later from <i>Athaan.</i>

1171
01:08:07.375 --> 01:08:09.176
- Oh.
- I've finished talking. Now. you speak.

1172
01:08:11.417 --> 01:08:12.937
Just simply ask me if I am doing fine.

1173
01:08:14.667 --> 01:08:16.125
Are you doing fine?

1174
01:08:16.208 --> 01:08:17.417
I am like a brother to you.

1175
01:08:17.667 --> 01:08:18.958
I am doing great. as always!

1176
01:08:19.042 --> 01:08:21.292
<i>Athaan</i> is also doing fine.
He had his dinner.

1177
01:08:21.417 --> 01:08:22.958
He'll reach for the morning coffee.

1178
01:08:23.167 --> 01:08:24.250
<i>You could've also come.</i>

1179
01:08:24.542 --> 01:08:26.375
I am happy that you at least sent him.

1180
01:08:26.625 --> 01:08:27.542
It's getting late.
and <i>Athaan</i> will get angry.

1181
01:08:27.625 --> 01:08:28.768
<i>I have to go drop him
at the bus stand.</i>

1182
01:08:28.792 --> 01:08:30.792
The rest we will talk
about in person. okay? Bye.

1183
01:08:31.292 --> 01:08:32.292
Bye!

1184
01:08:32.917 --> 01:08:34.542
She speaks so slowly.

1185
01:08:34.875 --> 01:08:35.875
You talk to her.

1186
01:08:37.542 --> 01:08:38.542
Hello.

1187
01:08:38.792 --> 01:08:41.083
Hey! Who is this?

1188
01:08:41.792 --> 01:08:42.792
You're asking me!

1189
01:08:43.542 --> 01:08:44.702
Did you ask him for his name?

1190
01:08:44.792 --> 01:08:45.792
No.

1191
01:08:46.458 --> 01:08:47.499
You should have asked him.

1192
01:08:49.708 --> 01:08:50.708
Okay. I'll talk later.

1193
01:08:53.500 --> 01:08:54.833
Why are you laughing?

1194
01:08:55.958 --> 01:08:56.958
Eat.

1195
01:08:57.875 --> 01:08:59.667
Sokku uncle. see you.

1196
01:09:00.500 --> 01:09:01.500
Take care of your health.

1197
01:09:04.167 --> 01:09:05.000
What is this. uncle?

1198
01:09:05.083 --> 01:09:07.625
Because of them.
you've forgotten your hometown.

1199
01:09:07.833 --> 01:09:09.554
distanced yourselves
from all the relations…

1200
01:09:09.625 --> 01:09:11.333
Even this uncle…

1201
01:09:21.833 --> 01:09:23.375
Okay. don't cry. don't cry.

1202
01:09:25.458 --> 01:09:26.458
Okay. son.

1203
01:09:26.583 --> 01:09:28.042
- have you taken everything?
- Yes.

1204
01:09:28.375 --> 01:09:29.750
- Have a safe journey.
- Yes.

1205
01:09:29.833 --> 01:09:31.292
Inform me once you reach.

1206
01:09:31.375 --> 01:09:32.458
Okay.

1207
01:09:32.542 --> 01:09:35.500
Hey. is it not enough that I cried.
why are you also crying?

1208
01:09:36.042 --> 01:09:38.458
He's come now isn't it. so he
will come more often hereafter.

1209
01:09:39.083 --> 01:09:40.875
Why are you telling me that?
Tell him.

1210
01:09:41.250 --> 01:09:42.792
Is he standing ten miles away?

1211
01:09:42.875 --> 01:09:44.708
He's listening
to everything you're saying.

1212
01:09:45.167 --> 01:09:46.351
He will definitely come. have faith.

1213
01:09:46.375 --> 01:09:47.500
Only you're saying that

1214
01:09:47.833 --> 01:09:49.953
- he's not opening his mouth.
- Trust me. He will come.

1215
01:09:50.125 --> 01:09:51.125
Take him and go.

1216
01:09:52.958 --> 01:09:53.958
See you. uncle.

1217
01:09:54.667 --> 01:09:55.667
Take care.

1218
01:09:58.917 --> 01:10:00.292
Go. drop him safely.

1219
01:10:04.250 --> 01:10:05.250
Don't cry.

1220
01:10:47.083 --> 01:10:49.292
<i>O' homeland!</i>

1221
01:10:49.625 --> 01:10:53.708
<i>What did you wait for to say?</i>

1222
01:10:54.208 --> 01:10:56.042
<i>All for my sake?</i>

1223
01:10:56.125 --> 01:10:58.333
<i>Like a magic hand</i>

1224
01:10:58.833 --> 01:11:00.708
<i>You held me</i>

1225
01:11:01.083 --> 01:11:03.625
<i>You charmed me</i>

1226
01:11:03.917 --> 01:11:05.083
<i>Why? O' why?</i>

1227
01:11:05.167 --> 01:11:07.625
<i>O' why did I land here?</i>

1228
01:11:07.917 --> 01:11:12.250
<i>Within my soul arises a question</i>

1229
01:11:12.542 --> 01:11:14.667
<i>In my turbulent heart!</i>

1230
01:11:15.000 --> 01:11:17.167
<i>The time of reluctant parting</i>

1231
01:11:17.250 --> 01:11:19.750
<i>Memories of an
Unbearably soothing burden</i>

1232
01:11:20.500 --> 01:11:21.958
<i>O' my homeland</i>

1233
01:11:22.375 --> 01:11:23.583
<i>Who am I?</i>

1234
01:11:23.667 --> 01:11:27.125
<i>Here…</i>

1235
01:11:47.208 --> 01:11:49.792
- Hey. what happened?
- Angu uncle's tea?

1236
01:11:50.375 --> 01:11:52.708
COUNTRY COW MILK
COUNTRY SUGAR TEA

1237
01:11:53.333 --> 01:11:54.917
Why now? It's getting late.

1238
01:11:55.083 --> 01:11:55.917
We have enough time. <i>Athaan.</i>

1239
01:11:56.000 --> 01:11:57.976
This tea is made out of native-breed milk.
with jaggery powder.

1240
01:11:58.000 --> 01:11:59.059
You won't get it in Madras.

1241
01:11:59.083 --> 01:12:00.083
Let's not…

1242
01:12:01.083 --> 01:12:02.792
Uncle. two special teas.

1243
01:12:08.542 --> 01:12:11.583
The sheer joy of drinking tea
after a good meal is something else!

1244
01:12:11.667 --> 01:12:12.667
Drink. <i>Athaan!</i>

1245
01:12:13.542 --> 01:12:14.809
It will be a sin if you don't drink!

1246
01:12:14.833 --> 01:12:15.954
Drink and tell me how it is.

1247
01:12:17.500 --> 01:12:19.833
- Superb! It's very nice.
- Isn't it?

1248
01:12:20.000 --> 01:12:21.583
Drink fast. let's leave.

1249
01:12:22.000 --> 01:12:24.040
We will miss the bus.
I have to go to work tomorrow.

1250
01:12:24.083 --> 01:12:25.333
I'll take care of it. <i>Athaan.</i>

1251
01:12:25.625 --> 01:12:27.586
They won't dare to move
the bus without asking me!

1252
01:12:51.083 --> 01:12:52.524
Just a second.
I'll ask him and come.

1253
01:12:53.667 --> 01:12:56.292
Sir. the bus to Chennai?

1254
01:12:56.708 --> 01:12:57.708
Chennai bus?

1255
01:12:57.792 --> 01:12:59.072
You're coming now and inquiring.

1256
01:12:59.167 --> 01:13:00.708
The last bus left 15 minutes ago.

1257
01:13:05.708 --> 01:13:08.669
Sir. please call and ask them to stop
the bus. <i>Athaan</i> has to leave tonight.

1258
01:13:10.958 --> 01:13:12.583
Can we stop the bus
for just one person?

1259
01:13:17.333 --> 01:13:18.976
Sir. just please find out
where the bus is.

1260
01:13:19.000 --> 01:13:20.434
I will chase it and catch up with it.

1261
01:13:20.458 --> 01:13:22.625
- Just ask him to drive slowly.
- On this scooter?

1262
01:13:23.417 --> 01:13:25.292
In five minutes.
the bus will hit the highway.

1263
01:13:25.375 --> 01:13:26.726
After that. even if you ride
on a Yamaha RX 100

1264
01:13:26.750 --> 01:13:28.110
at full speed. you won't catch up.

1265
01:13:29.542 --> 01:13:31.342
Sir. what other option is there?
Tell me. sir.

1266
01:13:31.500 --> 01:13:32.500
There's only one option.

1267
01:13:33.667 --> 01:13:36.667
Sleep. and in the morning take
the 07:30 a.m. bus to Thanjavur.

1268
01:13:37.208 --> 01:13:39.368
And from there board
the Volvo luxury bus at 08:00 a.m.

1269
01:13:39.583 --> 01:13:42.208
It'll drop you off at Guindy
easily between 02:00 to 02:30 p.m.

1270
01:13:59.625 --> 01:14:01.375
Talk only if there is
another way to go.

1271
01:14:02.250 --> 01:14:03.410
otherwise don't say anything.

1272
01:14:06.958 --> 01:14:07.958
No. right?

1273
01:14:11.833 --> 01:14:14.474
I've told them I'll be there at the office
for something important.

1274
01:14:15.042 --> 01:14:17.458
What shall I tell them now?
That I missed the bus.

1275
01:14:18.667 --> 01:14:19.667
They will laugh at me.

1276
01:14:20.625 --> 01:14:21.958
<i>Athaan.</i> don't get tensed.

1277
01:14:22.083 --> 01:14:23.644
If you get tense.
I won't get any ideas.

1278
01:14:23.875 --> 01:14:25.250
You don't have to give any idea.

1279
01:14:25.417 --> 01:14:26.875
He just told everything clearly.

1280
01:14:29.667 --> 01:14:31.307
Let's figure out what has to be done now.

1281
01:14:31.625 --> 01:14:32.625
Sir.

1282
01:14:34.250 --> 01:14:37.250
Sir. is there a lodge
anywhere close by?

1283
01:14:37.458 --> 01:14:38.458
Lodge?

1284
01:14:39.000 --> 01:14:40.000
Sir?

1285
01:14:43.500 --> 01:14:44.625
Do you know any lodge?

1286
01:14:46.542 --> 01:14:48.934
Hey. if you know. say you do.
or if you don't. say you don't.

1287
01:14:48.958 --> 01:14:50.759
or at least find out
from someone and tell me.

1288
01:14:52.167 --> 01:14:53.083
Okay. I'll find out myself.

1289
01:14:53.167 --> 01:14:54.601
Why lodge. <i>Athaan?</i>
My house is there.

1290
01:14:54.625 --> 01:14:57.185
- you can sleep and leave in the morning.
- I don't want all that.

1291
01:14:57.583 --> 01:14:59.583
Can you take me to a lodge now or not?

1292
01:15:01.375 --> 01:15:02.375
I can't. <i>Athaan.</i>

1293
01:15:03.333 --> 01:15:04.667
Okay. I'll figure it out myself.

1294
01:15:05.250 --> 01:15:06.417
<i>Athaan… Athaan…</i>

1295
01:15:13.458 --> 01:15:14.917
<i>Athaan.</i> do you think this is Madras?

1296
01:15:15.500 --> 01:15:17.260
There are just two lodges
near the bus stand.

1297
01:15:17.750 --> 01:15:20.471
There will be cockroaches in
the toilet and bed bugs on the mattress.

1298
01:15:20.750 --> 01:15:23.431
It will be pathetic. <i>Athaan.</i>
And you're saying you want to go there.

1299
01:15:23.500 --> 01:15:24.559
For the cleanliness you seek.

1300
01:15:24.583 --> 01:15:25.768
you won't even go
inside with your slippers.

1301
01:15:25.792 --> 01:15:27.583
Let there be any insect.
I'll handle it.

1302
01:15:27.875 --> 01:15:29.167
<i>Athaan.</i> please listen to me.

1303
01:15:30.833 --> 01:15:32.042
Okay. come. I'll take you.

1304
01:15:37.292 --> 01:15:38.292
Come. <i>Athaan.</i>

1305
01:15:43.875 --> 01:15:45.792
Did I ask you for that
native-breed milk tea?

1306
01:15:47.000 --> 01:15:48.000
Did I?

1307
01:16:01.875 --> 01:16:08.000
PANDIAN LODGE

1308
01:16:08.083 --> 01:16:14.208
PRABHU LODGE

1309
01:16:14.292 --> 01:16:16.583
There is one on this side and.
another on this side.

1310
01:16:16.708 --> 01:16:17.708
Go take a look.

1311
01:16:26.625 --> 01:16:27.750
I can manage from here.

1312
01:16:28.833 --> 01:16:29.833
You leave.

1313
01:16:33.208 --> 01:16:35.042
Anyway. thanks.

1314
01:17:35.000 --> 01:17:36.000
You didn't leave?

1315
01:17:42.000 --> 01:17:43.000
Both are okay…

1316
01:17:45.958 --> 01:17:46.958
But no…

1317
01:17:47.958 --> 01:17:49.958
Just a little further ahead.
there's another lodge.

1318
01:17:50.667 --> 01:17:52.187
But it won't be as clean as these two.

1319
01:17:52.500 --> 01:17:53.500
Shall we go?

1320
01:17:57.625 --> 01:17:58.625
Shall we go home?

1321
01:18:03.667 --> 01:18:04.708
<i>Hold me tightly. Athaan!</i>

1322
01:18:14.833 --> 01:18:16.143
You can stop the scooter and then talk.

1323
01:18:16.167 --> 01:18:17.167
Just a minute. <i>Athaan.</i>

1324
01:18:17.583 --> 01:18:19.167
Hello! It's me.

1325
01:18:20.375 --> 01:18:21.583
Now listen carefully.

1326
01:18:21.958 --> 01:18:22.958
Thanks. <i>Athaan.</i>

1327
01:18:23.083 --> 01:18:24.458
I am bringing Arul <i>Athaan</i> home.

1328
01:18:25.625 --> 01:18:26.458
What do you mean by who?

1329
01:18:26.583 --> 01:18:28.292
Arul <i>Athaan.</i> Nambi uncle…

1330
01:18:29.250 --> 01:18:30.333
Yes. it's him… yes!

1331
01:18:30.708 --> 01:18:32.125
He's going to stay
with us tonight.

1332
01:18:32.458 --> 01:18:34.208
Get everything ready accordingly. okay?

1333
01:18:34.750 --> 01:18:37.125
Hey… Have you eaten?
She hung up.

1334
01:18:40.875 --> 01:18:41.875
<i>Athaan.</i>

1335
01:18:42.625 --> 01:18:45.226
If I say something. you shouldn't
remove your slippers and hit me.

1336
01:18:45.458 --> 01:18:46.779
I don't know.
Say it and find out.

1337
01:18:47.667 --> 01:18:48.708
It's okay. I'll say it.

1338
01:18:49.625 --> 01:18:52.458
I am so happy you didn't go to Madras.

1339
01:18:53.000 --> 01:18:54.000
I am not.

1340
01:18:54.292 --> 01:18:55.292
That I know.

1341
01:18:55.583 --> 01:18:56.958
Guess why I am happy?

1342
01:18:57.417 --> 01:18:58.417
That also I don't know.

1343
01:18:59.167 --> 01:19:02.208
Because you're going
to stay in my house!

1344
01:19:04.625 --> 01:19:05.625
Big deal. <i>Athaan!</i>

1345
01:19:05.750 --> 01:19:07.684
What's going to happen
if you don't go to work for a day?

1346
01:19:07.708 --> 01:19:08.792
You have come all the way.

1347
01:19:08.875 --> 01:19:10.583
Why don't you just
spend a day relaxing.

1348
01:19:10.708 --> 01:19:12.308
attend your sister's wedding
and then go?

1349
01:19:12.417 --> 01:19:15.833
Instead. you're always
in a hurry to leave.

1350
01:19:21.500 --> 01:19:23.292
Hey. have you boarded the bus?

1351
01:19:23.708 --> 01:19:25.250
I called to tell you about that.

1352
01:19:25.708 --> 01:19:26.833
<i>Why? What happened?</i>

1353
01:19:27.625 --> 01:19:29.083
I missed the bus.

1354
01:19:29.583 --> 01:19:31.542
Hey… What happened?

1355
01:19:31.625 --> 01:19:32.667
I'll tell you that later.

1356
01:19:32.750 --> 01:19:34.500
For now. I've missed the bus. That's all.

1357
01:19:34.708 --> 01:19:36.518
Just do me a favor.
Call my office tomorrow and

1358
01:19:36.542 --> 01:19:37.708
inform them that I am sick.

1359
01:19:37.792 --> 01:19:39.833
Okay. what are you going to do now?

1360
01:19:40.208 --> 01:19:42.708
I'll stay here tonight
and leave in the morning.

1361
01:19:44.083 --> 01:19:45.083
Where are you staying?

1362
01:19:49.500 --> 01:19:50.500
Teacher!

1363
01:19:51.833 --> 01:19:52.833
Come. <i>Athaan.</i>

1364
01:19:52.917 --> 01:19:54.317
<i>Athaan</i> has arrived.
Come fast. come.

1365
01:19:55.750 --> 01:19:56.875
Welcome. brother!

1366
01:19:56.958 --> 01:19:57.999
This is our house. <i>Athaan.</i>

1367
01:20:00.375 --> 01:20:01.417
First. get water.

1368
01:20:07.375 --> 01:20:09.015
BHARATHIAR
KAVIMANI DESIGAVINAYAGAM PILLAI

1369
01:20:09.042 --> 01:20:10.625
BIRSA MUNDA
P. KAKKAN

1370
01:20:18.542 --> 01:20:19.742
<i>Athaan.</i> why did you stop here?

1371
01:20:20.292 --> 01:20:21.125
I was just taking a look.

1372
01:20:21.292 --> 01:20:23.212
They will always be here.
they won't go anywhere.

1373
01:20:23.625 --> 01:20:24.458
Come. let's go inside.

1374
01:20:24.625 --> 01:20:25.643
Tell me what you want to eat.

1375
01:20:25.667 --> 01:20:26.809
- she will get it ready immediately.
- No.

1376
01:20:26.833 --> 01:20:28.353
Shall I ask her to make coffee or tea?

1377
01:20:28.833 --> 01:20:29.833
We already had it. right?

1378
01:20:30.917 --> 01:20:32.208
Will you have something light?

1379
01:20:32.458 --> 01:20:34.958
Oh. no! I am full after eating
at the reception.

1380
01:20:35.583 --> 01:20:37.542
When I come next time.
I'll come and have a meal.

1381
01:20:38.125 --> 01:20:39.125
It's okay. brother.

1382
01:20:39.167 --> 01:20:41.250
Ask for anything you want.
Don't hesitate.

1383
01:20:42.208 --> 01:20:45.917
I am feeling sweaty. can you
tell me where the bathroom is?

1384
01:20:46.167 --> 01:20:47.167
You want to have a bath?

1385
01:20:47.542 --> 01:20:49.726
You can bathe in the bathroom
or shall we go to the river?

1386
01:20:49.750 --> 01:20:50.750
To the river?

1387
01:20:51.667 --> 01:20:52.667
At this hour?

1388
01:20:53.042 --> 01:20:54.522
Did you believe it?
I was just joking.

1389
01:20:54.667 --> 01:20:57.292
- Hot water or cold water?
- Cold.

1390
01:20:57.375 --> 01:20:58.893
Come… come… I will show you
the bathroom and I will also take a bath.

1391
01:20:58.917 --> 01:21:00.351
There is a new "Margo"
soap inside. <i>Athaan.</i>

1392
01:21:00.375 --> 01:21:02.476
Outside near the mirror. you'll find the
comb. oil. and powder.

1393
01:21:02.500 --> 01:21:05.661
You quickly take a bath. I will also go
swiftly and take a bath in the backyard.

1394
01:21:05.958 --> 01:21:08.101
Why are you taking the bag?
Are you going to bathe it or what?

1395
01:21:08.125 --> 01:21:10.083
Hey! My towel and clothes are inside.

1396
01:21:10.375 --> 01:21:13.500
Why? Won't I have a towel?
Won't we give it. if you ask?

1397
01:21:14.042 --> 01:21:16.083
If it gets wet.
it won't dry by morning. <i>Athaan!</i>

1398
01:21:16.458 --> 01:21:18.184
Are you going to keep a wet
towel inside the bag and go?

1399
01:21:18.208 --> 01:21:19.208
It will stink.

1400
01:21:19.458 --> 01:21:21.833
I have a new Turkey towel.
you start having your bath.

1401
01:21:22.042 --> 01:21:23.934
Before you remove your clothes.
I'll hang the towel on the wall.

1402
01:21:23.958 --> 01:21:24.958
<i>Okay.</i>

1403
01:21:25.083 --> 01:21:26.542
Can you go? I have to bathe.

1404
01:21:26.792 --> 01:21:28.392
Shall we see who finishes bathing first?

1405
01:21:28.667 --> 01:21:31.042
- Shall we see?
- Come on! Let's see!

1406
01:21:56.000 --> 01:21:57.000
Hey!

1407
01:21:57.750 --> 01:21:58.750
<i>Athaan.</i>

1408
01:21:59.167 --> 01:22:00.167
do you drink beer?

1409
01:22:00.500 --> 01:22:02.208
Beer? No. I don't want it right now.

1410
01:22:02.542 --> 01:22:03.583
So. you drink.

1411
01:22:04.500 --> 01:22:06.140
No… but I really don't want it right now.

1412
01:22:07.167 --> 01:22:08.750
Did I ask whether
you want it or not?

1413
01:22:08.875 --> 01:22:10.000
I only asked

1414
01:22:10.250 --> 01:22:11.250
whether you drink.

1415
01:22:11.333 --> 01:22:12.792
Answer only the question. okay?

1416
01:22:12.875 --> 01:22:14.792
Okay. sir. I drink. sir!

1417
01:22:15.000 --> 01:22:16.583
Good. let that fear be.

1418
01:22:16.667 --> 01:22:18.267
Two for me and two
for you. is that okay?

1419
01:22:18.583 --> 01:22:19.583
No. one is enough for me.

1420
01:22:20.375 --> 01:22:21.809
Again you're answering
out of the syllabus.

1421
01:22:21.833 --> 01:22:22.976
Wait. let me peep in.
only then you will cave.

1422
01:22:23.000 --> 01:22:24.458
Hey! No…

1423
01:22:24.750 --> 01:22:26.167
Let us both have two beers each.

1424
01:22:27.417 --> 01:22:28.777
Okay. I am going
to finish my bath.

1425
01:22:29.000 --> 01:22:30.708
I think you will lose the competition.

1426
01:23:15.250 --> 01:23:16.250
Brother.

1427
01:23:18.958 --> 01:23:19.958
Brother.

1428
01:23:20.333 --> 01:23:23.042
after your bath. he asked
you to go near the well.

1429
01:23:24.000 --> 01:23:27.042
Sorry. I never asked for all of this…

1430
01:23:27.458 --> 01:23:28.458
No problem. brother.

1431
01:23:28.875 --> 01:23:30.667
He also drinks occasionally.

1432
01:23:30.917 --> 01:23:32.917
Poor soul. he's come up the hard way.

1433
01:23:33.125 --> 01:23:35.375
So I just let him be happy.

1434
01:23:35.833 --> 01:23:36.875
Not just that…

1435
01:23:37.000 --> 01:23:38.417
He likes you a lot.

1436
01:23:39.375 --> 01:23:40.936
This day. that you
have come and stayed.

1437
01:23:41.000 --> 01:23:44.292
he will talk about it through the year
with everyone he meets.

1438
01:23:44.375 --> 01:23:45.375
Just wait and watch.

1439
01:23:47.125 --> 01:23:48.292
Even the lizard is approving!

1440
01:23:49.958 --> 01:23:51.750
He normally talks a lot.

1441
01:23:51.875 --> 01:23:54.708
but when he drinks. don't ask!
He talks a lot more.

1442
01:23:54.833 --> 01:23:56.917
For ten questions you have one answer.

1443
01:23:57.000 --> 01:23:58.792
You both are a good match.

1444
01:23:59.083 --> 01:24:00.958
Even then. please adjust.

1445
01:24:01.250 --> 01:24:02.650
That's okay.
What's wrong with that?

1446
01:24:03.000 --> 01:24:05.125
It's late. please sleep.

1447
01:24:05.500 --> 01:24:08.958
Till he comes. I won't be able to sleep.
I will just be lying down.

1448
01:24:09.292 --> 01:24:10.375
I am used to that.

1449
01:24:34.375 --> 01:24:35.375
The garden is beautiful.

1450
01:24:36.750 --> 01:24:39.333
You said it was beer.
and you have a pot. Is it toddy?

1451
01:24:39.667 --> 01:24:41.042
It's beer… beer only. <i>Athaan.</i>

1452
01:24:41.333 --> 01:24:42.934
I don't like Chilled beer
from the fridge.

1453
01:24:42.958 --> 01:24:43.792
pot beer is better.

1454
01:24:43.875 --> 01:24:45.018
Drink and see. It will be fine.

1455
01:24:45.042 --> 01:24:46.042
Sit down.

1456
01:24:51.708 --> 01:24:54.069
<i>Athaan.</i> I am just pouring a little.
the remaining is inside.

1457
01:25:04.625 --> 01:25:05.706
Which song is this. <i>Athaan?</i>

1458
01:25:07.208 --> 01:25:08.208
Song?

1459
01:25:08.458 --> 01:25:09.458
Yes. what you just sang.

1460
01:25:10.208 --> 01:25:11.208
Did I sing?

1461
01:25:12.250 --> 01:25:14.458
Lovely song. <i>Athaan.</i>
sing it once more. I'll know then.

1462
01:25:15.417 --> 01:25:16.417
Which song?

1463
01:25:16.958 --> 01:25:17.958
What is this. <i>Athaan?</i>

1464
01:25:19.042 --> 01:25:20.042
Damn!

1465
01:25:20.708 --> 01:25:23.029
If I don't find out what that
song was. my head will burst.

1466
01:25:24.458 --> 01:25:26.833
It's somewhere here.
it's not coming out now.

1467
01:25:27.833 --> 01:25:29.417
It will come. Here. cheers!

1468
01:25:31.208 --> 01:25:32.208
Cheers!

1469
01:25:45.625 --> 01:25:47.305
You wouldn't have expected. right. <i>Athaan?</i>

1470
01:25:47.417 --> 01:25:49.167
After so many years… with me.

1471
01:25:49.917 --> 01:25:52.833
Gazing at the sky
and blissfully drinking beer.

1472
01:25:54.000 --> 01:25:56.520
By now you would be traveling
past our town with a serious face.

1473
01:25:56.750 --> 01:25:57.750
Yes.

1474
01:25:58.000 --> 01:25:59.000
thanks.

1475
01:25:59.333 --> 01:26:00.333
Come on. <i>Athaan!</i>

1476
01:26:00.375 --> 01:26:03.000
My luck was so good.
that you had to come and stay here.

1477
01:26:03.500 --> 01:26:05.181
Have some<i> karasev. Athaan.</i>
Nandini made it.

1478
01:26:07.833 --> 01:26:08.833
It's nice.

1479
01:26:15.750 --> 01:26:16.750
Bhuvana?

1480
01:26:18.083 --> 01:26:19.804
If you feel like talking.
just talk. <i>Athaan.</i>

1481
01:26:20.333 --> 01:26:22.133
I told her something
and kind of confused her.

1482
01:26:22.583 --> 01:26:23.601
There won't be any problem.

1483
01:26:23.625 --> 01:26:25.018
Even if someone gets
caught it will be me.

1484
01:26:25.042 --> 01:26:26.042
You're safe!

1485
01:26:26.958 --> 01:26:27.958
What did you say?

1486
01:26:28.625 --> 01:26:29.458
Tell me.

1487
01:26:29.583 --> 01:26:31.144
Only then I can manage. when she calls.

1488
01:26:31.583 --> 01:26:32.768
That's what even
I can't understand.

1489
01:26:32.792 --> 01:26:34.472
I just blabbered whatever
came to my mouth.

1490
01:26:34.667 --> 01:26:37.187
By the time Bhuvana makes sense of it.
the wedding will be over.

1491
01:26:37.917 --> 01:26:39.317
When did you have
this conversation?

1492
01:26:39.833 --> 01:26:41.792
When you dropped the mug
while taking a bath.

1493
01:26:48.417 --> 01:26:49.577
It's truly a beautiful house.

1494
01:26:51.375 --> 01:26:52.775
Is this the house
where you grew up?

1495
01:26:53.042 --> 01:26:54.042
- This?
- Yes…

1496
01:26:54.417 --> 01:26:55.417
No. <i>Athaan.</i>

1497
01:26:55.750 --> 01:26:57.518
In the house where I grew up.
if we stretch and sleep.

1498
01:26:57.542 --> 01:26:58.893
our hands and legs will hit the wall.

1499
01:26:58.917 --> 01:26:59.917
It's very small.

1500
01:27:00.458 --> 01:27:01.779
This is my father-in-law's house.

1501
01:27:01.875 --> 01:27:03.155
It was built by his grandfather.

1502
01:27:04.458 --> 01:27:05.542
A similar story to yours.

1503
01:27:06.417 --> 01:27:08.000
My wife was born
with two siblings.

1504
01:27:08.083 --> 01:27:09.644
One elder sister.
and one elder brother.

1505
01:27:09.750 --> 01:27:11.311
including her there were three of them.

1506
01:27:11.750 --> 01:27:14.430
After my father-in-law died. there
were fights to divide the wealth.

1507
01:27:14.875 --> 01:27:18.625
They both were arguing.
over what belonged to whom.

1508
01:27:18.708 --> 01:27:19.708
My wife was like.

1509
01:27:19.750 --> 01:27:22.184
"This is the house where my parents
lived. and this is where we grew up.

1510
01:27:22.208 --> 01:27:23.250
we shouldn't sell it."

1511
01:27:23.917 --> 01:27:26.458
She was sitting in one corner
and crying quietly.

1512
01:27:27.042 --> 01:27:29.167
I felt really bad. I thought about it.

1513
01:27:29.792 --> 01:27:31.592
I inquired about
the market rate of the house.

1514
01:27:31.958 --> 01:27:35.625
I somehow arranged for the funds
and settled the two of them.

1515
01:27:36.042 --> 01:27:37.562
Then registered the house in her name.

1516
01:27:38.542 --> 01:27:39.542
Now this is her house.

1517
01:27:40.667 --> 01:27:42.947
Only after coming here.
many good things happened. <i>Athaan.</i>

1518
01:27:43.208 --> 01:27:44.500
She conceived recently.

1519
01:27:45.000 --> 01:27:46.542
Oh! Congratulations.

1520
01:27:47.875 --> 01:27:49.356
All the other times
were miscarriages.

1521
01:27:49.458 --> 01:27:50.578
It's just been three months.

1522
01:27:50.958 --> 01:27:52.667
Doctor has asked us to be very careful.

1523
01:27:52.750 --> 01:27:54.590
That's why I didn't bring her
to the reception.

1524
01:27:55.250 --> 01:27:56.531
It's a very lucky house. <i>Athaan.</i>

1525
01:27:56.875 --> 01:27:58.995
If I had known.
I would've wished her. when I saw her.

1526
01:27:59.292 --> 01:28:00.292
I didn't notice.

1527
01:28:00.375 --> 01:28:01.500
So what. <i>Athaan?</i>

1528
01:28:01.583 --> 01:28:03.464
It's just been three months.
You can't make out.

1529
01:28:03.625 --> 01:28:05.042
It's just a small bump.

1530
01:28:15.583 --> 01:28:19.208
<i>Your hip sways</i>

1531
01:28:19.417 --> 01:28:23.208
<i>Your eyes search for a place</i>

1532
01:28:23.292 --> 01:28:26.708
<i>The sight of your
Feminine form makes me shy</i>

1533
01:28:26.958 --> 01:28:30.792
<i>Happiness burdens me</i>

1534
01:28:30.875 --> 01:28:34.500
<i>What. my darling?</i>

1535
01:28:38.375 --> 01:28:39.667
<i>What. my darling?</i>

1536
01:28:39.750 --> 01:28:43.042
<i>- Thinking about you
- My body shines</i>

1537
01:28:43.125 --> 01:28:45.583
<i>And it pains</i>

1538
01:28:45.667 --> 01:28:47.042
<i>To express that</i>

1539
01:28:47.125 --> 01:28:48.833
<i>It pierces my heart</i>

1540
01:28:48.917 --> 01:28:50.333
<i>Even in heaven</i>

1541
01:28:50.417 --> 01:28:53.083
<i>My Lord is testing me</i>

1542
01:28:53.167 --> 01:28:56.667
<i>- Your body
- Overflows with passion</i>

1543
01:28:56.750 --> 01:29:00.333
<i>Glad that I stay in tune with it</i>

1544
01:29:00.417 --> 01:29:02.375
<i>- This deer…
- This deer…</i>

1545
01:29:03.792 --> 01:29:04.792
That man killed it!

1546
01:29:12.917 --> 01:29:14.437
With this. one bottle is over. <i>Athaan.</i>

1547
01:29:14.875 --> 01:29:17.208
The shirt you were wearing
at the wedding was superb.

1548
01:29:17.500 --> 01:29:19.220
For your complexion.
you looked like a hero.

1549
01:29:20.000 --> 01:29:21.083
Bhuvana bought it for me.

1550
01:29:21.875 --> 01:29:23.583
I know. I know.
It was her choice.

1551
01:29:23.875 --> 01:29:25.375
But it was me
who sent you the shirt.

1552
01:29:26.417 --> 01:29:27.417
Is that so?

1553
01:29:28.000 --> 01:29:29.643
The shirt you were wearing
was also very nice.

1554
01:29:29.667 --> 01:29:30.500
Lies!

1555
01:29:30.667 --> 01:29:32.292
Don't just say it.
because I said it.

1556
01:29:32.375 --> 01:29:34.875
Will anyone lie after drinking?

1557
01:29:35.042 --> 01:29:36.250
It really was nice.

1558
01:29:36.667 --> 01:29:37.667
Actually. yes!

1559
01:29:40.292 --> 01:29:43.417
Right from when I was a youngster.
I had a thing for new shirts.

1560
01:29:44.125 --> 01:29:45.750
That smell…

1561
01:29:47.167 --> 01:29:50.500
The thing is. till I started earning.
I never wore new shirts.

1562
01:29:50.708 --> 01:29:52.949
Someone would give me some old ones.
I used to wear them.

1563
01:29:53.500 --> 01:29:55.125
And we never had
slippers as well.

1564
01:29:55.875 --> 01:29:58.167
so our relatives
never accepted us.

1565
01:29:58.917 --> 01:30:00.292
They used to live nearby.

1566
01:30:00.417 --> 01:30:01.897
but they hardly gave a damn about us.

1567
01:30:02.583 --> 01:30:04.667
They wouldn't even allow us
to play with their kids.

1568
01:30:06.125 --> 01:30:07.643
By any chance. if they saw
my father on the road.

1569
01:30:07.667 --> 01:30:09.042
they would just ignore him.

1570
01:30:09.833 --> 01:30:11.292
At that age.

1571
01:30:12.458 --> 01:30:13.498
it really used to hurt me.

1572
01:30:17.417 --> 01:30:18.917
We can't blame anyone. <i>Athaan.</i>

1573
01:30:19.292 --> 01:30:20.972
Everyone is nice.
in some way or the other.

1574
01:30:21.750 --> 01:30:24.167
Money is the root cause
of all the trouble.

1575
01:30:26.042 --> 01:30:27.762
But your father was
never like that. <i>Athaan.</i>

1576
01:30:28.375 --> 01:30:30.256
I used to like him a lot
from when I was little.

1577
01:30:30.583 --> 01:30:31.458
I was such a small kid.

1578
01:30:31.542 --> 01:30:33.375
he used to address
me with respect.

1579
01:30:34.708 --> 01:30:36.667
Not just him. even your mother.

1580
01:30:37.375 --> 01:30:40.333
your Chinna uncle.
Sokku uncle. Bhuvana.

1581
01:30:40.708 --> 01:30:42.125
your elder brother. and you.

1582
01:30:42.750 --> 01:30:44.833
you were all exactly the same.

1583
01:30:45.167 --> 01:30:47.375
you all never gave importance to money.

1584
01:30:48.292 --> 01:30:49.812
You gave importance
to their character.

1585
01:30:50.458 --> 01:30:53.375
Only after seeing all of you.
I yearned for everyone.

1586
01:31:00.083 --> 01:31:01.083
What?

1587
01:31:02.333 --> 01:31:03.333
What is it?

1588
01:31:06.000 --> 01:31:08.125
Wait. I am coming.
<i>Athaan.</i> get up.

1589
01:31:08.333 --> 01:31:09.833
I'll introduce you to someone.

1590
01:31:28.792 --> 01:31:30.417
Hey! He's tied firmly. right?

1591
01:31:30.750 --> 01:31:32.150
A double rope has
been used. <i>Athaan.</i>

1592
01:31:32.583 --> 01:31:34.083
But this is nothing for him.

1593
01:31:34.333 --> 01:31:36.174
if he decides to.
he will just unleash himself!

1594
01:31:36.333 --> 01:31:37.333
It's all fine. come on.

1595
01:31:38.042 --> 01:31:40.417
Let's not go any closer.
His glare doesn't seem normal.

1596
01:31:40.500 --> 01:31:42.792
That's not an issue. <i>Athaan.</i>
I am here. right? Just come.

1597
01:31:43.375 --> 01:31:44.667
Dhoni baby!

1598
01:31:45.250 --> 01:31:46.458
You called out for Daddy?

1599
01:31:47.417 --> 01:31:48.458
It's stunning.

1600
01:31:48.542 --> 01:31:49.542
What breed is the bull?

1601
01:31:49.792 --> 01:31:50.958
- This one?
- Yes…

1602
01:31:51.250 --> 01:31:52.250
Kangayam. <i>Athaan.</i>

1603
01:31:52.708 --> 01:31:54.708
He only looks scary. <i>Athaan.</i>

1604
01:31:54.792 --> 01:31:55.912
He's an affectionate fellow.

1605
01:31:55.958 --> 01:31:56.958
My baby boy!

1606
01:31:57.083 --> 01:31:58.404
In the cattle fair at Thiruvonam.

1607
01:31:58.792 --> 01:32:01.750
he had no buyers
as he was all skin and bones.

1608
01:32:02.083 --> 01:32:03.125
I felt really bad.

1609
01:32:03.708 --> 01:32:04.958
so I made the decision

1610
01:32:05.750 --> 01:32:07.750
and loaded him onto
the mini truck and brought him.

1611
01:32:08.542 --> 01:32:09.625
In the beginning.

1612
01:32:10.375 --> 01:32:11.458
he used to be weak.

1613
01:32:12.083 --> 01:32:13.101
He won't even eat properly.

1614
01:32:13.125 --> 01:32:14.765
I had to literally feed
him with my hands.

1615
01:32:14.958 --> 01:32:17.250
Only after he grew up.
we realized who he really was!

1616
01:32:18.000 --> 01:32:21.250
<i>With those small horns of his.
he was charging at everyone he saw.</i>

1617
01:32:21.917 --> 01:32:24.792
<i>I was stunned.
I got Sokku uncle and showed him.</i>

1618
01:32:25.500 --> 01:32:26.750
<i>He saw him</i>

1619
01:32:27.000 --> 01:32:29.083
<i>and wanted to know where I got him.
His jaw dropped!</i>

1620
01:32:30.042 --> 01:32:32.125
<i>I felt a small sense
of pride within me.</i>

1621
01:32:32.292 --> 01:32:33.492
<i>I felt proud as a calf parent.</i>

1622
01:32:34.042 --> 01:32:35.667
<i>Then we let our boy grow for a year.</i>

1623
01:32:36.000 --> 01:32:37.292
<i>he himself trained him.</i>

1624
01:32:37.875 --> 01:32:39.458
<i>He also got involved
and played well.</i>

1625
01:32:40.125 --> 01:32:41.885
<i>I only panicked cause
he was a sheltered boy.</i>

1626
01:32:42.042 --> 01:32:44.583
<i>and he could get
hurt playing rough.</i>

1627
01:32:44.667 --> 01:32:46.583
- Hey. go!
<i>- I would get scared</i>

1628
01:32:46.708 --> 01:32:47.833
<i>and yelled at as well.</i>

1629
01:32:49.583 --> 01:32:51.125
Yes. come on!

1630
01:32:51.458 --> 01:32:53.167
Look at how you leaped!

1631
01:32:53.542 --> 01:32:55.851
Is it enough to only keep an eye on those
who are coming from the front?

1632
01:32:55.875 --> 01:32:58.916
More than twenty people will come and
pounce on you from all four directions.

1633
01:32:59.000 --> 01:33:00.958
You should keep
an eye on all sides.

1634
01:33:01.042 --> 01:33:02.402
Otherwise. you will lose the game.

1635
01:33:03.708 --> 01:33:04.833
Shall we play again?

1636
01:33:05.625 --> 01:33:06.625
Will you play well?

1637
01:33:07.083 --> 01:33:08.208
Okay. baby!

1638
01:33:13.583 --> 01:33:15.500
<i>Once the training ended.</i>

1639
01:33:15.583 --> 01:33:17.024
<i>his young. tender body had vanished.</i>

1640
01:33:17.208 --> 01:33:19.409
<i>He was like the "Nandhi"
statue at The Thanjavur temple.</i>

1641
01:33:20.000 --> 01:33:22.042
He looked really solid.

1642
01:33:22.125 --> 01:33:23.845
so I thought why not let him
into the arena?

1643
01:33:23.917 --> 01:33:25.250
The next year…

1644
01:33:26.750 --> 01:33:28.125
I think it was 2012.

1645
01:33:28.625 --> 01:33:30.585
There were rumors
that the world was going to end.

1646
01:33:30.833 --> 01:33:32.226
<i>During the harvest festival that year.</i>

1647
01:33:32.250 --> 01:33:34.167
<i>we put him in a van
and took him to Madurai.</i>

1648
01:33:34.500 --> 01:33:36.792
It was his first Jallikattu
at the age of three. <i>Athaan.</i>

1649
01:33:36.917 --> 01:33:37.917
My first time. too.

1650
01:33:38.458 --> 01:33:39.699
<i>The Jallikattu at Avaniyapuram.</i>

1651
01:33:40.083 --> 01:33:41.917
<i>Deafening noise everywhere.</i>

1652
01:33:42.167 --> 01:33:44.447
<i>Couldn't even hear
what the person next to you was saying.</i>

1653
01:33:44.833 --> 01:33:46.793
<i>They were waving their
hands and saying something.</i>

1654
01:33:47.250 --> 01:33:49.208
I unleashed him at the entrance.

1655
01:33:49.667 --> 01:33:50.875
That's all I know.

1656
01:33:52.167 --> 01:33:53.875
<i>He leaped like a tiger.</i>

1657
01:33:53.958 --> 01:33:54.958
<i>arousing the dust!</i>

1658
01:33:55.417 --> 01:33:57.083
Not allowing anyone
to come near him!

1659
01:33:57.250 --> 01:33:58.333
Not an iota of fear.

1660
01:33:59.458 --> 01:34:00.958
<i>The guys shuddered.</i>

1661
01:34:01.417 --> 01:34:04.137
And those who did manage to leap
on him. he easily shoved them aside.

1662
01:34:04.375 --> 01:34:07.083
<i>He literally tossed one guy up.
making him fly mid-air.</i>

1663
01:34:07.167 --> 01:34:08.667
<i>like our "Thala" Dhoni.</i>

1664
01:34:09.000 --> 01:34:11.083
That's how he got
the name Dhoni!

1665
01:34:11.542 --> 01:34:12.583
<i>He won. Athaan!</i>

1666
01:34:12.792 --> 01:34:13.833
<i>His first Jallikattu!</i>

1667
01:34:14.250 --> 01:34:15.583
<i>The prize was a Godrej cupboard.</i>

1668
01:34:16.250 --> 01:34:17.917
<i>They announced his name over the mike.</i>

1669
01:34:18.375 --> 01:34:21.167
<i>and when they announced my
name as the owner of the bull.</i>

1670
01:34:21.583 --> 01:34:22.743
I was overflowing with pride.

1671
01:34:23.125 --> 01:34:24.667
I had goosebumps!

1672
01:34:24.750 --> 01:34:25.792
Look. even now!

1673
01:34:26.667 --> 01:34:28.434
<i>The next day. the Jallikattu
was at Alanganallur.</i>

1674
01:34:28.458 --> 01:34:29.625
<i>After that. Siravayal.</i>

1675
01:34:29.958 --> 01:34:33.208
<i>That year starting from
January till April.</i>

1676
01:34:33.292 --> 01:34:34.625
<i>we didn't miss a single game.</i>

1677
01:34:35.000 --> 01:34:36.625
We went head-on
and won all of them.

1678
01:34:36.875 --> 01:34:37.875
He won!

1679
01:34:38.125 --> 01:34:39.167
<i>An ever silver vessel.</i>

1680
01:34:39.250 --> 01:34:40.292
<i>plastic chair.</i>

1681
01:34:40.375 --> 01:34:42.125
<i>steel cot. silver coin.</i>

1682
01:34:42.208 --> 01:34:43.333
and Nokia phone.

1683
01:34:43.417 --> 01:34:45.500
we had no place
to keep all that we won.

1684
01:34:46.292 --> 01:34:48.125
But on the way to Palamedu.

1685
01:34:48.208 --> 01:34:51.208
<i>our boy created a
scene and we were late.</i>

1686
01:34:51.417 --> 01:34:52.917
<i>That's the only one we missed.</i>

1687
01:34:56.625 --> 01:34:57.625
<i>Because of that.</i>

1688
01:34:57.792 --> 01:35:00.000
for the next entire year.
he trained vigorously.

1689
01:35:00.292 --> 01:35:01.667
<i>When we decided to go to the game</i>

1690
01:35:01.750 --> 01:35:03.351
<i>at Palamedu in 2013
during the harvest festival.</i>

1691
01:35:03.375 --> 01:35:05.434
<i>Sokku uncle couldn't contain
his excitement and came along.</i>

1692
01:35:05.458 --> 01:35:06.938
<i>to add to this. my wife came as well!</i>

1693
01:35:07.333 --> 01:35:10.375
<i>Our boy's entry…
the announcement was electrifying!</i>

1694
01:35:10.667 --> 01:35:11.726
So far at the Jallikattu.
you would have witnessed.

1695
01:35:11.750 --> 01:35:14.708
the black bull. the white bull.
and the red bull. charging in!

1696
01:35:14.875 --> 01:35:17.458
But have you seen a
rocket coming? A rocket!

1697
01:35:17.708 --> 01:35:19.628
The one that's going
to come at rocket's speed is

1698
01:35:19.667 --> 01:35:21.458
the one and only
Needamangalam's Dhoni!

1699
01:35:21.750 --> 01:35:24.583
He hasn't been caught
in a single game. so far!

1700
01:35:24.667 --> 01:35:27.042
He's not just a bull.
he's a maneless lion!

1701
01:35:28.917 --> 01:35:31.375
Welcome! Welcome! Welcome!

1702
01:35:31.625 --> 01:35:33.393
Here comes the brave Tamil woman!
Our hero's salute to her!

1703
01:35:33.417 --> 01:35:35.375
Congratulations!
Congratulations!

1704
01:35:35.917 --> 01:35:38.792
I request all of you
to clap and encourage her!

1705
01:35:41.500 --> 01:35:43.958
<i>Those guys who were
ready in the arena</i>

1706
01:35:44.042 --> 01:35:46.625
<i>were hell-bent on catching him.</i>

1707
01:35:48.458 --> 01:35:50.542
<i>I really thought this year
Dhoni would lose the game!</i>

1708
01:36:05.583 --> 01:36:08.333
Dodge! Dodge!

1709
01:36:08.625 --> 01:36:10.667
Superb! Superb!

1710
01:36:22.667 --> 01:36:24.187
What a Spectacle!
Stunning is the word!

1711
01:36:24.708 --> 01:36:27.143
If allowed. looks like he can
play all night without giving up!

1712
01:36:27.167 --> 01:36:28.393
No one's able to touch the bull!

1713
01:36:28.417 --> 01:36:30.417
He's a running riot! He's on fire!

1714
01:36:30.750 --> 01:36:32.917
The great Dhoni gets
a glorious victory…

1715
01:36:33.000 --> 01:36:34.167
Superb!

1716
01:36:34.708 --> 01:36:36.109
We need to continue
the competition.

1717
01:36:36.208 --> 01:36:38.667
please take him
and leave. sister.

1718
01:36:39.667 --> 01:36:42.292
I applaud her courage and on behalf
of the Palamedu Jallikattu…

1719
01:36:42.375 --> 01:36:45.125
One Nokia phone with a dual sim

1720
01:36:45.375 --> 01:36:47.583
is the prize for your courage. sister!

1721
01:36:48.083 --> 01:36:49.833
Here. Catch!

1722
01:36:56.958 --> 01:36:57.958
It's her.

1723
01:36:59.292 --> 01:37:00.292
Hello!

1724
01:37:01.125 --> 01:37:02.625
My dear. haven't you slept yet?

1725
01:37:03.042 --> 01:37:04.042
What?

1726
01:37:04.375 --> 01:37:05.895
You've gone to the backyard. isn't it?

1727
01:37:06.250 --> 01:37:07.875
No. who said so?

1728
01:37:08.792 --> 01:37:09.792
Who needs to tell me?

1729
01:37:09.875 --> 01:37:11.708
I can hear you
speaking from there.

1730
01:37:11.958 --> 01:37:13.125
No. dear.

1731
01:37:13.417 --> 01:37:16.208
You used to say something.
what was that?

1732
01:37:16.333 --> 01:37:19.000
Oh. yes. echo.
It's echoing here. that's the sound.

1733
01:37:19.083 --> 01:37:21.667
<i>Athaan</i> and I are seated near
the well and are quietly drinking.

1734
01:37:22.333 --> 01:37:24.542
I am not a child to be fooled.

1735
01:37:24.625 --> 01:37:26.083
So don't even try it.

1736
01:37:27.250 --> 01:37:29.167
I can clearly hear
your son's bell sound.

1737
01:37:30.583 --> 01:37:31.458
<i>Alright!</i>

1738
01:37:31.542 --> 01:37:33.625
You give the phone to my brother.
I'll talk to him.

1739
01:37:34.083 --> 01:37:35.167
Okay. I'll give it.

1740
01:37:35.458 --> 01:37:36.899
but you should talk only in English.

1741
01:37:37.208 --> 01:37:38.208
No. I won't.

1742
01:37:38.500 --> 01:37:40.101
Aren't you teaching in English at school?

1743
01:37:40.125 --> 01:37:41.125
Then why fuss?

1744
01:37:41.375 --> 01:37:42.542
You speak in English.

1745
01:37:42.625 --> 01:37:44.625
I want to see. whose English is better.

1746
01:37:44.875 --> 01:37:45.875
Not necessary.

1747
01:37:46.125 --> 01:37:47.245
Then I won't give the phone.

1748
01:37:47.542 --> 01:37:48.833
Okay. give it. I'll talk.

1749
01:37:49.000 --> 01:37:51.333
Okay. I've turned on
the speaker mode. Talk.

1750
01:37:52.750 --> 01:37:54.708
- Hello. brother.
<i>- Hello. tell me.</i>

1751
01:37:55.000 --> 01:37:56.360
- You also talk in English.
- Okay.

1752
01:37:56.792 --> 01:37:59.208
<i>Brother. my husband
never listens to me.</i>

1753
01:37:59.500 --> 01:38:02.625
I've told him several times not to go
to the backyard during the nighttime.

1754
01:38:03.042 --> 01:38:04.292
But he never obeys.

1755
01:38:04.792 --> 01:38:06.250
It is not safe. brother.

1756
01:38:06.750 --> 01:38:07.990
It's okay. sister. Don't worry.

1757
01:38:08.500 --> 01:38:09.500
I'll manage.

1758
01:38:10.375 --> 01:38:11.375
No. brother.

1759
01:38:11.708 --> 01:38:14.750
There are a lot of poisonous insects
which you cannot see in the night.

1760
01:38:15.333 --> 01:38:16.833
<i>Also. there is a cobra snake.</i>

1761
01:38:18.125 --> 01:38:19.125
<i>Ayo!</i>

1762
01:38:20.583 --> 01:38:23.042
<i>It just gave birth
to four or five young ones.</i>

1763
01:38:23.125 --> 01:38:24.125
<i>Ayayo!</i>

1764
01:38:24.625 --> 01:38:26.917
<i>Ayo… </i>that's Tamil.
so 100 rupees fine.

1765
01:38:27.000 --> 01:38:28.841
- and <i>Ayayo</i> is also Tamil so 300 rupees.
- Okay!

1766
01:38:28.875 --> 01:38:30.958
Now you tell me
whether it is safe. brother?

1767
01:38:31.250 --> 01:38:32.250
No… no… no…

1768
01:38:32.750 --> 01:38:35.000
- Is there a snake here?
- Yes. <i>Athaan.</i>

1769
01:38:35.167 --> 01:38:36.375
Cobra. The good snake!

1770
01:38:36.542 --> 01:38:38.601
It just gave birth. Four to five
young ones must be around here.

1771
01:38:38.625 --> 01:38:40.809
You're crazy. Why didn't you
tell me there are snakes here?

1772
01:38:40.833 --> 01:38:42.042
<i>What is this. Athaan?</i>

1773
01:38:42.125 --> 01:38:44.059
You look like a coconut tree.
why are you scared of snakes?

1774
01:38:44.083 --> 01:38:45.483
I'm here. right?
Come. hold my hand.

1775
01:38:45.958 --> 01:38:47.375
Brother. be careful.

1776
01:38:47.542 --> 01:38:50.583
<i>Sometimes the snake will be on the
path. Don't step on them by mistake.</i>

1777
01:38:50.667 --> 01:38:52.307
Stop it. sister.
Don't scare me even more.

1778
01:38:52.375 --> 01:38:53.708
Nothing is visible in the dark.

1779
01:38:54.917 --> 01:38:57.750
Did you notice? In fear. <i>Athaan</i>
is spontaneously talking in Tamil.

1780
01:39:01.375 --> 01:39:02.375
Come on!

1781
01:39:02.417 --> 01:39:03.792
It won't come here. Athaan.

1782
01:39:04.625 --> 01:39:06.750
You're not frightened.
so you're saying that.

1783
01:39:07.333 --> 01:39:09.208
People raise goats
and cows at home.

1784
01:39:09.292 --> 01:39:10.375
How can you raise a snake?

1785
01:39:10.542 --> 01:39:12.062
Oh. gosh! I am not raising it. <i>Athaan.</i>

1786
01:39:12.250 --> 01:39:14.890
Just like how my wife and I live
in this house. it also lives here.

1787
01:39:15.042 --> 01:39:16.125
In fact. it's a senior!

1788
01:39:16.208 --> 01:39:17.351
It's been here for many years.

1789
01:39:17.375 --> 01:39:18.500
- Senior?
- Yes.

1790
01:39:18.583 --> 01:39:19.417
You're too much.

1791
01:39:19.500 --> 01:39:20.500
Okay. forget that.

1792
01:39:21.583 --> 01:39:23.208
When you were in school.

1793
01:39:23.542 --> 01:39:25.833
you had a Raleigh bicycle.
do you remember?

1794
01:39:27.458 --> 01:39:29.958
After that. you bought a
blue color TVS Champ.

1795
01:39:31.500 --> 01:39:33.501
Do you know what happened
to that cycle after that?

1796
01:39:34.083 --> 01:39:36.250
I don't even remember what
happened to the TVS Champ.

1797
01:39:37.208 --> 01:39:38.583
Okay. see if you remember this.

1798
01:39:39.042 --> 01:39:42.625
It had an Undertaker sticker
on its mudguard at the back.

1799
01:39:42.708 --> 01:39:43.708
Correct?

1800
01:39:44.958 --> 01:39:45.958
Yes.

1801
01:39:46.708 --> 01:39:49.667
I had saved up money
over a period of time and.

1802
01:39:50.083 --> 01:39:51.792
bought it at the Amudha fancy store.

1803
01:39:52.458 --> 01:39:53.667
WWF. Undertaker!

1804
01:39:56.750 --> 01:39:59.750
After that issue.
you left town. right?

1805
01:40:00.042 --> 01:40:02.500
You took every
single thing from the house.

1806
01:40:03.208 --> 01:40:05.375
I don't know what you
thought about the cycle.

1807
01:40:05.875 --> 01:40:07.542
but in spite of your situation then…

1808
01:40:07.958 --> 01:40:10.375
"Give this cycle
to someone who needs it…"

1809
01:40:10.458 --> 01:40:11.893
Was apparently what
you said to your father.

1810
01:40:11.917 --> 01:40:13.333
and he told my father.

1811
01:40:13.417 --> 01:40:14.458
and my father told me.

1812
01:40:15.042 --> 01:40:16.167
Did you say that?

1813
01:40:16.708 --> 01:40:17.958
Yeah. where to take it and go?

1814
01:40:18.333 --> 01:40:20.534
I had already ridden it
for around seven to eight years.

1815
01:40:20.875 --> 01:40:22.083
It was old then. itself.

1816
01:40:22.917 --> 01:40:24.809
For me who was playing around
with the palm fruit toy cycle.

1817
01:40:24.833 --> 01:40:26.101
how would it matter.
if it's old or new?

1818
01:40:26.125 --> 01:40:27.708
The minute I knew
the cycle was coming.

1819
01:40:27.792 --> 01:40:29.208
I didn't sleep the whole night.

1820
01:40:29.292 --> 01:40:30.452
I was only thinking about it.

1821
01:40:30.667 --> 01:40:33.143
The next day morning. I wanted to go
with my dad to pick up the cycle.

1822
01:40:33.167 --> 01:40:34.500
I was being stubborn about it.

1823
01:40:34.667 --> 01:40:36.375
But he was like.
"No. you go to school.

1824
01:40:36.542 --> 01:40:39.875
I'll pick up the cycle at Thanjavur.
and get it oiled and checked."

1825
01:40:39.958 --> 01:40:40.958
And he ditched me.

1826
01:40:41.458 --> 01:40:45.208
<i>The whole day at school. I couldn't
even concentrate on one subject.</i>

1827
01:40:45.667 --> 01:40:47.250
<i>How big the cycle will be?</i>

1828
01:40:47.333 --> 01:40:48.393
<i>What color the cycle will be?</i>

1829
01:40:48.417 --> 01:40:50.897
<i>Will I be able to reach its height?
I was imagining it all day.</i>

1830
01:40:54.500 --> 01:40:57.500
SRI VENKATESWARA KINDERGARTEN
NEEDAMANGALAM 614404

1831
01:40:59.667 --> 01:41:02.875
<i>Once all of you left. my father
swept and washed your house.</i>

1832
01:41:03.125 --> 01:41:05.809
<i>He locked it and went and threw
the keys on the faces of those morons!</i>

1833
01:41:05.833 --> 01:41:08.333
<i>Then gave the cycle
a complete makeover.</i>

1834
01:41:08.458 --> 01:41:10.259
<i>He loaded it on top of
the bus and brought it.</i>

1835
01:41:16.167 --> 01:41:18.125
<i>- It came and reached you. right?
- Yes.</i>

1836
01:41:18.708 --> 01:41:19.958
I had no clue about it.

1837
01:41:21.083 --> 01:41:22.083
That's the beauty.

1838
01:41:22.417 --> 01:41:23.917
There's another
thing you don't know.

1839
01:41:24.208 --> 01:41:25.208
Listen. I'll tell you.

1840
01:41:26.000 --> 01:41:28.250
He was riding the cycle
from the bus stop.

1841
01:41:28.333 --> 01:41:30.833
<i>He started ringing the bell
from the end of the street.</i>

1842
01:41:33.917 --> 01:41:37.292
<i>The minute I heard
the bell sound I ran from home.</i>

1843
01:41:37.833 --> 01:41:40.250
<i>I was running behind
the cycle. clapping!</i>

1844
01:41:41.917 --> 01:41:42.917
Dad.

1845
01:41:43.000 --> 01:41:45.208
- is this our new cycle?
- Yes. my son!

1846
01:41:49.000 --> 01:41:51.833
He took me for a ride. <i>Athaan.</i>

1847
01:41:53.042 --> 01:41:54.917
<i>I was so happy!</i>

1848
01:41:55.125 --> 01:41:57.500
I was screaming in joy
at the top of my voice!

1849
01:41:57.583 --> 01:41:59.042
<i>My mom was laughing.</i>

1850
01:41:59.250 --> 01:42:02.125
<i>Then he took my brother
and mum along for a round.</i>

1851
01:42:02.625 --> 01:42:06.875
<i>Four of us had never had
so much fun even on festivals.</i>

1852
01:42:07.375 --> 01:42:09.833
After that. I only slept
and woke up near the cycle.

1853
01:42:10.167 --> 01:42:12.893
<i>For a few days. I was pushing it
and running along with it on the street.</i>

1854
01:42:12.917 --> 01:42:15.277
<i>After that. I pushed it
by balancing one foot on the ground.</i>

1855
01:42:15.625 --> 01:42:17.708
<i>And slowly I started
monkey pedaling!</i>

1856
01:42:17.917 --> 01:42:19.500
<i>It was a big deal back then!</i>

1857
01:42:19.958 --> 01:42:22.417
Monkey pedaling
to the nearby shop.

1858
01:42:22.500 --> 01:42:24.208
going to the market.
going to play…

1859
01:42:24.417 --> 01:42:28.083
A neighbor saw me
monkey pedaling for weeks

1860
01:42:28.167 --> 01:42:29.851
and offered to teach me
how to ride the cycle properly.

1861
01:42:29.875 --> 01:42:31.083
I was so scared.

1862
01:42:32.208 --> 01:42:33.375
I refused to sit on the seat.

1863
01:42:33.458 --> 01:42:36.000
<i>"I'll hold it. you won't fall." he said
and pushed it.</i>

1864
01:42:36.500 --> 01:42:39.458
<i>Since I knew he was holding it.
I boldly rode it for a while.</i>

1865
01:42:40.333 --> 01:42:43.417
<i>I suddenly realized his absence.
so I turned back.</i>

1866
01:42:43.500 --> 01:42:44.917
<i>He was missing.</i>

1867
01:42:45.292 --> 01:42:47.212
Seemed like he had
stopped following a while ago.

1868
01:42:47.458 --> 01:42:48.667
I froze in fear!

1869
01:42:48.958 --> 01:42:51.250
<i>My hand was too small
to press the brake.</i>

1870
01:42:51.750 --> 01:42:53.934
I thought of stopping it. at least
by balancing it with my legs.

1871
01:42:53.958 --> 01:42:54.958
but I couldn't reach it.

1872
01:42:55.000 --> 01:42:57.640
<i>By the time I could figure out
what to do. I had crossed my street.</i>

1873
01:42:58.083 --> 01:43:00.875
Thank God! There was a heap
of river sand brought in for construction.

1874
01:43:00.958 --> 01:43:02.125
<i>I rammed straight into it.</i>

1875
01:43:02.333 --> 01:43:05.125
<i>At full speed. I went
and hit the bricks.</i>

1876
01:43:05.208 --> 01:43:06.208
Look here.

1877
01:43:06.625 --> 01:43:07.625
it ripped through.

1878
01:43:08.000 --> 01:43:09.000
Even then.

1879
01:43:09.333 --> 01:43:11.374
I was only worried about
what happened to the cycle.

1880
01:43:11.833 --> 01:43:13.583
<i>People who were around lifted me.</i>

1881
01:43:13.667 --> 01:43:14.667
<i>gave me buttermilk.</i>

1882
01:43:14.750 --> 01:43:16.790
<i>made me sit for a while.
and then sent me on my way.</i>

1883
01:43:18.333 --> 01:43:20.750
But. that's the day I learned
to ride the cycle. <i>Athaan!</i>

1884
01:43:21.375 --> 01:43:24.083
After that. I was just
obsessed with the cycle!

1885
01:43:25.208 --> 01:43:27.333
<i>Riding it. wiping it. oiling it…</i>

1886
01:43:27.417 --> 01:43:28.737
<i>I always kept it sparkling clean.</i>

1887
01:43:29.167 --> 01:43:30.958
<i>I used to take it
to school on weekdays.</i>

1888
01:43:31.042 --> 01:43:32.802
<i>And my father used to
take it on the weekends</i>

1889
01:43:33.000 --> 01:43:34.958
<i>to sell saris.
from street to street.</i>

1890
01:43:36.625 --> 01:43:38.186
<i>My father made a
good income doing that.</i>

1891
01:43:38.750 --> 01:43:42.250
With that. he admitted
my brother and me to a good school.

1892
01:43:42.833 --> 01:43:44.083
It was slightly far from home.

1893
01:43:44.875 --> 01:43:46.417
They sent us because of the cycle.

1894
01:43:47.125 --> 01:43:50.086
Otherwise. we would have had to go by bus
and where was the money for that.

1895
01:43:51.292 --> 01:43:52.333
On the first day.

1896
01:43:52.792 --> 01:43:56.500
he asked me. "Hey! Will you take
your brother safely and bring him back?"

1897
01:43:57.375 --> 01:43:58.417
<i>We went to school</i>

1898
01:43:59.250 --> 01:44:01.125
<i>and returned safely that evening.</i>

1899
01:44:01.833 --> 01:44:03.042
From that day.

1900
01:44:03.917 --> 01:44:05.625
I don't know what my dad thought.

1901
01:44:06.458 --> 01:44:08.258
he never questioned me
about anything. <i>Athaan.</i>

1902
01:44:10.167 --> 01:44:11.667
He won't even call me by my name.

1903
01:44:12.792 --> 01:44:14.352
He'll be like. "Has the elder one come?"

1904
01:44:14.625 --> 01:44:15.833
Has the elder one eaten?"

1905
01:44:16.625 --> 01:44:18.185
He started having immense belief in me.

1906
01:44:19.458 --> 01:44:21.042
I wasn't that extraordinary. <i>Athaan.</i>

1907
01:44:21.875 --> 01:44:23.542
It seems he used to tell my mom often.

1908
01:44:24.208 --> 01:44:25.208
"Don't worry."

1909
01:44:26.917 --> 01:44:28.117
no matter what the problem is.

1910
01:44:28.833 --> 01:44:30.033
"the elder one will take care."

1911
01:44:33.958 --> 01:44:35.042
That cycle…

1912
01:44:35.708 --> 01:44:38.292
in a way changed everything. <i>Athaan!</i>

1913
01:44:40.250 --> 01:44:41.542
What my father earned.

1914
01:44:42.083 --> 01:44:43.125
my education.

1915
01:44:43.417 --> 01:44:44.958
my brother going to college.

1916
01:44:45.542 --> 01:44:48.125
in fact. even for my wedding.
I arrived in that cycle!

1917
01:44:48.875 --> 01:44:50.542
If your cycle hadn't been there.

1918
01:44:51.500 --> 01:44:53.020
my life would have
been very different.

1919
01:44:53.417 --> 01:44:54.417
Not like this!

1920
01:44:56.167 --> 01:44:59.750
I didn't say that
thinking so much good would happen.

1921
01:45:01.167 --> 01:45:03.000
I don't know what you
thought while giving it.

1922
01:45:04.167 --> 01:45:06.458
and what your father thought
while giving it to us.

1923
01:45:08.125 --> 01:45:10.046
but every Ayudha puja.
when we worship our tools.

1924
01:45:10.250 --> 01:45:12.625
I pray to that cycle. as God!

1925
01:45:17.000 --> 01:45:18.375
- What is this…
- Thanks. <i>Athaan!</i>

1926
01:45:20.208 --> 01:45:22.042
Why now…

1927
01:45:23.667 --> 01:45:25.250
You know. why I told you all this now?

1928
01:45:26.292 --> 01:45:27.292
Turn around!

1929
01:45:28.167 --> 01:45:29.292
Turn and look!

1930
01:45:30.625 --> 01:45:32.125
Your cycle is right here.

1931
01:45:36.458 --> 01:45:37.458
Come.

1932
01:45:43.875 --> 01:45:44.917
It's your cycle. <i>Athaan.</i>

1933
01:45:45.000 --> 01:45:46.000
Take a look.

1934
01:45:55.417 --> 01:45:56.417
It's just the same.

1935
01:45:57.625 --> 01:45:58.750
Nothing has changed.

1936
01:45:59.333 --> 01:46:00.934
Changed? I haven't allowed it to change!

1937
01:46:01.625 --> 01:46:02.792
Is this <i>just</i> a cycle?

1938
01:46:03.792 --> 01:46:06.083
They said it's old. you have
to change this and that…

1939
01:46:06.292 --> 01:46:07.583
I told them it wasn't necessary.

1940
01:46:08.083 --> 01:46:11.208
I strictly told them that it
had to stay this way forever.

1941
01:46:12.625 --> 01:46:15.917
I just had to change the chain.
ball bearing. and the paint.

1942
01:46:16.000 --> 01:46:17.000
There was no choice.

1943
01:46:17.667 --> 01:46:18.542
Is it in running condition?

1944
01:46:18.625 --> 01:46:19.625
Of course!

1945
01:46:24.750 --> 01:46:25.833
I never expected this.

1946
01:46:26.875 --> 01:46:29.750
After this. two beers
won't be enough!

1947
01:46:31.125 --> 01:46:32.245
What are you saying. <i>Athaan?</i>

1948
01:46:32.958 --> 01:46:33.958
I meant it casually.

1949
01:46:34.125 --> 01:46:35.286
Tell me if you want to drink.

1950
01:46:36.958 --> 01:46:39.750
Gentleman. at this hour.
where will you buy beer?

1951
01:46:40.375 --> 01:46:41.375
Hello. sir!

1952
01:46:41.625 --> 01:46:43.333
- Where are you?
- Where?

1953
01:46:43.625 --> 01:46:45.333
- In Needamangalam.
- So?

1954
01:46:45.667 --> 01:46:46.667
With whom?

1955
01:46:47.292 --> 01:46:48.292
With whom?

1956
01:46:48.333 --> 01:46:49.333
With me!

1957
01:46:49.792 --> 01:46:50.792
You don't know who I am.

1958
01:46:59.833 --> 01:47:01.125
- Kanagarasu?
<i>- Yes?</i>

1959
01:47:01.208 --> 01:47:02.667
- Are you asleep?
<i>- Yes… yes…</i>

1960
01:47:02.750 --> 01:47:03.750
Okay. wake up.

1961
01:47:04.167 --> 01:47:05.167
- Hey!
<i>- What?</i>

1962
01:47:05.250 --> 01:47:06.083
An urgent requirement.

1963
01:47:06.250 --> 01:47:07.458
Like in the times of war.

1964
01:47:07.708 --> 01:47:08.833
I need four strong beers.

1965
01:47:09.500 --> 01:47:10.500
If possible. chilled.

1966
01:47:10.958 --> 01:47:11.833
No. not "if possible."

1967
01:47:11.917 --> 01:47:13.708
it has to be chilled.
it's for my <i>Athaan.</i>

1968
01:47:14.167 --> 01:47:15.309
Take the money from
the shop in the morning.

1969
01:47:15.333 --> 01:47:16.333
<i>I'll check and tell you.</i>

1970
01:47:16.417 --> 01:47:18.000
- Will you?
<i>- Yes!</i>

1971
01:47:18.083 --> 01:47:19.083
Okay. I'll hold.

1972
01:47:22.583 --> 01:47:23.500
<i>It's available.</i>

1973
01:47:23.583 --> 01:47:24.625
- It's available?
<i>- Yes!</i>

1974
01:47:24.708 --> 01:47:25.708
- It's chilled?
<i>- Yes!</i>

1975
01:47:25.792 --> 01:47:27.333
Superb. brother!

1976
01:47:27.417 --> 01:47:28.875
- Superb!
<i>- Where to bring it?</i>

1977
01:47:28.958 --> 01:47:29.958
Where to bring it…

1978
01:47:30.208 --> 01:47:32.458
<i>Athaan.</i> do you want to continue
the next round here

1979
01:47:33.000 --> 01:47:34.792
or shall we go to the dam?

1980
01:47:35.000 --> 01:47:36.000
Dam…

1981
01:47:36.917 --> 01:47:38.375
- Hey. brother! Da…
<i>- Dam.</i>

1982
01:47:38.583 --> 01:47:39.583
Yes. there only.

1983
01:47:39.708 --> 01:47:40.708
- Hey! In the po...
<i>- Pot…</i>

1984
01:47:40.750 --> 01:47:41.917
- Two...
<i>- Two mugs…</i>

1985
01:47:42.833 --> 01:47:43.708
He hung up.

1986
01:47:43.792 --> 01:47:44.625
<i>How's that?</i>

1987
01:47:44.708 --> 01:47:46.669
Let's leave. the beer
won't remain chill for long.

1988
01:47:47.167 --> 01:47:48.417
Shall we go on the cycle?

1989
01:48:27.042 --> 01:48:28.208
Are they biting you?

1990
01:48:28.500 --> 01:48:29.580
All freshwater fingerlings.

1991
01:48:29.958 --> 01:48:31.518
Just dip your legs.
it will be relaxing.

1992
01:48:37.833 --> 01:48:39.153
He has already poured
and kept it.

1993
01:48:55.375 --> 01:48:56.375
<i>Athaan.</i>

1994
01:48:57.333 --> 01:48:59.375
Whenever I see the moon growing.

1995
01:49:00.333 --> 01:49:02.292
it reminds me of my
child growing in the womb.

1996
01:49:05.833 --> 01:49:07.333
Guess. what name
I've decided on?

1997
01:49:07.833 --> 01:49:08.833
How will I know?

1998
01:49:09.625 --> 01:49:11.042
You're the one who will know.

1999
01:49:11.333 --> 01:49:12.574
but you won't be able to guess.

2000
01:49:12.958 --> 01:49:14.500
Yeah. right! Then. how?

2001
01:49:15.833 --> 01:49:17.473
I don't even know
if it's a boy or a girl.

2002
01:49:18.708 --> 01:49:19.792
Should I guess two names?

2003
01:49:19.875 --> 01:49:20.875
Not two names and all.

2004
01:49:21.042 --> 01:49:22.042
just one.

2005
01:49:22.167 --> 01:49:24.833
Whether it's a boy or a girl.
it's the same name.

2006
01:49:25.292 --> 01:49:26.125
That's the clue.

2007
01:49:26.208 --> 01:49:27.643
- Try guessing now!
- Even if it's a boy.

2008
01:49:27.667 --> 01:49:28.667
or if it's a girl?

2009
01:49:31.583 --> 01:49:32.583
Thangam.

2010
01:49:32.875 --> 01:49:33.875
No!

2011
01:49:39.250 --> 01:49:40.250
Madhu.

2012
01:49:40.667 --> 01:49:41.667
Fail!

2013
01:49:43.292 --> 01:49:44.708
You want to try once more?

2014
01:49:45.417 --> 01:49:46.292
Shall I say it?

2015
01:49:46.375 --> 01:49:47.417
I don't know. Go ahead.

2016
01:49:49.333 --> 01:49:50.583
Arulmozhi.

2017
01:49:52.708 --> 01:49:53.708
How is it?

2018
01:49:57.417 --> 01:49:58.417
It's nice.

2019
01:50:14.375 --> 01:50:15.375
<i>Athaan.</i>

2020
01:50:16.208 --> 01:50:18.333
from the time you came.
I have been noticing.

2021
01:50:18.708 --> 01:50:21.309
that if I don't talk for a while.
you get buried in your thoughts.

2022
01:50:25.333 --> 01:50:27.583
Your face has turned pale all of a sudden.

2023
01:50:28.458 --> 01:50:29.458
What is it?

2024
01:50:29.583 --> 01:50:30.750
Thinking about the old house?

2025
01:50:34.000 --> 01:50:36.125
It's been 20 years
and you're still thinking about it.

2026
01:50:40.500 --> 01:50:42.940
Those days I used to be so happy
to get back home from school.

2027
01:50:46.333 --> 01:50:47.667
I like that house a lot.

2028
01:50:49.875 --> 01:50:51.796
After I came home.
I wouldn't go straight inside.

2029
01:50:52.083 --> 01:50:53.500
I'd hang my bag on the gate.

2030
01:50:53.583 --> 01:50:55.167
Then climb and sit on the wall.

2031
01:50:55.333 --> 01:50:56.958
looking at all the passers-by.

2032
01:50:57.958 --> 01:51:01.458
<i>The boys used to draw stumps
on our wall to play cricket.</i>

2033
01:51:02.458 --> 01:51:03.667
<i>I never played much then.</i>

2034
01:51:05.167 --> 01:51:07.500
<i>I used to sit on the wall
and just be an umpire!</i>

2035
01:51:09.500 --> 01:51:10.500
Hey. throw it like this.

2036
01:51:10.542 --> 01:51:11.875
<i>In the evening. my mother</i>

2037
01:51:12.167 --> 01:51:14.250
<i>used to keep a tumbler
of milk on the wall</i>

2038
01:51:14.625 --> 01:51:15.667
<i>and tap my shoulder.</i>

2039
01:51:17.125 --> 01:51:19.792
When you dip
the "Milk Bikis" biscuit in it…

2040
01:51:20.542 --> 01:51:21.822
<i>You won't notice time flying by.</i>

2041
01:51:24.667 --> 01:51:27.542
In our house. including my grandparents.
there were just six of us.

2042
01:51:29.833 --> 01:51:34.375
<i>But there would always be
around 15 to 20 people at home.</i>

2043
01:51:34.583 --> 01:51:35.750
<i>I remember. Athaan.</i>

2044
01:51:36.792 --> 01:51:39.458
The house extended from
one street into the next.

2045
01:51:40.375 --> 01:51:42.559
From the entrance to the backyard.
you used to conduct running races.

2046
01:51:42.583 --> 01:51:43.417
Yes.

2047
01:51:43.542 --> 01:51:44.792
What a big house!

2048
01:51:45.792 --> 01:51:47.500
Uncle has built it
just like his big heart.

2049
01:51:48.417 --> 01:51:50.137
The house was built
by my great-grandfather.

2050
01:51:50.208 --> 01:51:51.208
Oh!

2051
01:51:51.458 --> 01:51:53.250
My grandfather. my father.

2052
01:51:54.000 --> 01:51:55.292
uncle. brother.

2053
01:51:55.542 --> 01:51:57.182
and me.
all of us were born in that house.

2054
01:51:59.208 --> 01:52:00.688
I've never seen my great-grandfather.

2055
01:52:01.000 --> 01:52:02.417
He died before I was born.

2056
01:52:03.917 --> 01:52:05.875
I don't even have a photograph.

2057
01:52:06.792 --> 01:52:08.042
But I know his name.

2058
01:52:08.792 --> 01:52:10.125
Sivapadha Sekaran.

2059
01:52:16.375 --> 01:52:18.055
For me.
that house is my great-grandfather.

2060
01:52:21.583 --> 01:52:23.083
I like that house a lot. man.

2061
01:52:25.375 --> 01:52:27.816
There's not a spot in the house
where my feet haven't touched.

2062
01:52:30.083 --> 01:52:32.958
My wish was to live
in that house till I die.

2063
01:52:34.417 --> 01:52:35.542
But look at my fate.

2064
01:52:37.625 --> 01:52:39.265
they snatched it away
from me before that.

2065
01:52:41.958 --> 01:52:43.083
The problem is.

2066
01:52:44.583 --> 01:52:45.744
I am not able to forget that.

2067
01:52:49.000 --> 01:52:50.167
Then how will my face look?

2068
01:52:52.917 --> 01:52:54.357
What is there for me to laugh about?

2069
01:52:55.000 --> 01:52:56.000
Should I laugh at myself?

2070
01:53:05.042 --> 01:53:06.917
More than anyone.

2071
01:53:08.333 --> 01:53:12.750
you understand everything I say
and don't say.

2072
01:53:13.500 --> 01:53:14.583
you don't console me.

2073
01:53:15.333 --> 01:53:16.375
No. <i>Athaan…</i>

2074
01:53:16.750 --> 01:53:17.833
How can I… You…

2075
01:53:18.958 --> 01:53:21.583
- What I meant was…
- For you…

2076
01:53:21.875 --> 01:53:23.417
Well. what that cycle means to you.

2077
01:53:24.708 --> 01:53:26.228
is exactly what the house means to me.

2078
01:53:28.000 --> 01:53:29.000
Now. talk.

2079
01:53:31.458 --> 01:53:32.458
Talk.

2080
01:53:36.083 --> 01:53:37.542
Oh. god! I am not saying anything.

2081
01:53:39.958 --> 01:53:41.393
Okay. don't go wandering here and there.

2082
01:53:41.417 --> 01:53:42.833
Just sit here and drink your beer.

2083
01:53:42.917 --> 01:53:43.958
I'll take a piss and come.

2084
01:53:44.042 --> 01:53:45.042
Hey!

2085
01:53:45.292 --> 01:53:47.583
Why? Haven't I had beer?
Won't I want to pee?

2086
01:53:48.833 --> 01:53:49.833
Okay. come.

2087
01:53:55.750 --> 01:53:58.167
A…

2088
01:54:02.833 --> 01:54:04.833
B…

2089
01:54:09.750 --> 01:54:10.750
Silly girl!

2090
01:54:12.750 --> 01:54:16.333
DEPARTMENT OF WATER RESOURCES

2091
01:54:21.042 --> 01:54:22.042
<i>Athaan.</i>

2092
01:54:22.167 --> 01:54:23.447
I wore your slippers by mistake.

2093
01:54:23.958 --> 01:54:25.958
I know. So what?

2094
01:54:28.417 --> 01:54:30.333
It is fluffy.
It is very soft.

2095
01:54:30.917 --> 01:54:32.477
I can't even feel it
on my feet. <i>Athaan.</i>

2096
01:54:40.500 --> 01:54:42.167
<i>Athaan.</i> stop… stop!

2097
01:54:43.208 --> 01:54:44.208
What happened?

2098
01:54:45.917 --> 01:54:46.917
I got it.

2099
01:54:47.083 --> 01:54:48.083
Who I am after all!

2100
01:54:55.208 --> 01:54:59.417
<i>The cloud that travels through the sky</i>

2101
01:54:59.708 --> 01:55:02.917
<i>Who is it searching for?</i>

2102
01:55:03.083 --> 01:55:07.250
<i>The fragrant flower's soulful music</i>

2103
01:55:07.583 --> 01:55:10.750
<i>Who does it sing about?</i>

2104
01:55:10.833 --> 01:55:14.583
<i>Feelings expressed through music</i>

2105
01:55:14.708 --> 01:55:18.417
<i>Won't they go reach
Our kith and kin</i>

2106
01:55:18.542 --> 01:55:21.958
<i>And then let the special day
Of togetherness unfold</i>

2107
01:55:22.375 --> 01:55:25.708
<i>And let joy rule</i>

2108
01:55:25.792 --> 01:55:30.292
<i>They are like blooming evening flowers</i>

2109
01:55:30.458 --> 01:55:35.083
<i>They are the new wildflowers</i>

2110
01:55:36.417 --> 01:55:39.417
<i>The summer's cool breeze</i>

2111
01:55:39.917 --> 01:55:43.417
<i>The cool breeze that sings</i>

2112
01:55:47.083 --> 01:55:48.083
You sing well.

2113
01:55:48.292 --> 01:55:50.083
- I dance well too. <i>Athaan.</i>
- Wow. me too!

2114
01:55:50.167 --> 01:55:52.625
I can do the steps
of actor Anand Babu really well.

2115
01:55:53.708 --> 01:55:54.708
Hold this!

2116
01:55:55.458 --> 01:55:58.667
- Micheal Jackson. moonwalk!
- Hey! Hey!

2117
01:55:58.750 --> 01:56:01.042
Hey! Superb!

2118
01:56:11.875 --> 01:56:14.125
WELCOME

2119
01:56:27.292 --> 01:56:29.042
Where are you coming from
at this hour?

2120
01:56:29.333 --> 01:56:30.333
Auntie. from the temple!

2121
01:56:30.375 --> 01:56:32.393
You're roaming around.
leaving a pregnant woman at home!

2122
01:56:32.417 --> 01:56:34.500
<i>Athaan.</i> are you happy?

2123
01:56:35.500 --> 01:56:36.333
Very happy!

2124
01:56:36.500 --> 01:56:37.500
Are you happy?

2125
01:56:37.667 --> 01:56:38.792
Double happy!

2126
01:56:39.625 --> 01:56:42.750
It feels sweet. like drinking water
after eating a gooseberry.

2127
01:56:45.958 --> 01:56:47.125
<i>- Athaan?</i>
- Yes?

2128
01:56:48.500 --> 01:56:50.083
Can I ask you something?

2129
01:56:51.792 --> 01:56:53.458
Should we leave the cycle outside?

2130
01:56:54.292 --> 01:56:55.292
Yes.

2131
01:56:56.333 --> 01:56:57.333
Okay.

2132
01:56:57.875 --> 01:56:58.875
Ask me.

2133
01:56:59.792 --> 01:57:01.232
You said you wanted
to ask something.

2134
01:57:04.417 --> 01:57:05.417
I forgot.

2135
01:57:07.250 --> 01:57:09.500
<i>Athaan.</i> there are steps…

2136
01:57:10.000 --> 01:57:11.042
Hey. watch out.

2137
01:57:13.125 --> 01:57:15.583
Look. just for you!

2138
01:57:16.083 --> 01:57:20.542
Sleep on this jute bed and see.
You will sleep so well.

2139
01:57:22.250 --> 01:57:23.250
I remembered…

2140
01:57:25.042 --> 01:57:26.125
I remembered.

2141
01:57:26.958 --> 01:57:28.039
Tell me. before you forget.

2142
01:57:29.083 --> 01:57:31.458
Let me first be safe.

2143
01:57:34.875 --> 01:57:35.875
<i>Athaan.</i>

2144
01:57:36.667 --> 01:57:38.750
you definitely won't like it.

2145
01:57:39.958 --> 01:57:43.000
Nevertheless.
since I have the right to. I'll ask.

2146
01:57:44.000 --> 01:57:45.125
For my sake…

2147
01:57:47.500 --> 01:57:49.833
For my sake.
forgive those four people. <i>Athaan.</i>

2148
01:57:55.750 --> 01:57:57.309
For your good heart. if you
curse them even a little bit.

2149
01:57:57.333 --> 01:58:01.333
something really bad will
happen to them. <i>Athaan.</i>

2150
01:58:02.167 --> 01:58:03.375
Let's not do that. <i>Athaan.</i>

2151
01:58:16.250 --> 01:58:17.250
Okay.

2152
01:58:18.333 --> 01:58:19.333
I've forgiven them.

2153
01:58:20.250 --> 01:58:21.934
Feels like you're just saying
for the sake of it.

2154
01:58:21.958 --> 01:58:24.208
I am asking you seriously.
and you're mocking me.

2155
01:58:25.375 --> 01:58:26.496
I swear. I've forgiven them.

2156
01:58:27.208 --> 01:58:28.208
Really?

2157
01:58:29.833 --> 01:58:30.833
I promise.

2158
01:58:32.833 --> 01:58:34.458
Superb. <i>Athaan!</i> My <i>Athaan!</i>

2159
01:58:36.083 --> 01:58:38.500
Because of us. nothing bad
should happen to anyone.

2160
01:58:38.583 --> 01:58:40.542
Let them do what they want.

2161
01:58:41.375 --> 01:58:42.458
How are you like this?

2162
01:58:43.333 --> 01:58:45.417
Even my wife asks me the same thing.

2163
01:58:47.000 --> 01:58:48.667
Just stay this way. Don't change.

2164
01:58:49.417 --> 01:58:50.417
You lie down. <i>Athaan.</i>

2165
01:58:50.958 --> 01:58:52.667
I won't get sleep now.

2166
01:58:52.792 --> 01:58:55.542
I'll wake you up on time.

2167
01:58:56.000 --> 01:58:57.208
I'll sit here. <i>Athaan.</i>

2168
01:59:00.917 --> 01:59:03.958
<i>Athaan.</i> before you go.

2169
01:59:04.750 --> 01:59:07.958
bless us. so that little Arulmozhi
is born healthy.

2170
01:59:08.042 --> 01:59:09.042
Okay.

2171
01:59:17.958 --> 01:59:18.958
<i>Athaan.</i>

2172
01:59:20.458 --> 01:59:23.417
I've noticed
from the time you came.

2173
01:59:23.917 --> 01:59:27.458
you never called me by my name.

2174
01:59:29.250 --> 01:59:32.000
You're talking to me as though
you're talking to a stranger. <i>Athaan.</i>

2175
01:59:34.250 --> 01:59:35.958
Tomorrow morning.

2176
01:59:37.000 --> 01:59:38.917
call all three of us by our names.

2177
01:59:40.375 --> 01:59:42.750
Bless us and then leave. <i>Athaan.</i>

2178
01:59:44.000 --> 01:59:45.000
Okay?

2179
01:59:46.375 --> 01:59:47.375
Okay?

2180
02:01:08.750 --> 02:01:10.708
- He slept?
- Yes.

2181
02:01:10.917 --> 02:01:12.000
When did you come. brother?

2182
02:01:12.375 --> 02:01:13.375
Just now.

2183
02:01:14.458 --> 02:01:15.619
Aren't you sleeping. brother?

2184
02:01:16.625 --> 02:01:18.505
I am feeling sleepy.
but I am not able to sleep.

2185
02:01:19.167 --> 02:01:20.167
Please go and sleep.

2186
02:01:21.542 --> 02:01:22.542
Are you hungry. brother?

2187
02:01:22.958 --> 02:01:24.083
You want to eat anything?

2188
02:01:24.208 --> 02:01:25.248
No. I don't want anything.

2189
02:01:31.125 --> 02:01:34.750
Did he tell you what we're
going to name the child. brother?

2190
02:01:35.708 --> 02:01:37.042
Yes. he told me.

2191
02:01:39.083 --> 02:01:40.083
It's my name.

2192
02:01:44.958 --> 02:01:45.958
You go and sleep.

2193
02:01:50.083 --> 02:01:51.083
Okay. brother.

2194
02:01:51.458 --> 02:01:53.208
If you need anything. call me.

2195
02:01:53.292 --> 02:01:54.292
Yes.

2196
02:02:39.917 --> 02:02:41.500
<i>Who?</i>

2197
02:02:41.583 --> 02:02:43.667
<i>Who is he?</i>

2198
02:02:43.750 --> 02:02:45.792
<i>Kith or kin</i>

2199
02:02:45.875 --> 02:02:47.417
<i>Wonder who he is?</i>

2200
02:02:53.042 --> 02:02:54.625
<i>Affection</i>

2201
02:02:54.708 --> 02:02:57.333
<i>Unconditional affection. he giveth!</i>

2202
02:02:57.417 --> 02:03:01.167
<i>Wonder who he is?</i>

2203
02:03:06.125 --> 02:03:09.875
<i>The tender. infinite. pure affection</i>

2204
02:03:09.958 --> 02:03:13.458
<i>I lost!</i>

2205
02:03:19.208 --> 02:03:23.000
<i>From the bond
I always yearned for</i>

2206
02:03:23.083 --> 02:03:27.375
<i>I drift away</i>

2207
02:03:36.625 --> 02:03:38.292
<i>Who?</i>

2208
02:03:38.375 --> 02:03:40.458
<i>Who is he?</i>

2209
02:03:40.542 --> 02:03:42.625
<i>Kith or kin</i>

2210
02:03:42.708 --> 02:03:44.458
<i>Wonder who he is?</i>

2211
02:03:44.833 --> 02:03:47.042
<i>Unexpectedly</i>

2212
02:03:47.125 --> 02:03:51.417
<i>Overflowing with a mother's love!</i>

2213
02:03:51.500 --> 02:03:55.458
<i>Who is he?</i>

2214
02:04:38.500 --> 02:04:41.750
<i>The bane is the boon</i>

2215
02:04:42.750 --> 02:04:47.042
<i>The swirl of life that haunts me</i>

2216
02:04:47.292 --> 02:04:51.583
<i>A coward's legs today</i>

2217
02:04:52.625 --> 02:04:55.958
<i>Fall. laden with the truth</i>

2218
02:04:56.042 --> 02:04:59.500
<i>I am a stagnated pool of water</i>

2219
02:05:00.333 --> 02:05:04.458
<i>Your shower of boundless mercy is enough</i>

2220
02:05:04.708 --> 02:05:08.042
<i>My heart. a sinner</i>

2221
02:05:08.125 --> 02:05:13.083
<i>Set's me ablaze!</i>

2222
02:05:13.417 --> 02:05:17.792
<i>Without dissolving in the rain!</i>

2223
02:05:17.875 --> 02:05:21.958
<i>The mountain stands forever tall</i>

2224
02:05:22.167 --> 02:05:29.167
<i>The sky never falls
With the raindrop!</i>

2225
02:05:30.875 --> 02:05:35.333
<i>I fall as a lie and lose</i>

2226
02:05:35.417 --> 02:05:39.542
<i>In front of the truth
That you embody</i>

2227
02:05:39.625 --> 02:05:43.833
<i>This unparalleled affection</i>

2228
02:05:43.958 --> 02:05:47.375
<i>When will I witness?</i>

2229
02:05:47.500 --> 02:05:49.125
<i>- Who?
- Who?</i>

2230
02:05:49.208 --> 02:05:51.292
<i>- Who is he?
- Who is he?</i>

2231
