<i>- Unexpectedly
- Unexpectedly</i>

2241
02:06:15.417 --> 02:06:19.625
<i>- Overflowing with a mother's love!
- Overflowing with a mother's love!</i>

2242
02:06:19.708 --> 02:06:24.000
<i>- Who is he?
- Who is he?</i>

2243
02:06:38.583 --> 02:06:41.500
HAIL LORD SHIVA

2244
02:06:54.958 --> 02:06:55.958
Brother.

2245
02:06:57.625 --> 02:06:59.875
<i>Come. leave your slippers here.
buy some flowers and go.</i>

2246
02:07:03.833 --> 02:07:05.268
Why. brother?
After coming this close.

2247
02:07:05.292 --> 02:07:07.252
you're going back
without going inside the temple?

2248
02:07:09.292 --> 02:07:11.333
Brother. it's okay
if you don't buy flowers.

2249
02:07:11.417 --> 02:07:12.726
but just go inside.
and offer your prayers.

2250
02:07:12.750 --> 02:07:13.910
It's an auspicious day today.

2251
02:07:17.125 --> 02:07:18.125
I haven't had a bath.

2252
02:07:18.625 --> 02:07:21.167
So what!
You're going to see our God. after all.

2253
02:07:21.250 --> 02:07:22.268
Why do you need
cleanliness for that?

2254
02:07:22.292 --> 02:07:23.625
God won't get angry. you go!

2255
02:07:26.250 --> 02:07:27.250
Where is the bus stand?

2256
02:07:29.083 --> 02:07:30.458
Where do you have to go?

2257
02:07:31.083 --> 02:07:33.059
The bus that goes to Thiruvarur.
will not pass from here.

2258
02:07:33.083 --> 02:07:34.851
It will come up to Anna's statue
and then take a turn.

2259
02:07:34.875 --> 02:07:38.500
I need to go to Madras.
Actually. any place is fine.

2260
02:07:39.417 --> 02:07:40.657
I just need to leave from here.

2261
02:07:41.375 --> 02:07:44.250
Every ten minutes. there is a bus
to Thanjavur. It will stop here.

2262
02:07:44.375 --> 02:07:45.792
- But…
- Thanjavur works.

2263
02:07:56.833 --> 02:07:58.042
Can you do me a favor?

2264
02:07:58.958 --> 02:08:02.208
When you go inside the temple.
just take a few flowers and…

2265
02:08:02.333 --> 02:08:03.393
You want me to do an offering?

2266
02:08:03.417 --> 02:08:04.417
Yes.

2267
02:08:04.542 --> 02:08:05.542
In whose name?

2268
02:08:10.667 --> 02:08:11.667
I don't know the name.

2269
02:08:13.458 --> 02:08:14.625
Do it in the name of God.

2270
02:08:23.125 --> 02:08:24.125
Brother.

2271
02:08:24.875 --> 02:08:26.833
till the bus comes.
why don't you sit here?

2272
02:08:26.958 --> 02:08:27.958
It's alright.

2273
02:08:48.958 --> 02:08:50.250
Will you have tea. brother?

2274
02:08:50.958 --> 02:08:52.083
- No.
- Why not?

2275
02:08:53.667 --> 02:08:54.667
The bus will come.

2276
02:08:54.750 --> 02:08:57.000
So what?
You can go on the next bus.

2277
02:08:59.083 --> 02:09:00.163
I haven't brushed my teeth.

2278
02:09:02.583 --> 02:09:03.904
So you haven't
brushed your teeth.

2279
02:09:04.875 --> 02:09:06.876
Without even brushing your teeth.
or taking a bath.

2280
02:09:07.250 --> 02:09:09.167
why are you in a hurry
to go to Madras?

2281
02:09:56.792 --> 02:09:57.792
Hey!

2282
02:09:58.042 --> 02:09:59.750
When did you come?
You never called.

2283
02:11:34.125 --> 02:11:35.333
What happened to you. Arul?

2284
02:11:36.583 --> 02:11:38.667
You don't seem alright
ever since you came back.

2285
02:11:39.958 --> 02:11:41.167
Did something happen there?

2286
02:11:47.417 --> 02:11:49.042
What happened to you. tell me?

2287
02:11:53.083 --> 02:11:54.917
Hema. I told you I met
someone there. right?

2288
02:11:55.542 --> 02:11:56.542
Yes.

2289
02:11:57.583 --> 02:11:59.292
He was so affectionate towards me.

2290
02:12:01.208 --> 02:12:03.958
Not just me. he's very
affectionate with everyone.

2291
02:12:06.167 --> 02:12:08.917
He remembers incidents that
happened so many years ago.

2292
02:12:11.333 --> 02:12:14.208
He worships the cycle that I gave
him unknowingly many years ago.

2293
02:12:17.792 --> 02:12:19.917
He takes care of his bull
like his own child.

2294
02:12:20.250 --> 02:12:21.667
He talks to everything…

2295
02:12:22.583 --> 02:12:24.458
The fish in the sea.
the birds on the tree.

2296
02:12:26.958 --> 02:12:30.125
He says he's going to name
his child after me.

2297
02:12:31.917 --> 02:12:33.333
But I don't know his name.

2298
02:12:35.667 --> 02:12:37.083
You call and talk to him. Arul.

2299
02:12:37.167 --> 02:12:38.327
How can I even do that. Hema?

2300
02:12:40.167 --> 02:12:41.167
He's right up here.

2301
02:12:42.917 --> 02:12:45.875
But I saw him as a nuisance.

2302
02:12:46.875 --> 02:12:49.750
He asked me for my mobile number.
I purposely gave him the wrong number.

2303
02:12:52.208 --> 02:12:53.833
I didn't even ask for his name.

2304
02:12:54.292 --> 02:12:55.412
I pretended like I knew him.

2305
02:12:56.792 --> 02:12:58.042
Actually. he's up there.

2306
02:12:59.125 --> 02:13:00.125
I am down here.

2307
02:13:02.667 --> 02:13:04.917
I am feeling ashamed
to even call and apologize to him.

2308
02:13:08.333 --> 02:13:09.333
Arul.

2309
02:13:23.542 --> 02:13:24.542
Stretch.

2310
02:13:43.958 --> 02:13:44.958
<i>Okay. uncle.</i>

2311
02:13:45.750 --> 02:13:46.750
Okay. uncle.

2312
02:13:46.958 --> 02:13:48.799
Not at all. uncle.
This itself is a huge favor.

2313
02:13:51.375 --> 02:13:53.292
Uncle. six months is
the maximum time I'll take.

2314
02:13:53.375 --> 02:13:54.736
But. I will return it before that.

2315
02:13:56.042 --> 02:13:57.042
Okay. uncle.

2316
02:13:57.250 --> 02:13:58.958
Thank you.
Thank you. Bye.

2317
02:14:00.333 --> 02:14:01.333
All good?

2318
02:14:01.500 --> 02:14:03.301
Just wait. this won't be enough.
We need more.

2319
02:14:03.542 --> 02:14:04.662
Exactly how much do we need?

2320
02:14:06.042 --> 02:14:07.208
We need another 25 lakhs.

2321
02:14:13.458 --> 02:14:14.292
How much do you need?

2322
02:14:14.375 --> 02:14:16.167
Sir. I need around 25 lakhs.

2323
02:14:16.667 --> 02:14:17.667
When do you need it?

2324
02:14:17.917 --> 02:14:20.250
Sir. whenever you give it. it's fine.

2325
02:14:20.333 --> 02:14:22.167
Okay. as soon as possible.

2326
02:14:23.583 --> 02:14:24.624
You will return it. right?

2327
02:14:24.958 --> 02:14:25.958
What. sir!

2328
02:14:27.042 --> 02:14:28.333
Just say you will return it!

2329
02:14:29.083 --> 02:14:30.292
I'll surely return it. sir.

2330
02:14:30.583 --> 02:14:34.333
Sorry. in fact. I did not want to ask you.

2331
02:14:34.417 --> 02:14:37.625
Actually. you should say sorry
only for not buying a house till now.

2332
02:14:38.000 --> 02:14:39.083
<i>I've asked you.</i>

2333
02:14:39.167 --> 02:14:41.500
so many times why haven't
you bought a house yet.

2334
02:14:42.167 --> 02:14:43.167
Yes. sir.

2335
02:14:44.083 --> 02:14:45.604
Then. if not me.
who else will you ask?

2336
02:14:45.708 --> 02:14:47.125
Okay. sir! Thank you. sir!

2337
02:15:15.083 --> 02:15:17.000
Is this that "nameless" uncle's number?

2338
02:15:18.292 --> 02:15:19.612
Why are you digging through that?

2339
02:15:24.333 --> 02:15:28.167
Dad. please give me
your phone for a little while.

2340
02:15:28.375 --> 02:15:29.417
Why?

2341
02:15:30.083 --> 02:15:32.208
I want to call my friend.

2342
02:15:34.000 --> 02:15:35.000
Here.

2343
02:15:37.417 --> 02:15:38.500
Do you know the passcode?

2344
02:15:38.750 --> 02:15:39.750
I know all that.

2345
02:15:40.583 --> 02:15:41.583
Brat!

2346
02:15:56.875 --> 02:15:58.375
Dad. there's a call!

2347
02:15:59.167 --> 02:16:00.167
Who is it?

2348
02:16:00.417 --> 02:16:01.417
I don't know. talk!

2349
02:16:01.917 --> 02:16:02.917
Hello.

2350
02:16:03.333 --> 02:16:04.333
<i>Live prosperously!</i>

2351
02:16:04.375 --> 02:16:05.667
<i>Ezhil garments. tell me.</i>

2352
02:16:08.667 --> 02:16:09.667
Talk!

2353
02:16:11.875 --> 02:16:15.417
Hello. I am Arul. from Madras.

2354
02:16:16.250 --> 02:16:17.250
<i>Athaan!</i>

2355
02:16:17.667 --> 02:16:18.667
<i>Athaan!</i>

2356
02:16:18.750 --> 02:16:19.875
How are you. <i>Athaan?</i>

2357
02:16:20.250 --> 02:16:22.125
Just five minutes ago.
I was talking about you.

2358
02:16:22.292 --> 02:16:23.667
<i>You'll live for 95 years!</i>

2359
02:16:24.167 --> 02:16:25.167
<i>Your watch. right?</i>

2360
02:16:25.458 --> 02:16:27.708
You left it in the bathroom.
I've kept it safely.

2361
02:16:28.000 --> 02:16:29.840
I have also kept
your slippers safely in a bag.

2362
02:16:30.042 --> 02:16:33.000
<i>What is this. Athaan? You just left
in anger. without even telling us.</i>

2363
02:16:33.750 --> 02:16:35.750
<i>It's my Fault. I told you
to sleep but I slept off!</i>

2364
02:16:36.375 --> 02:16:37.833
As soon as I woke up. I called you.

2365
02:16:38.167 --> 02:16:39.500
Someone else answered the call.

2366
02:16:40.125 --> 02:16:41.583
I tried again.

2367
02:16:42.333 --> 02:16:44.518
<i>but the same person answered.
yelled at me. and hung up.</i>

2368
02:16:44.542 --> 02:16:45.750
Then I asked Sokku uncle.

2369
02:16:46.250 --> 02:16:47.268
He just shut me up. saying.

2370
02:16:47.292 --> 02:16:48.458
"Stop troubling him."

2371
02:16:48.583 --> 02:16:49.583
Is he a baby?

2372
02:16:49.625 --> 02:16:51.208
"Won't he know to go back himself?"

2373
02:16:52.250 --> 02:16:54.042
I felt that I really troubled you.

2374
02:16:55.792 --> 02:16:56.952
Whose number is this. <i>Athaan?</i>

2375
02:16:58.542 --> 02:16:59.542
This is my number.

2376
02:17:00.375 --> 02:17:01.375
How are you?

2377
02:17:01.667 --> 02:17:02.958
Me? I am perfectly fine.

2378
02:17:03.208 --> 02:17:04.208
So whose number is that?

2379
02:17:05.542 --> 02:17:06.625
That…

2380
02:17:07.750 --> 02:17:08.917
I gave you the wrong number.

2381
02:17:09.375 --> 02:17:11.167
How can you go wrong
with your own number?

2382
02:17:11.500 --> 02:17:14.220
I must have noted it down wrongly
since I was excited about the food.

2383
02:17:15.833 --> 02:17:17.917
Actually. I want to ask you something.

2384
02:17:18.542 --> 02:17:19.542
Tell me.

2385
02:17:20.917 --> 02:17:22.226
I should have asked you
at Needamangalam. itself.

2386
02:17:22.250 --> 02:17:23.250
But couldn't.

2387
02:17:23.542 --> 02:17:25.917
I thought of asking you after coming here.

2388
02:17:26.000 --> 02:17:30.542
But there was an emergency situation.
So. I had to arrange something.

2389
02:17:31.583 --> 02:17:33.417
That's why I couldn't call earlier.

2390
02:17:34.083 --> 02:17:35.163
Have you made arrangements?

2391
02:17:37.458 --> 02:17:41.250
Sokku uncle told me that
you were in need of money.

2392
02:17:41.417 --> 02:17:42.893
and you're running
around trying to arrange it.

2393
02:17:42.917 --> 02:17:44.000
Have you made arrangements?

2394
02:17:44.750 --> 02:17:46.458
Why did he tell you?

2395
02:17:48.625 --> 02:17:49.833
I am not talking about that.

2396
02:17:50.500 --> 02:17:52.792
<i>Athaan.</i> is everyone fine at home?

2397
02:17:53.375 --> 02:17:54.456
No one's in trouble. right?

2398
02:17:55.000 --> 02:17:57.360
No. no. everyone's fine.
It's not that kind of an emergency.

2399
02:17:57.500 --> 02:18:01.125
We are trying to buy
the house we are currently residing in.

2400
02:18:01.208 --> 02:18:03.583
I was busy making
arrangements for that.

2401
02:18:04.167 --> 02:18:07.208
Thank god! I got worried
that it was something serious.

2402
02:18:07.417 --> 02:18:09.625
To buy a house?
This is good news.

2403
02:18:10.000 --> 02:18:11.976
When Sokku uncle told me.
I calculated and checked. <i>Athaan.</i>

2404
02:18:12.000 --> 02:18:13.667
I have 15 lakhs in cash ready with me.

2405
02:18:15.042 --> 02:18:15.875
Look.

2406
02:18:15.958 --> 02:18:18.000
I want to talk to you
about something else.

2407
02:18:18.250 --> 02:18:19.601
It's definitely not about the money.

2408
02:18:19.625 --> 02:18:22.083
Why? You can't call
and ask me for money?

2409
02:18:22.250 --> 02:18:23.893
Then how will I repay for
all that you've done for me?

2410
02:18:23.917 --> 02:18:25.375
When you gave us. didn't we take it?

2411
02:18:25.458 --> 02:18:27.259
Now when we are giving it.
you should take it!

2412
02:18:29.458 --> 02:18:30.458
See.

2413
02:18:30.625 --> 02:18:32.542
I have 15 lakhs in cash ready with me.

2414
02:18:32.750 --> 02:18:34.143
If we pledge the jewelry
we have in the bank…

2415
02:18:34.167 --> 02:18:35.958
Don't pledge the jewelry.

2416
02:18:36.042 --> 02:18:37.851
I am telling you I don't even
want the money and you're…

2417
02:18:37.875 --> 02:18:39.792
Relax. <i>Athaan.</i> allow me to speak!

2418
02:18:39.875 --> 02:18:42.196
Your sister is the one who
suggested we pledge the jewelry.

2419
02:18:42.333 --> 02:18:44.809
If we pledge the jewelry in the bank.
we will get around five lakhs.

2420
02:18:44.833 --> 02:18:47.083
For the balance five.
I can ask the chit-fund guys.

2421
02:18:47.167 --> 02:18:48.726
If we tell them we require
it for an emergency.

2422
02:18:48.750 --> 02:18:49.934
they will immediately give it.

2423
02:18:49.958 --> 02:18:53.917
So. five and another five make it 25.
Is 25 enough. <i>Athaan?</i>

2424
02:18:54.583 --> 02:18:57.333
<i>Athaan.</i> we can even ask for a loan
from the co-operative society.

2425
02:18:58.375 --> 02:18:59.375
Thanks a lot.

2426
02:18:59.792 --> 02:19:02.684
But I don't need it. I've already made
arrangements. Now just listen to me.

2427
02:19:02.708 --> 02:19:04.726
After telling you all this. if you
still don't take the money from me.

2428
02:19:04.750 --> 02:19:06.333
I'll never speak to you again.

2429
02:19:08.042 --> 02:19:09.042
Okay. I'll take it.

2430
02:19:10.875 --> 02:19:12.075
Now will you allow me to talk?

2431
02:19:12.833 --> 02:19:13.833
Okay. tell me.

2432
02:19:21.000 --> 02:19:22.000
I…

2433
02:19:22.917 --> 02:19:23.917
You…

2434
02:19:28.583 --> 02:19:30.208
I don't know where to start.

2435
02:19:31.208 --> 02:19:32.208
What. <i>Athaan?</i>

2436
02:19:33.792 --> 02:19:35.458
I gave you the wrong phone number.

2437
02:19:37.542 --> 02:19:38.542
Wrong number?

2438
02:19:39.708 --> 02:19:43.042
I purposely gave
you the wrong number.

2439
02:19:43.583 --> 02:19:44.583
Why. <i>Athaan?</i>

2440
02:19:46.250 --> 02:19:47.583
I don't know you.

2441
02:19:48.875 --> 02:19:50.208
I don't know your name.

2442
02:19:51.792 --> 02:19:54.152
I was thinking. "Why should I give
my number to a stranger?"

2443
02:19:56.875 --> 02:19:58.155
That's why I gave the wrong one.

2444
02:20:02.500 --> 02:20:03.500
Hello!

2445
02:20:05.667 --> 02:20:06.667
Can you hear me?

2446
02:20:06.792 --> 02:20:07.792
I can hear you. <i>Athaan.</i>

2447
02:20:11.292 --> 02:20:12.708
Even now I don't know who you are.

2448
02:20:15.667 --> 02:20:18.427
You went on calling me <i>Athaan</i>
with affection and a sense of belonging.

2449
02:20:21.125 --> 02:20:22.167
I couldn't tell you…

2450
02:20:22.500 --> 02:20:24.458
that… I don't know you.

2451
02:20:25.708 --> 02:20:26.708
I just couldn't ask you.

2452
02:20:28.333 --> 02:20:29.894
<i>Moreover. you were
with me all the time.</i>

2453
02:20:31.917 --> 02:20:33.437
<i>So. I couldn't ask
anyone else as well.</i>

2454
02:20:35.750 --> 02:20:38.333
An entire night at your house.

2455
02:20:39.542 --> 02:20:41.333
without knowing who you were…

2456
02:20:44.375 --> 02:20:45.583
I felt really bad.

2457
02:20:49.083 --> 02:20:50.667
Like I had committed a big mistake.

2458
02:20:53.375 --> 02:20:54.375
It definitely is…

2459
02:20:56.542 --> 02:20:57.542
a big mistake.

2460
02:21:01.250 --> 02:21:02.708
I managed to some extent.

2461
02:21:06.583 --> 02:21:08.903
<i>but when you said you're going
to name your child after me.</i>

2462
02:21:09.958 --> 02:21:11.708
And you said the next
morning I have to call

2463
02:21:12.625 --> 02:21:14.792
all three of you by your
names and bless you…

2464
02:21:15.333 --> 02:21:16.458
I froze!

2465
02:21:21.833 --> 02:21:23.417
I couldn't handle your love.

2466
02:21:25.375 --> 02:21:27.208
that's why without
even telling you.

2467
02:21:28.333 --> 02:21:29.373
I ran away from the house.

2468
02:21:33.375 --> 02:21:35.167
You. really don't know
who I am. <i>Athaan?</i>

2469
02:21:38.750 --> 02:21:40.417
I may not know your name.

2470
02:21:41.625 --> 02:21:43.417
I may have forgotten
how I am related to you.

2471
02:21:45.625 --> 02:21:47.292
but I know who the real you is.

2472
02:21:48.500 --> 02:21:49.500
<i>Forget that.</i>

2473
02:21:51.333 --> 02:21:53.292
I figured out who I am
only because of you.

2474
02:21:55.208 --> 02:21:56.208
This is the truth.

2475
02:22:08.708 --> 02:22:10.042
Even now you don't know. <i>Athaan?</i>

2476
02:22:13.750 --> 02:22:14.750
I don't know.

2477
02:22:16.917 --> 02:22:17.917
Please forgive me.

2478
02:22:18.667 --> 02:22:19.750
Don't say all that. <i>Athaan.</i>

2479
02:22:21.792 --> 02:22:23.625
Just a minute. just a minute. <i>Athaan.</i>

2480
02:22:31.375 --> 02:22:32.375
Hello!

2481
02:22:35.208 --> 02:22:36.208
Hey!

2482
02:22:36.917 --> 02:22:37.917
Are you crying?

2483
02:22:42.708 --> 02:22:43.708
Forget it. it's alright.

2484
02:22:45.250 --> 02:22:46.667
I made a huge mistake.

2485
02:22:48.042 --> 02:22:49.042
forgive me.

2486
02:22:50.417 --> 02:22:51.792
Don't say all that. <i>Athaan.</i>

2487
02:22:52.583 --> 02:22:54.500
At least now you
felt like finding out.

2488
02:22:55.583 --> 02:22:56.583
Do you really want to?

2489
02:22:58.125 --> 02:22:59.583
I feel like hearing it from you.

2490
02:22:59.958 --> 02:23:02.500
You might be busy.
let's talk later. <i>Athaan.</i>

2491
02:23:03.583 --> 02:23:05.292
There is no work more
important than this.

2492
02:23:05.833 --> 02:23:06.917
Please tell me.

2493
02:23:07.667 --> 02:23:08.875
Tell me. you have forgiven me.

2494
02:23:09.333 --> 02:23:10.333
I'll tell you that.

2495
02:23:10.542 --> 02:23:13.083
but you should promise
to come here again and see me.

2496
02:23:15.167 --> 02:23:17.542
I promise I'll come. dear.
I'll come tomorrow itself.

2497
02:23:18.042 --> 02:23:19.417
Please tell me
you've forgiven me.

2498
02:23:20.000 --> 02:23:21.750
Don't say such big words. <i>Athaan.</i>

2499
02:23:23.083 --> 02:23:24.333
I might just die.

2500
02:23:25.583 --> 02:23:26.833
Just say you've forgiven me.

2501
02:23:27.333 --> 02:23:29.125
You too forgive me. <i>Athaan.</i>

2502
02:23:29.750 --> 02:23:30.750
Why?

2503
02:23:31.000 --> 02:23:32.958
I knew that the bus which
was going to Chennai.

2504
02:23:33.792 --> 02:23:35.708
was leaving at 09:00 p.m.. <i>Athaan.</i>

2505
02:23:36.625 --> 02:23:37.667
Despite that.

2506
02:23:38.125 --> 02:23:40.792
if you had left then. I wasn't sure
when you would come again.

2507
02:23:41.625 --> 02:23:43.833
I wanted you to see
Bhuvana's wedding

2508
02:23:44.208 --> 02:23:46.667
<i>and wished for you
to stay with me for a day.</i>

2509
02:23:47.375 --> 02:23:48.750
<i>So what was to be 09:00 p.m..</i>

2510
02:23:49.625 --> 02:23:52.375
I made it 10:00 p.m.
I told you a tiny lie. <i>Athaan.</i>

2511
02:23:53.042 --> 02:23:54.250
It wasn't planned. <i>Athaan.</i>

2512
02:23:54.333 --> 02:23:55.333
At that moment…

2513
02:23:56.375 --> 02:23:57.375
Hey!

2514
02:23:58.500 --> 02:24:01.583
You can lie about your phone number.
can't I lie about the bus timing?

2515
02:24:01.667 --> 02:24:03.351
Why one set of rules for you
and another set of rules for me?

2516
02:24:03.375 --> 02:24:04.458
Now it's fair and square.

2517
02:24:04.542 --> 02:24:05.583
I'll also forgive you.

2518
02:24:06.208 --> 02:24:07.792
Okay. I will spare you.

2519
02:24:08.667 --> 02:24:09.667
Now tell me your name.

2520
02:24:11.958 --> 02:24:12.958
Do you remember…

2521
02:24:13.375 --> 02:24:15.292
your summer holidays of '94?

2522
02:24:15.458 --> 02:24:16.500
Your tenth-grade vacation?

2523
02:24:17.542 --> 02:24:19.458
I don't remember anything
much about the past.

2524
02:24:19.625 --> 02:24:21.385
But you go on.
I may remember as you narrate.

2525
02:24:21.750 --> 02:24:25.542
Okay. I'll come to that later.
First. I'll tell you who I am.

2526
02:24:25.875 --> 02:24:26.875
Okay.

2527
02:24:27.917 --> 02:24:29.309
I am no big star like
Rajinikanth or Kamal Haasan.

2528
02:24:29.333 --> 02:24:30.726
to tell you about myself in one word.

2529
02:24:30.750 --> 02:24:32.792
It will be slightly elaborate.
is that okay?

2530
02:24:33.042 --> 02:24:34.042
Okay. now just tell me!

2531
02:24:35.375 --> 02:24:36.958
Your mother's mother.

2532
02:24:37.375 --> 02:24:38.750
who is from Kumbakonam.

2533
02:24:39.125 --> 02:24:41.333
was born with three siblings.

2534
02:24:42.333 --> 02:24:43.333
Hello!

2535
02:24:43.750 --> 02:24:44.833
I am listening.

2536
02:24:45.083 --> 02:24:46.476
Make some sounds
of acknowledgment. <i>Athaan.</i>

2537
02:24:46.500 --> 02:24:48.300
Only then will I have
the interest to narrate.

2538
02:24:52.333 --> 02:24:56.625
So. your late great-grandparents.
Maruthamuthu and Jagadambal.

2539
02:24:56.708 --> 02:24:57.958
had four children.

2540
02:24:58.167 --> 02:25:01.167
Sivagnanam. Janagam. Gopu.
and Padma. Am I right?

2541
02:25:03.125 --> 02:25:04.833
Janagam is your grandmother.

2542
02:25:05.083 --> 02:25:07.833
Your mother. your uncle.
and all your aunts were born to her.

2543
02:25:09.208 --> 02:25:10.333
Hey. I know all that.

2544
02:25:10.458 --> 02:25:12.375
Wow! Not bad!

2545
02:25:12.750 --> 02:25:15.333
So. Janagam granny's brother.
Sivagnanam grandpa.

2546
02:25:15.458 --> 02:25:17.042
had four children.

2547
02:25:17.417 --> 02:25:21.000
Paneerselvam. Angamma.
Banumathy and Vijayalakshmi.

2548
02:25:21.292 --> 02:25:23.833
That Angamma is my mother.

2549
02:25:25.125 --> 02:25:26.125
Superb.

2550
02:25:26.458 --> 02:25:27.601
Now will you tell me your name?

2551
02:25:27.625 --> 02:25:29.833
Wait! I've only told
you half of the story.

2552
02:25:30.417 --> 02:25:32.083
Now let's start again from the beginning.

2553
02:25:32.958 --> 02:25:36.333
Your mother's father.
as in. your grandfather's there. right?

2554
02:25:37.458 --> 02:25:38.458
He "was" there.

2555
02:25:39.042 --> 02:25:40.042
Is that so?

2556
02:25:40.458 --> 02:25:43.167
Okay. your grandfather
was born with six siblings.

2557
02:25:43.458 --> 02:25:44.667
One of them was Gurunathar.

2558
02:25:45.167 --> 02:25:47.250
That Gurunathar had three kids.

2559
02:25:47.500 --> 02:25:49.833
Santhanam. Kanakavalli.
and Loganathan.

2560
02:25:50.250 --> 02:25:51.958
That Santhanam is my father.

2561
02:25:52.625 --> 02:25:53.625
Okay.

2562
02:25:53.875 --> 02:25:59.625
Your granny was the matchmaker
who got them married.

2563
02:26:00.125 --> 02:26:01.125
Superb.

2564
02:26:01.292 --> 02:26:03.375
My brother and I were born to them.

2565
02:26:03.708 --> 02:26:05.509
Now at least you can
tell me your name. right?

2566
02:26:05.708 --> 02:26:07.059
It's not like you'll lose anything!

2567
02:26:07.083 --> 02:26:08.083
Wait. hang on!

2568
02:26:08.125 --> 02:26:10.086
We are almost there.
just a little bit more to go.

2569
02:26:10.292 --> 02:26:13.333
Now let's go back to '94.

2570
02:26:16.833 --> 02:26:20.542
I can never forget that year
for many reasons. <i>Athaan.</i>

2571
02:26:21.208 --> 02:26:23.500
<i>For the first time. we traveled
outside Needamangalam.</i>

2572
02:26:23.750 --> 02:26:25.991
<i>For the first time. we had
gotten into an outstation bus.</i>

2573
02:26:26.042 --> 02:26:29.083
<i>For the first time. we were
coming to Thanjavur to your house.</i>

2574
02:26:29.667 --> 02:26:31.434
<i>All through the journey.
my father advised me.</i>

2575
02:26:31.458 --> 02:26:34.500
<i>"You shouldn't shout. nor fight.
nor dig your nose.</i>

2576
02:26:34.583 --> 02:26:36.250
<i>nor talk in the village dialect."</i>

2577
02:26:36.333 --> 02:26:38.476
<i>He was laying down so many
conditions while coming there.</i>

2578
02:26:38.500 --> 02:26:41.184
At that time. you had just finished
your tenth grade and were confused.

2579
02:26:41.208 --> 02:26:44.329
about whether to join polytechnic college
or complete your 11th and 12th grade.

2580
02:26:44.833 --> 02:26:47.042
<i>But you used to always call
me aside and talk to me.</i>

2581
02:26:47.458 --> 02:26:49.292
<i>Wherever you went.
you took me along.</i>

2582
02:26:50.583 --> 02:26:53.167
<i>You used to play with
us kids. at our level.</i>

2583
02:26:53.958 --> 02:26:55.792
<i>You used to teach
us a lot of new things.</i>

2584
02:26:57.042 --> 02:26:59.458
<i>You weren't like this then.
you used to always be cheerful.</i>

2585
02:27:01.375 --> 02:27:03.125
You used to talk to everyone so kindly.

2586
02:27:03.625 --> 02:27:05.292
I learned that from you. <i>Athaan.</i>

2587
02:27:05.917 --> 02:27:06.917
Really?

2588
02:27:07.583 --> 02:27:08.625
Was I like that?

2589
02:27:09.292 --> 02:27:10.458
I swear on you!

2590
02:27:10.667 --> 02:27:11.667
Oh. no! I believe you.

2591
02:27:12.042 --> 02:27:13.042
See. finally.

2592
02:27:13.375 --> 02:27:14.417
not just about you.

2593
02:27:14.708 --> 02:27:16.588
but I have even found out
about myself from you.

2594
02:27:20.917 --> 02:27:22.997
You're the one who first
took me to a cinema theater.

2595
02:27:23.042 --> 02:27:25.958
<i>At Kumaran Cinema Theater. we saw the</i>
<i>matinee show of</i> Veetla Visheshanga.

2596
02:27:26.125 --> 02:27:29.458
<i>Even though you had already
seen it. you took us again.</i>

2597
02:27:30.167 --> 02:27:32.847
<i>How I wasn't tall enough and
used to keep adjusting to see the film.</i>

2598
02:27:32.875 --> 02:27:35.417
<i>How you got us ice cream
and popcorn during the interval.</i>

2599
02:27:35.708 --> 02:27:37.083
<i>The smell of the cinema theater.</i>

2600
02:27:37.500 --> 02:27:38.917
<i>I can't forget anything. Athaan!</i>

2601
02:27:40.042 --> 02:27:41.282
<i>Even now when I think about it…</i>

2602
02:27:42.875 --> 02:27:45.235
But I am not able to figure out
whether I actually remember.

2603
02:27:45.292 --> 02:27:47.612
or because you're narrating
I am imagining that I remember.

2604
02:27:48.125 --> 02:27:50.542
Okay. listen. this is
the most important part.

2605
02:27:50.833 --> 02:27:54.042
<i>There were eight of us. all small kids.</i>

2606
02:27:54.458 --> 02:27:56.250
<i>Unable to manage
all of us at home…</i>

2607
02:27:56.333 --> 02:27:59.333
<i>They sent us with you to the market.</i>

2608
02:27:59.417 --> 02:28:01.167
<i>All of us would hold hands and follow you.</i>

2609
02:28:01.292 --> 02:28:03.750
We used to compete amongst ourselves
to hold your hand.

2610
02:28:06.125 --> 02:28:07.125
Okay.

2611
02:28:07.458 --> 02:28:10.226
To keep us under control you used to
do something till we reached the shop.

2612
02:28:10.250 --> 02:28:12.292
do you remember what that was?

2613
02:28:12.792 --> 02:28:14.542
No. what was it?

2614
02:28:14.708 --> 02:28:17.417
You'd name each one
of us after a vegetable.

2615
02:28:17.958 --> 02:28:20.417
And till we reached the shop
we had to keep repeating.

2616
02:28:20.500 --> 02:28:23.000
how much of that vegetable
we were going to buy.

2617
02:28:23.083 --> 02:28:24.000
Cabbage. one kilo.

2618
02:28:24.083 --> 02:28:26.375
- What vegetable are you?
- Potato. two kilos.

2619
02:28:26.792 --> 02:28:27.708
The last one?

2620
02:28:27.792 --> 02:28:29.333
Small Onion. three kilos.

2621
02:28:35.458 --> 02:28:37.000
Green Chili for five rupees.

2622
02:28:37.083 --> 02:28:38.167
Ladyfinger. one kilo.

2623
02:28:38.250 --> 02:28:39.893
Like this. we would keep
repeating it and walking.

2624
02:28:39.917 --> 02:28:40.917
In that group.

2625
02:28:41.375 --> 02:28:43.792
Priya was the Green Chili.

2626
02:28:44.000 --> 02:28:45.000
and Ganesh was?

2627
02:28:45.667 --> 02:28:46.667
Beans!

2628
02:28:46.750 --> 02:28:48.917
That's more like it!
You remember now.

2629
02:28:49.000 --> 02:28:50.833
Meena's name was Big Onion.

2630
02:28:50.917 --> 02:28:52.875
Ranji's name was Small Onion.

2631
02:28:53.375 --> 02:28:55.250
Yes. Ramya was Ladyfinger.

2632
02:28:55.708 --> 02:28:57.000
and Saravanan was Turkey Berry.

2633
02:28:57.667 --> 02:28:58.667
Bhuvana? Balamurali?

2634
02:28:59.958 --> 02:29:02.875
Bhuvana was Tomato. no.
Balamurali was Tomato.

2635
02:29:03.250 --> 02:29:04.250
Bhuvana…

2636
02:29:07.292 --> 02:29:08.208
Bhuvana…

2637
02:29:08.292 --> 02:29:09.292
Shall I tell you?

2638
02:29:09.500 --> 02:29:11.208
No. no. don't. I will remember it.

2639
02:29:11.375 --> 02:29:12.696
Okay. countdown from one to five.

2640
02:29:13.875 --> 02:29:15.083
One…

2641
02:29:15.583 --> 02:29:17.292
- Wait.
<i>- Two.</i>

2642
02:29:17.542 --> 02:29:20.042
- Bhuvana was…
<i>- Three.</i>

2643
02:29:20.542 --> 02:29:21.625
Give me a clue.

2644
02:29:21.792 --> 02:29:24.125
You can eat that as a vegetable
and as a fruit.

2645
02:29:25.542 --> 02:29:26.542
Capsicum?

2646
02:29:26.667 --> 02:29:28.958
Wrong. Four.

2647
02:29:29.167 --> 02:29:30.542
<i>Four and one-fourth…</i>

2648
02:29:30.958 --> 02:29:32.167
<i>Four and a half…</i>

2649
02:29:32.417 --> 02:29:33.833
- Bhuvana…
<i>- Four and three-fourths…</i>

2650
02:29:33.917 --> 02:29:35.667
Plantain! Bhuvana was Plantain.

2651
02:29:35.833 --> 02:29:37.333
Superb. <i>Athaan!</i>

2652
02:29:37.958 --> 02:29:39.250
Oh. man!

2653
02:29:40.208 --> 02:29:41.417
Not done yet.

2654
02:29:41.750 --> 02:29:42.875
Who was Cabbage?

2655
02:29:43.667 --> 02:29:46.250
Wait. I know. Cabbage was…

2656
02:29:47.083 --> 02:29:48.708
that person's son…

2657
02:29:49.208 --> 02:29:50.750
I forgot his name.

2658
02:29:52.250 --> 02:29:54.000
Come on. you're pretty close.

2659
02:29:55.917 --> 02:29:58.167
That boy had a lovely name.

2660
02:29:58.917 --> 02:30:00.317
He also had two whorls on his head.

2661
02:30:00.458 --> 02:30:04.583
His name was Madhi… Madhi!

2662
02:30:05.917 --> 02:30:06.917
Madhiyazhagan.

2663
02:30:08.542 --> 02:30:10.625
Madhiyazhagan was Cabbage. Yes!

2664
02:30:11.708 --> 02:30:12.792
I wonder how he is now.

2665
02:30:13.208 --> 02:30:15.375
Nothing to worry about.
He's absolutely fine.

2666
02:30:16.500 --> 02:30:18.500
You remember Cabbage.

2667
02:30:18.833 --> 02:30:21.125
but you don't remember his
elder brother. Potato. right?

2668
02:30:21.500 --> 02:30:22.500
You are so mean. <i>Athaan!</i>

2669
02:30:35.458 --> 02:30:36.458
Hey!

2670
02:30:37.333 --> 02:30:38.333
Potato!

2671
02:30:40.417 --> 02:30:41.458
Hey! Potato!

2672
02:30:43.500 --> 02:30:44.500
Is it you?

2673
02:30:45.750 --> 02:30:46.750
Is it you?

2674
02:30:48.208 --> 02:30:49.542
Finally!

2675
02:30:49.958 --> 02:30:51.625
What a tube light you are. <i>Athaan!</i>

2676
02:30:54.250 --> 02:30:55.542
Hey. Potato!

2677
02:30:56.250 --> 02:30:58.625
That's me! Your Potato.

2678
02:31:00.583 --> 02:31:01.917
How are you?

2679
02:31:02.917 --> 02:31:04.667
Yeah. right! I am fine.

2680
02:31:05.250 --> 02:31:09.125
After talking for so long. now
you're asking me how I am? How silly!

2681
02:31:09.750 --> 02:31:11.292
Forgive me. forgive me!

2682
02:31:11.875 --> 02:31:15.333
Okay. now tell me my name.
I'll forgive you.

2683
02:31:16.000 --> 02:31:19.042
Potato. that's it.

2684
02:31:19.875 --> 02:31:21.458
Look at how you are dodging even now!

2685
02:31:21.917 --> 02:31:23.250
That's the name you gave me.

2686
02:31:23.750 --> 02:31:25.710
I am asking you about
the name my parents gave me.

2687
02:31:32.083 --> 02:31:34.250
I won't tell you.
You never made it easy either. right?

2688
02:31:35.208 --> 02:31:36.250
Look how you prolonged it!

2689
02:31:37.292 --> 02:31:38.958
You can only tell it if you know it!

2690
02:31:40.042 --> 02:31:42.250
You remember my brother's name.

2691
02:31:42.333 --> 02:31:43.893
but you don't remember my name. do you?

2692
02:31:44.250 --> 02:31:45.542
Who said I don't remember?

2693
02:31:46.250 --> 02:31:47.771
It's been a minute since I remembered.

2694
02:31:48.375 --> 02:31:49.559
Then behave yourself and tell me my name.

2695
02:31:49.583 --> 02:31:50.684
If you don't. I won't give you money.

2696
02:31:50.708 --> 02:31:51.708
Then don't.

2697
02:31:51.750 --> 02:31:52.583
Did I ask you for it?

2698
02:31:52.667 --> 02:31:53.976
You were the one who said you'd give.

2699
02:31:54.000 --> 02:31:56.667
Yes. exactly. I will give it to you.
and you have to take it.

2700
02:31:57.000 --> 02:31:59.292
That's my share for your house.
How can you refuse it?

2701
02:31:59.417 --> 02:32:00.500
Okay. give it.

2702
02:32:01.125 --> 02:32:01.958
I'll take it.

2703
02:32:02.042 --> 02:32:03.684
I'll take anything
you give me from now on.

2704
02:32:03.708 --> 02:32:06.250
That's right! That's my <i>Athaan!</i>

2705
02:32:06.625 --> 02:32:07.917
Okay. now tell me my name.

2706
02:32:08.792 --> 02:32:09.792
I won't tell you now.

2707
02:32:10.917 --> 02:32:11.917
If not now. then when?

2708
02:32:13.167 --> 02:32:14.167
Later.

2709
02:32:14.750 --> 02:32:15.750
When?

2710
02:32:16.042 --> 02:32:17.042
Hey!

2711
02:32:17.417 --> 02:32:20.375
I'll tell you!
Hang up. you Potato.

2712
02:32:43.833 --> 02:32:44.833
NEEDAMANGALAM

2713
02:32:57.708 --> 02:32:58.708
Come. brother.

2714
02:32:58.917 --> 02:32:59.917
Do you remember me?

2715
02:33:04.042 --> 02:33:05.042
Just do an offering.

2716
02:33:05.125 --> 02:33:06.125
In God's name?

2717
02:33:35.792 --> 02:33:36.792
Potato!

2718
02:33:37.833 --> 02:33:38.875
Potato!

2719
02:33:41.708 --> 02:33:42.708
Potato!

2720
02:33:43.833 --> 02:33:44.833
Hey. Potato!

2721
02:33:44.917 --> 02:33:45.917
Open the door.

2722
02:33:49.000 --> 02:33:50.000
Hey!

2723
02:33:50.208 --> 02:33:52.333
Enough now! I can't take it anymore!

2724
02:33:52.792 --> 02:33:53.917
Open the door.

2725
02:33:59.000 --> 02:34:00.721
I know you're on the other side
of the door.

2726
02:34:01.833 --> 02:34:03.875
Hey! Don't torture me. rascal!

2727
02:34:05.333 --> 02:34:06.333
Open the door!

2728
02:34:10.125 --> 02:34:12.708
Open the door. Meiyazhagan!

2729
02:34:25.375 --> 02:34:26.542
<i>Athaan!</i>

